  [
    id 3
    label "ExNIl8NjnWI"
    step 0
    date "2022-07-11T05:47:50Z"
    title "Get Up Shadowsight WARRIOR CATS Mini AMV/PMV"
    description "Oh boy I never thought this project would actually see the light of day &amp;#10;&amp;#10;This was started back in October 2021 I made the mistake of starting all the animated parts first and got burned out when they were both halfway finished and didn&amp;#8217;t touch the project for 9 months until I suddenly decided to pick it back up a couple days ago and I&amp;#8217;m quite happy to have it finished &amp;#10;&amp;#10;Scene: &amp;#10;On his way to the moonpool, Shadowsight is attacked by the imposter bramblestar and thrown into a ditch. Spiresights spirit watches over him as the clans search for him desperately. Spiresight finds Rootpaw and leads him to Shadowsights body. Rootpaw drags Shadowsight out of the ditch and back to the clans.  &amp;#10;&amp;#10;This is a scene from Veil Of Shadows and I think I can confidently say it&amp;#8217;s my favourite scene in the entirety of warrior cats I love how it was written when Rootpaw found Shadowsight in the ditch and dragged him out, this doesn&amp;#8217;t really depict what I love about the scene but it&amp;#8217;s good enough I&amp;#8217;d say &amp;#10;&amp;#10;I know dewspring was also there but he didn&amp;#8217;t fit into the concept so I scrapped his involvement oops sorry not sorry &amp;#10;&amp;#10;I really loved the broken code, only arc so far that&amp;#8217;s really been able to keep my attention with the characters and story writing, it&amp;#8217;s not a masterpiece but I enjoy it and I have a lot of ideas for projects relating to it so you can expect to mostly see Shadowsight when I make my own canon projects &amp;#10;&amp;#10;Credits: &amp;#10;&amp;#10;Art/animation: Crispytoes &amp;#10;Thumbnail sketch: https://twitter.com/sorryslonk?s=21&amp;#38;t=lGjyhm13TnGc_dZhrmgeog &amp;#10;Song: Johnny Boy by Twenty One Pilots &amp;#10;Characters: Erin Hunter &amp;#10;Designs: Gekkozilla&amp;#10;&amp;#10;My links: &amp;#10;&amp;#10;Commissions: https://docs.google.com/document/d/1Dw5c3BcEg0BGrnQTeEjs8mHReBhNuXv8y4FEoQJcBEo&amp;#10;Twitter: https://twitter.com/Crispytoes10&amp;#10;Instagram: https://instagram.com/crispietoes?igshid=YmMyMTA2M2Y=&amp;#10;Artfight: https://artfight.net/~Crispytoes"
    channeltitle "Crispytoes"
    channelid "UCb2esc4E0GyF23nDfyxuwqA"
