    date "2021-04-13T23:03:37Z"
    title "A Deep Dive Into The Warrior Cats Fandom"
    description "Let's talk about the edgy battle cats!&amp;#10;In today's video, we dive into the world of Warrior Cats- from the franchise, to the fandom, to all the drama within!&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#10084;&amp;#65038; &amp;#10084;&amp;#65038; Head to this link to enter the $500 Vitaly Jewellery Giveaway!!! &amp;#10084;&amp;#65038; &amp;#10084;&amp;#65038;&amp;#10;https://www.vitalydesign.com/pages/izzzyzzz&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Visit Vitaly&amp;#8217;s Instagram- www.instagram.com/vitaly&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Products featured in the video-&amp;#10;Akoya- https://www.vitalydesign.com/products/akoya?variant=32796683567179&amp;#10;Path- https://www.vitalydesign.com/products/path?variant=32989774610507&amp;#10;Resonator- https://www.vitalydesign.com/products/resonator?variant=30278510116939&amp;#10;Tensho- https://www.vitalydesign.com/products/tensho?variant=12268929056843&amp;#10;Graph- https://www.vitalydesign.com/products/graph?variant=32946296913995&amp;#10;Riot- https://www.vitalydesign.com/products/riot?variant=28009667297355&amp;#10;Frenzy- https://www.vitalydesign.com/products/frenzy?variant=31822105903179&amp;#10;Rey- https://www.vitalydesign.com/products/rey?variant=29243701657675&amp;#10;Perimeter- https://www.vitalydesign.com/products/perimeter?variant=30992177201227&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#10084;&amp;#65038; &amp;#10084;&amp;#65038;TIMESTAMPS &amp;#10084;&amp;#65038; &amp;#10084;&amp;#65038;&amp;#10;0:00 Introduction&amp;#10;0:40 Vitaly Giveaway&amp;#10;2:07 An Introduction To The Series&amp;#10;14:24 The Fandom&amp;#10;33:40 Warrior Cats Drama&amp;#10;54:54 Conclusion and Final Thoughts&amp;#10;57:22 Credits and Patrons&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#10084;&amp;#65038;&amp;#10084;&amp;#65038; SOCIAL MEDIA &amp;#10084;&amp;#65038;&amp;#10084;&amp;#65038;&amp;#10;Patreon - https://www.patreon.com/Izzzyzzz&amp;#10;&amp;#8203;&amp;#10;Twitter - https://twitter.com/izzzyzzzart&amp;#10;&amp;#8203;&amp;#10;Instagram - https://www.instagram.com/izzzyzzz/&amp;#8203;&amp;#10;&amp;#8203;&amp;#10;Email [business inquiries only] - IzzzyzzzINQ@gmail.com&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#10084;&amp;#65038;&amp;#10084;&amp;#65038; MUSIC &amp;#10084;&amp;#65038;&amp;#10084;&amp;#65038;&amp;#10;@GinaLoughlin - Piano Interludes&amp;#10;Petz Catz 2 OST&amp;#10;Cheel&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#10084;&amp;#65038;&amp;#10084;&amp;#65038; DISCLAIMER &amp;#10084;&amp;#65038;&amp;#10084;&amp;#65038;&amp;#10;All credit goes to the musicians and composers! This video is not meant to target or harass any person. This video does not condone or encourage anyone to harass or contact any person or persons discussed in this video. This video is purely for entertainment and informational purposes&amp;#10;&amp;#10;All art included in this video has been credited where possible. If your art has not been credited or has been credited incorrectly, please let me know and I'll add your credit to the description! If you would like your credit removed, please let me know and I can censor it out. Thank you! :)"
