    date "2022-06-25T20:00:13Z"
    title "Warrior Cats Voice Actors Play | The Hunger Games Simulator (Finale)"
    description "Thumbnail Artist for this video: Blizzard https://twitter.com/BlizzardBrick&amp;#10;&amp;#10;HI I hope you all enjoy the final edition of our Hunger Games Warrior Cat Series. There were a lot of fun to make. Quick thank you to Blixemi, Northflowo, and Finchwing for agreeing to do this. As for if we'll do another one of these, we're unsure but our voice actors had a blast with this HG. Also the quality of the actual game of the video tanked because I had to render this 3 times in order to get all the edits in.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Voices for this video:&amp;#10;Brooke: https://www.youtube.com/c/Finchwing&amp;#10;Leafpool/Briarlight: https://www.youtube.com/c/Blixemi&amp;#10;Ivypool: https://www.youtube.com/c/NorthflowerOwO&amp;#10;Tempest: Tobias Fink (https://twitter.com/TheCopyKater)&amp;#10;Firepaw/Firestar/Crag: Matt (https://twitter.com/EpicrockerTT)&amp;#10;Tigerclaw: Grant (https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC__T4ql8NIlSdmf9tCrPu6A/featured)&amp;#10;Bluestar: Sarah Prowell (https://twitter.com/SarahP_VO)&amp;#10;Sandstorm: Jax (https://twitter.com/LittleJaxel)&amp;#10;Ravenpaw: Islacreeper https://twitter.com/islavoiceacts?s=09&amp;#10;Cloudtail/Jayfeather: Matthew Jones (https://www.twitch.tv/gearup)&amp;#10;Cinderpelt: Tea (https://twitter.com/wisdom_t3a)&amp;#10;Silverstream/Spottedleaf: CEOlson (https://ceolsonart.carrd.co/)&amp;#10;Ashfur: Brian Corrigan&amp;#10;Mistystar: CloudytheLeopard&amp;#10;Mousefur: Blizzard https://twitter.com/BlizzardBrick&amp;#10;Crowfeather: CJ&amp;#10;Lionblaze: Noah https://twitter.com/Knowa___&amp;#10;One-eye: Kai (https://twitter.com/SkettiDragon)&amp;#10;Brackenfur/Fallen leaves: Terson#0121 (discord)&amp;#10;Barley: Kreischender Depp&amp;#10;Mosspelt: Breya Burgess (https://youtube.com/channel/UCrN8SOHOrW7xhvfwt5eI-Cw)&amp;#10;Blackstar/Breezepelt: ExaltedElf &amp;#10;Mapleshade: ErrorEmma (https://www.deviantart.com/erroremma)&amp;#10;Hawkfrost: Zeddall&amp;#10;Feathertail: VidyTheFox (https://twitter.com/VidyImpact)&amp;#10;Mothwing: Smogdeer (https://youtube.com/channel/UCjoLEjfj_THmgkC6I3HB3RA)&amp;#10;Sorreltail/Brightheart: Chaotic&amp;#10;Gorsepaw/Stoneteller: Tom&amp;#225;s (https://twitter.com/Bilbz1?s=09)&amp;#10;Kits: Nightmare&amp;#10;Purdy: Chris (https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCTQCLycV5E-fIglg4Gye3KA)&amp;#10;&amp;#10;For updates on new episodes and artwork, follow our twitter and join our discord! You can also talk to us there too! &amp;#10;https://twitter.com/WarriorsFanDub&amp;#10;https://discord.com/invite/warriorcatsfandub&amp;#10;https://www.patreon.com/WCDub&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Voice Director: GearUp https://www.twitch.tv/gearup&amp;#10;&amp;#10;OST:&amp;#10;Nora https://www.youtube.com/channel/UChPJ8fp_c4coK-S2mHsftng/videos&amp;#10;&amp;#10;In correspondence of the Digital Millennium Copyright Act (DMCA) this is a transformative work of the original copyrighted work from Erin Hunter and HarperCollins Publisher. Further, WarriorsFanDubProject claims no ownership of the Warriors series and does not seek to gain from the distribution of this work. these are not meant to be used as a substitute for the professional recordings."
