    description "I'm super happy and honored to show you the result of the year and a half of working. the participants did an AMAZING JOB!!And look at the awesome thumbnail made by Phaelia! Also thanks to the participants of the thumbnail contest. Fortunately for me, the participants decided of the winner, cause the choice would have been so hard!&amp;#10;&amp;#10;I know there is a little scene which is'nt in the book. Leafpaw is normally with the humans when Squirrelpaw and the others return to the clan. But I was'nt able to resist to imagine the sisters so happy to get together! &amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Participants :&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Part 1: Koerenn&amp;#10;Part 2: AigneTheAnimator &amp;#10;Part 3: c h y a &amp;#10;Part 4: AstraPiika&amp;#10;Part 5: QuirKrash&amp;#10;Part 6: JeanAkratt         &amp;#10;Part 7: Cat-Artist &amp;#10;Part 8: Solstrike06          &amp;#10;Part 9: Ray- lin &amp;#10;Part 10: DietS0da              &amp;#10;Part 11:  Echacharpe &amp;#10;Part 12:  PuddleFace          &amp;#10;Part 13: Painted StarDust                   &amp;#10;Part 14: Mellowlamb             &amp;#10;Part 15: SaraXu                           &amp;#10;Part 16: Sagutoyas  &amp;#10;Part 17: ursiday                  &amp;#10;Part 18: Lonely Night         &amp;#10;Part 19: Kittson              &amp;#10;Part 20: Cristal Silverlight&amp;#10;Part 21: Koerenn // DrBubbles&amp;#10;Part 22: Fleur de Sureau &amp;#10;Part 23: Mayartimations                      &amp;#10;Part 24: BeastyBby &amp;#10;Part 25: Koheina&amp;#10;Part 26: Firenkyo // Martletwing&amp;#10;Part 27: amberbydreamsart // Blanchy // Cherrydusk&amp;#10;Part 28: Goldenwing  //  Chilly Weathers               &amp;#10;Part 29: Luxionyl              &amp;#10;Part 30: Little Spencer                  &amp;#10;Part 31:  Francy Sketches  &amp;#10;&amp;#10;Music : Home - Dotan&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Copyright Disclaimer Under Section 107 of the Copyright Act 1976, allowance is made for &amp;#34;fair use&amp;#34; for purposes suc