    id 31
    label "sC9c7So_It4"
    step 0
    date "2022-04-01T21:45:11Z"
    title "CELL BLOCK TANGO [Complete Warrior Cats MAP]"
    description "This MAP is part of the April Fools Mapathon, be sure to watch and attend the rest here! https://youtube.com/playlist?list=PLjfYg0bZUobv9YdiVxg-L5IfGhbEmbBQ1&amp;#10;&amp;#10;After more than 2 years of hard work and dedication, I am more than thrilled to bring you Cell Block Tango. Every participant involved worked so hard and I couldn't be prouder of the final result. Many special thanks to the credit artists, thumbnail submissions, backups, and countless spectators for supporting the project!!&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Subtitles are available&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Also, a quick note that Silverstream's part is not properly translated!! I've modified it a little bit to fit her story better, please look into the actual lyrics if curious :]&amp;#10;&amp;#10;ORIGINAL MAP CALL - https://youtu.be/XiKwqH7KBxo&amp;#10;ORIGINAL SCRIPT - https://docs.google.com/document/d/1xdhOa8Iw_zEYTV9oWzPdFSUB_CkivAFXdfSmvQYV28U/edit?usp=sharing&amp;#10;&amp;#10;PARTICIPANTS -&amp;#10;Opening - RedBear + Moon Boots&amp;#10;-1 - HarvestBrook &amp;#10;-0 - CL0UD 324 + tiger light + CrackerMack + OFUKITTY &amp;#10;Intro - The Oncoming Snail &amp;#10;1 - Finchbite &amp;#10;2 - WishfulVixen &amp;#10;3 - Louixie &amp;#10;4 - Sigmageist &amp;#10;5 - Furox + rikatu + Fennexx &amp;#10;6 - flamierrr &amp;#10;7 - Undead Bandit &amp;#10;8 - Ryeven &amp;#10;9 - Fiore Doodles &amp;#10;10 - EphemeralMoth &amp;#10;11 - Cheekytiger &amp;#10;12 - Dagger &amp;#10;13 - SketchbookRiot + muggertime &amp;#10;14 - Sigmageist + GiingerSnaps &amp;#10;15 - EvanIndie &amp;#10;16 - Aridarchen &amp;#10;17 - Woofzie &amp;#10;18 - RoonieArts &amp;#10;19 - Mary_MS_Jay &amp;#10;20 - CL0UD 324 &amp;#10;21- poppy pops &amp;#10;22 - Kookzer &amp;#10;23 - teekonu &amp;#10;24 - StarStruck246 &amp;#10;25 - Rosia + OFUKITTY + renibowsprimkle &amp;#10;26 - MissEus &amp;#10;27 - Moon Boots &amp;#10;28 - RoonieArts + Kalublah + DaveThyQueen + Maltose &amp;#10;29 - Linn Lacrimosa &amp;#10;30 - Northflower &amp;#10;31 - voideitii &amp;#10;32- starritea &amp;#10;33 - Fennexx + StarStruck246 &amp;#10;34 - Okami Wolven &amp;#10;35 - Annywu &amp;#10;36-  KristalKarma + pianopickles &amp;#10;37 - KimSxxiny + Marinin &amp;#10;38 - StoryOfAnArtist &amp;#10;39 - powderberry + adrianimations &amp;#10;40 - powderberry + adrianimations &amp;#10;41 - fishsocks + snoozie &amp;#10;42 - draivysand &amp;#10;43 - Cat frost + SplashDreamms &amp;#10;44 - araxie + Vampviz &amp;#10;Outro - BumbleTus &amp;#10;c1- Sunflower Cougar + Radio &amp;#9733; Scratch &amp;#10;c2- BUSTERSW0RD &amp;#10;c3- The Oncoming Snail &amp;#10;c4- DaveThyQueen &amp;#10;c5- Boba Chai &amp;#10;c6- Araxie&amp;#10;c7- Louixie&amp;#10;&amp;#10;SONG - Cell Block Tango from Chicago&amp;#10;CREDITS SONG - Holding Out For A Hero from Shrek 2&amp;#10;MAP PLAYLIST - https://youtube.com/playlist?list=PLkoS5e_CzKgxMB9BsRX1TL2vEP3-V8kP3&amp;#10;&amp;#10;THUMBNAIL WINNER - Sinasni&amp;#10;----------&amp;#10;Cell Block Tango is a non-profit project made for fun!! Please consider supporting all artists involved &amp;#128153;&amp;#10;----------&amp;#10;Copyright Disclaimer Under Section 107 of the Copyright Act 1976, allowance is made for &amp;#34;fair use&amp;#34; for purposes such as criticism, comment, news reporting, teaching, scholarship, and research. Fair use is a use permitted by copyright statute that might otherwise be infringing. Non-profit, educational or personal use tips the balance in favor of fair use."
