    id 65
    label "eFGfz3-lTj0"
    step 0
    date "2022-05-14T17:00:17Z"
    title "Gender In Warrior Cats s Spiel | Warriors Analysis"
    description "This is a long video, but one I needed to make and have known I would need to make for over a year now. It has been months in the making, and I don&amp;#8217;t think there&amp;#8217;s much I could say in this description to properly summarize it. I just ask that you watch carefully, don&amp;#8217;t jump to conclusions, and play nicely in the comments. Any blatantly sexist comments will be deleted, and harassment of anyone is never something I will condone. Thank you for watching.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Twitter: https://twitter.com/Sunnyfall_RC &amp;#10;Paws of Stars Fanfiction: https://archiveofourown.org/series/1851976  &amp;#10;Contact Email: sunnyfall99@gmail.com &amp;#10;Discord Server: https://discord.gg/JKphkRvVXc &amp;#10;&amp;#10;Trip Through Time: https://youtube.com/playlist?list=PLp4G-2Wwr2Ge55OYfZfrnEw3zJ4U3I-JX &amp;#10;Frecklewish Website Article: https://warriorcats.com/content/article/does-frecklewish-really-belong-in-the-dark-forest &amp;#10;Kirikerise Frecklewish Video: https://youtu.be/yRPFlEELLXU &amp;#10;Moonkitti Frecklewish Video: https://youtu.be/eKpDFm0S6C4 &amp;#10;Bright Guardian Akira Frecklewish Video: https://youtu.be/gBoDu1WSXp8 &amp;#10;The Prophecies Begin Video: https://youtu.be/nTX4FefadLk &amp;#10;Thrushpelt Video: https://youtu.be/fMbg0gmvtRY &amp;#10;&amp;#10;Thank you to DuplexBeGreat and Lightflame for compiling many of the linecounts and wordcounts that I used to create my statistics.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;End Card Song: Ponte de Abril &amp;#8211; Steve Adams https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=BffWNLKg5zY &amp;#10;&amp;#10;Chapters:&amp;#10;0:00 Introduction&amp;#10;3:38 Presence in the Books&amp;#10;15:10 Roles and Characterization&amp;#10;19:45 Antagonists&amp;#10;22:48 Leadership Roles&amp;#10;26:14 Mates and Kits&amp;#10;40:41 Comparison With Toms&amp;#10;52:47 The Two Problem Arcs&amp;#10;58:01 Parallel Situations&amp;#10;1:05:01 Hurting Toms Too&amp;#10;1:08:51 The Contrary Example&amp;#10;1:11:17 Moving Forward&amp;#10;1:17:34 End Card"
