  [
    id 66
    label "HmifI5zJa7Y"
    step 0
    date "2021-02-17T16:00:15Z"
    title "LETS GO - Rustpaw WARRIOR CATS AU MAP EP.1 - COMPLETE"
    description "AAAAAAAAAAAA This MAP finally DONE!!&amp;#10;THIS IS MY FIRST WARRIOR CATS MAP!&amp;#10;I'm so proud of all the artists and thumbnails,and big thanks to Icecyclone, who hosted the map with me, and thanks to my friends, they gives me a lot of help too! everything was worth it and I'm proud of it.&amp;#10;Check out lcecyclone's channel!&amp;#10;https://youtube.com/c/Icecyclone20149&amp;#10;&amp;#10;ABOUT THIS AU(In this MAP)-&amp;#10;The prophecy &amp;#34;Fire alone will save our clan.&amp;#34; doesn't exist this is au. Bluestar recruited rusty just to increase the number of Thunderclan's warriors, not because he is the &amp;#34;fire&amp;#34;.&amp;#10;In the duel, Rusty lost to Longtail, so he run away, which made his encounter with Brokenstar later and joined ShadowClan instead.&amp;#10;Rusty is also the one that drives Yellowfang out and blinds her, and Rusty helps Clawface to steal,and Spottedleaf survives this time.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#34;About the AU&amp;#34; parts: It will be kept as a secret until the plot is revealed,feel free to make theories with the hints shown, it all will be explained in future maps!&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Thumbnail winner - @Otta Lits &amp;#10;Thumbnail speedpaint&amp;#10;https://youtu.be/o1KnvXanNtA&amp;#10;&amp;#10;So many thumbnails,there are 133!&amp;#10;And everyone draws so well,Thanks u all !!&amp;#10;The winner is decided by voting, because there is so many excellent,I can&amp;#8217;t choose just one. &amp;#10;&amp;#10;INTRO A-Pigeocore&amp;#10;INTRO B-SKVERNC&amp;#10;PART 1-Cr. al. cs + Linn Lacrimosa&amp;#10;PART 2-Goldenwing + Maltose Cat&amp;#10;PART 3-Zelarhie&amp;#10;PART 4-Chocobir&amp;#10;PART 5-OTTA LITS&amp;#10;PART 6-DatSpeedyTurtle&amp;#10;PART 7-powderseas&amp;#10;PART 8-Marinin&amp;#10;PART 9-Jomadis&amp;#10;PART 10-NIBIRU&amp;#10;PART 11-Arty Aardvark&amp;#10;PART 12-ThisCatIsOnFire + elriq&amp;#10;PART 13-ThatApollosCat&amp;#10;PART 14-Tumbling Darkling&amp;#10;PART 15-Ray-lin&amp;#10;PART 16-GildedPhD&amp;#10;PART 17-Annywu + Renjirra&amp;#10;PART 18-Creepsta Fine&amp;#10;&amp;#10;OUTRO 1-FrraustByte&amp;#10;OUTRO 2-Demi M0n&amp;#10;OUTRO 3-icecyclone&amp;#10;OUTRO 4-Renjirra + Blue Dragon&amp;#10;OUTRO 5-equalthing&amp;#10;&amp;#10;ART 1 Longtail-FISHSOCKS&amp;#10;ART 2 Bluestar-crowla&amp;#10;ART 3 Spottedleaf-Qitsunebi&amp;#10;ART 4 Yellowfang-Linn Lacrimosa&amp;#10;ART 5 Brockenstar-Demi M0n&amp;#10;&amp;#10;About AU-&amp;#10;PART 1-Phantomsylveon&amp;#10;PART 2-CL0UD 324&amp;#10;PART 3-CL0UD 324&amp;#10;PART 4-OTTA LITS&amp;#10;PART 5-FallenEcho&amp;#10;PART 6-Gecko Draws&amp;#10;PART 7-Osinka&amp;#10;PART 8-Osinka&amp;#10;PART 9-Canarysong&amp;#10;PART 10-FlarinaFairy&amp;#10;PART 11-GiingerSnaps&amp;#10;PART 12-BRandy&amp;#10;PART 13-SplashDreamms&amp;#10;PART 14-SKVERNC&amp;#10;PART 15-Deer Drops&amp;#10;PART 16-FallenEcho&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Vines-&amp;#10;Tumbling Darkling(Two vines) &amp;#10;Ray-lin&amp;#10;DatSpeedyTurtle&amp;#10;NIBIRU&amp;#10;OTTA LITS(Two vines)&amp;#10;Blue Dragon&amp;#10;Ninnoibat&amp;#10;Zelarhie&amp;#10;&amp;#10;I'm very happy that every backups has participated in the map,this will be an absolute legendary achievement!!&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Parts playlist-&amp;#10;https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLj97TgvMlF2yiMAXwHWe15-2BUa62QfSL&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Song-&amp;#10;https://youtu.be/52Gg9CqhbP8&amp;#10;Outro Song-&amp;#10;https://youtu.be/yHD2y0Zz11c&amp;#10;&amp;#10;MALTOSE DISCORD SERVER FOR FANS AND FIRENDS https://discord.gg/6uwFvJNp6d&amp;#8203;&amp;#8203;&amp;#8203;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Wooo!! Thanks for my patreon supporters!! This is mean alot for me&amp;#9825;^^ &amp;#8595;&amp;#8595;&amp;#8595;&amp;#10;Vilwez&amp;#10;&amp;#9671;matchabitz &amp;#10;&amp;#10;Support my work-&amp;#10;Patreon: https://www.patreon.com/maltosecat?fan_landing=true&amp;#10;&amp;#10;You Can Find Maltose Cat!&amp;#8595;&amp;#8595;&amp;#8595;&amp;#10;IG&amp;#10;https://www.instagram.com/maltose_cat/&amp;#10;Twitter&amp;#10;https://twitter.com/MaLt_0sE?s=03"
