  [
    id 69
    label "KqByyAcXwFU"
    step 0
    date "2022-02-13T20:00:11Z"
    title "TRAVELER-FEATHER [Complete Jayfeather time travel themed weekend Warriors MAP]"
    description "Traveler-Feather is about the never ending time loop of pain and revenge that Jayfeather and Fallenleaves are trapped in until one of them finally decides to make a change. In this AU, Fallenleaves lives in modern day thunderclan and it's Fallenleaves who falls through the ice!&amp;#10;&amp;#10;The mystery of the tunnels, Fallen leaves, Rock, and time travel have always been my favorite subplot of warrior cats. But despite all it's potential to be an interesting and compelling story, I've always felt let down by the direction that canon Warriors took. So I've been messing around with these story elements and trying to piece together some narrative I felt would meet that potential. Song choice after song choice, plot theme after plot theme, script after script... nothing seem to hit right until 3 years later... I finally came up with Traveler-Feather!&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;SONG: Skeleton Song by Kate Nash &amp;#10;END CREDITS SONG: Windmills of Your Mind by Dusty Springfield&amp;#10;MAP part playlist: https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLbSyL5k7nLJhI2S6YXiKkk7i25mhH3-LT&amp;#10;&amp;#10;ORGINAL SCRIPT: https://docs.google.com/document/d/17GIUVjtNCItOzfQABJYpbhMkj-ScO0hbbj2_viIb1pU/edit?usp=sharing&amp;#10;STORYBOARD: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Pm2j_G-PbK8&amp;#10;Thumbnail entries:  https://docs.google.com/document/d/1wDLDzAbXmmTXgZWhGwkHptcL9fCJ6LK7SE72Su3o_K0/edit?usp=sharing&amp;#10;&amp;#10;--PARTICIPANTS--&amp;#10;intro: Kittlet&amp;#10;1: Sundyr + Bregottski&amp;#10;2: Mochi Kohai + CheetehZ + OFUKITTY + SmellyTrashRat&amp;#10;3: senswii + Cante Skuya&amp;#10;4: Yeshika&amp;#10;5: IvyBall + Coffeely&amp;#10;6:  DirtyNoodles&amp;#10;7: LenisLynx&amp;#10;8: Cameron Collar&amp;#10;9: ScooterScones&amp;#10;10: Dave + Tad + Riin&amp;#10;11:SolarSparky&amp;#10;12: Treeetooop&amp;#10;13: Sagutoyas&amp;#10;14: Shelly Key&amp;#10;15: LockandKeyHyena&amp;#10;16: EphemeralMoth + giingersnaps&amp;#10;17: Autumn Lynx &amp;#10;18: Koheina&amp;#10