    id 74
    label "bOwuAuButm8"
    step 0
    date "2021-04-02T20:30:15Z"
    title ""
    description "Edit 3/13/2022: &amp;#34;Sequel&amp;#34; is out: https://youtu.be/zDPNmfbZUvg&amp;#10;&amp;#10;I am proud to present: Can't Stop Singing!&amp;#10;&amp;#10;The theme: Uh-oh! Looks like Sandstorm is catching feelings for Fireheart. Fireheart is cool with the idea, but Sandstorm isn't as happy.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;This MAP -which stands for Multi Animator Project- was one of the most fun MAPs I've hosted! The participants really had a lot of motivation to do their parts and they came out SO SO GOOD!&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Thank you to everyone who submitted a thumbnail entry, applied for a part/backup, or watched the MAP from afar!&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Please give a special thanks to all of the thumbnail contest participants BUT give a special round of applause to melowon_Z, who won the thumbnail contest!&amp;#10;https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCauiWZqo0AbBm2A90Nk7OVw&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Edit: Please go check out the artist improperly stated as &amp;#34;blimexi_123&amp;#34;'s youtube channel known as &amp;#34;&amp;#43457; Tiny Bean Boi &amp;#43458;&amp;#34;! &amp;#10;&amp;#10;Please check out all of the parts in the parts playlist: https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLws7UCzDiMlxVPQeG0XGIhOM0yx8LZQMv&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Finally, give a warm welcome to all of the participants!&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Intro: @SaturnSkyez &amp;#10;1:   @Featherflight55 OwO &amp;#10;2: Sparkle The Cat&amp;#10;[https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC8LhbK3vi4ZX6uQ2HqeLH_w]&amp;#10;3: Outter_By&amp;#10;[https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCiWfG2iK4kYXQhWo9rKd1Pw]&amp;#10;4: Lauritonas&amp;#10;[https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCldKdhe_MHbrdOyNouzuPxw]&amp;#10;5: Splair&amp;#10;[https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC4WdwvcQC58yw_cybpf1pKA]&amp;#10;6:  @sorryslonk &amp;#10;7: Allycat 711&amp;#10;[https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCCiI5rmL5oydAE8r0z7XKaA]&amp;#10;8: Skitch_Sketch :p&amp;#10;[https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCL9gjRf88GjJ_7umU97kSrQ]&amp;#10;9: Cotton Claw :3&amp;#10;[https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC7H6P44a8ZM4HnbUGgVJMvg]&amp;#10;10: madcats basement&amp;#10;[https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCg6Xg7ByHNEW0XuEENzoORg]&amp;#10;11: Tickinq Blechh&amp;#10;[https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCLJ78vsF0hLwHgM4ML4IFqQ]&amp;#10;12:  @CherryPics &amp;#10;13: dead_laurus&amp;#10;[https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCgTZtOwiyhRSB-FDIp6ipmw&amp;#10;14:  lunara  V &amp;#10;[https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCOmrRjLvGva7CVBTD4dOBag]&amp;#10;15: Samoboo &amp;#10;[https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCtIN3uQbdZ9l9JbQVttNJTw]&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Song is from Teen Beach, characters belong to Erin Hunter&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Designs by SaturnSkyez &amp;#38; Mary_MS_ Jay&amp;#10;Side characters are Cinderpelt and Mousefur&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;---------------------------&amp;#10;FUN STUFF&amp;#10;&amp;#10;I also post on...&amp;#10;Deviantart: SaturnSkyez&amp;#10;Instagram: Saturnskyez&amp;#10;Cat Designs have been made for Labyrinth, Star Wars, DC, Once Upon A Time, Marvel, A Series Of Unfortunate Events, and more coming soon!!&amp;#10;Discord Server: https://discord.gg/DKD8Ukf&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Thank you so much for watching!&amp;#10;&amp;#10;NOTE: I do not own 90% of the content shown. however I have explicit permission to post it."
