    title "Dumb Ways to Die - Warrior Cats Parody *SPOILERS*"
    description "*SPOILER WARNING!!*&amp;#10;PLEASE READ DESCRIPTION&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Download Link: http://bit.ly/20nDHWB&amp;#10;...&amp;#10;&amp;#10;|| CREDITS||&amp;#10;&amp;#10;CHORUS-&amp;#10;Butterflyidentity&amp;#10;https://www.youtube.com/user/butterflyidentity&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Gloryoftherainwings&amp;#10;https://www.youtube.com/user/GloryOfTheRainWings&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Fausti. A&amp;#10;https://www.youtube.com/user/GingaJinketsuKoushi&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Raymond Miller&amp;#10;https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCK7H-4F1Tss-lU4HHVND6nw&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Art/Mixing/Vocals&amp;#10;Blixemi!&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Instrumental: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=5QV2HAYKP7E&amp;#10;&amp;#10;-----------&amp;#10;&amp;#10;LYRICS:&amp;#10;&amp;#10;                         &amp;#10;Get squished by a rock  (Oakheart)&amp;#10;Carried off by a big angry hawk (Snowkit)&amp;#10;Chase a pheasant bird, across the path (Shrewpaw)&amp;#10;Face Bloodclan and their terrible wrath (Tigerclaw)&amp;#10;Dumb ways to die&amp;#10;So many dumb ways to die&amp;#10;Dumb ways to die &amp;#10;So many dumb ways to die.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;It's cold out in the snow (Mosskit)&amp;#10;Thrown off  the edge of the gorge (Whiteclaw)&amp;#10;Get trapped under the ice (Flametail)&amp;#10;Wound infections after getting rat bites (Volepaw)&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Dumb ways to die&amp;#10;So many dumb ways to die&amp;#10;Dumb ways to die &amp;#10;So many dumb ways to die.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Try to fight dogs by yourself (Swiftpaw)&amp;#10;Flattened while tryin' to save a mouse (Longtail)&amp;#10;Catch a cough that's green or white (many)&amp;#10;Get struck down due to Starclan's might. (Ripplestar)&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Dumb ways to die&amp;#10;So many dumb ways to die&amp;#10;Dumb ways to die &amp;#10;So many dumb ways to die.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Attack the Sharptooth from above (Feathertail)&amp;#10;Sacrafice yourself for true love. (Silverstream/)&amp;#10;Washed away, taking a poo (Duskwater)&amp;#10;I wonder, what these red berries do? (omg)&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Dumb ways to die&amp;#10;So many dumb ways to die&amp;#10;Dumb ways to die &amp;#10;So many dumb ways to die.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Stuck inside the camp during a forest fire (Yellowfang)&amp;#10;Have your evil plot up and backfire. (Hawkfrost)&amp;#10;Jump on a dog and then drown the a river (Bluestar)&amp;#10;Save your friend from badgers while defending her babies (Cinderpelt)&amp;#10;Go down in smoke in a grandeur (Firestar)&amp;#10;They may not rhyme but they're quite possibly&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Dumbest ways to die&amp;#10;Dumbest ways to die&amp;#10;Dumbest ways to dieeeeee~&amp;#10;So many dumb&amp;#10;So many dumb ways to die."
