    title "Ready As Ill Ever Be [Warriors COMPLETED MAP]"
    description "END OF APRIL, END OF APRIL, I PROMISED!!1&amp;#10;Well, It's finally here! &amp;#10;&amp;#10;PARTICIPANTS:&amp;#10;1 - MapleSpyder&amp;#10;2 - sokoish &amp;#10;3 - GEKKOZILLA&amp;#10;4 - F# Major &amp;#10;5 - XxUkarixX&amp;#10;6 - meow 286 &amp;#10;7 - Nightrizer &amp;#10;8 - Cranberry the Cat &amp;#10;9 - Zuremist&amp;#10;10 - Glitch Sixxle &amp;#10;11 - SmolToxin &amp;#10;12 - AlexHarrier &amp;#10;13 - Stef T &amp;#10;14 - ashtrall &amp;#10;15 - Selket &amp;#38; HulluMel&amp;#10;16 - Blowber JalenR11 Twins for a change&amp;#10;17 - WishfulVixen &amp;#10;18 - simply misty &amp;#38;  XXLunaWarriorXX&amp;#10;19 - BlueMaroon|Sarah Goran &amp;#10;20 - staniqs &amp;#10;21 - D3LT4R1-2&amp;#10;22 - Sagutoyas &amp;#10;&amp;#10;Editing by Hita Eighthsun&amp;#10;Script/Rules translation - Sorrelpaws&amp;#10;Animation in the end - Hita Eighthsun &amp;#38; Stationpass (coloring)&amp;#10;Background for this animation - SpiritOfAlaska94&amp;#10;Intro - Sparrow's World &amp;#38; Hita Eighthsun&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Music:&amp;#10;&amp;#34;Ready As I'll Ever Be&amp;#34; - Tangled: Before Ever After&amp;#10;&amp;#34;Let Me Make You Proud&amp;#34; instrumental - https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=zlDfoKTFktE&amp;#10;&amp;#10;HUGE THANK FOR EVERYONE, who drew fan-arts and took part in our thumbnail contest! Unfortunately, it was impossible to insert in credits absolutely all the work. But we appreciate them no less, believe us! And you can upload your thumbnail or fan-art to our open Google-folder: https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1Pz_Fcs-zZVtGoQBWduD1DE8XEtNKL3N4&amp;#10;&amp;#10;We also want to thank all the animators, who helped us to make our idea a reality. We're SO PROUD of you, such amazing artists. Thank you so much for your perseverance and patience!&amp;#10;&amp;#10;_________________________________________&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Copyright Disclaimer Under Section 107 of the Copyright Act 1976, allowance is made for &amp;#34;fair use&amp;#34; for purposes such as criticism, comment, news reporting, teaching, scholarship, and research. Fair use is a use permitted by copyright statute that might otherwise be infringing. Non-profit, educational or personal use tips the balance in favor of fair use."
