    label "YAIc-XIofNQ"
    step 0
    date "2021-12-05T00:30:08Z"
    title "LAY ALL YOUR LOVE ON ME | Complete Warrior Cats MAP"
    description "&amp;#34;LAY ALL YOUR LOVE ON ME&amp;#34; is a Warrior Cats MAP (multi animator project) focused on the complicated and dramatic relationship between Tigerheart and Dovewing, taking lots of inspiration from theatre! &amp;#10;&amp;#10;This MAP is finally here and I couldn't be more proud! Each animator worked SO HARD on their parts, and it truly shows! It was a long wait, but it was certainly worth it. Every part really is gorgeous and I could not be more thankful to everyone who helped bring my idea to life.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;ANIMATOR CREDITS:&amp;#10;@EchoMist&amp;#10;@Bunny Guin &amp;#10;@Solstrike06 &amp;#10;@rivallish &amp;#10;@GhostLantern &amp;#10;@CretaCat https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC6Qh5rxg4yTKfgjyCyZLLfg (2d backgrounds, collab with GhostLantern and Galaxy Mew)&amp;#10;@Galaxy Mew (also did roughs for the walk cycle in part 10, collab with Laurenrdraws and Sparroet)&amp;#10;@CuteFlare &amp;#10;@Laurenrdraws &amp;#10;@Sparroet &amp;#10;@roseshards &amp;#10;@FISHSOCKS &amp;#10;@softmio &amp;#10;@ICEBUNN &amp;#10;@Puddleface &amp;#10;@Cassandra Cat (storyboards and some rough animation, collab with Faded Kat)&amp;#10;@Faded Kat &amp;#10;@Adrianimations &amp;#10;@mahatyran &amp;#10;@ursiday &amp;#10;@Sagutoyas &amp;#10;@Bosley Boz &amp;#10;@kestrl &amp;#10;@Owlmeh &amp;#10;@lyrepaw &amp;#10;@Fleur de Sureau &amp;#10;@Finchwing &amp;#10;@Fluddie &amp;#10;@DrBubbles &amp;#10;@Pyralis &amp;#10;@raevei &amp;#10;@Keby (Lynxspots) &amp;#10;@Artisminerva &amp;#10;@Ashtrall &amp;#10;@MANCHKIN! &amp;#10;@Nightrizer &amp;#10;@TheWisestDino &amp;#10;@CheekyTiger &amp;#10;@Puzzle Parrot &amp;#10;&amp;#10;THUMBNAIL CONTEST CREDITS:&amp;#10;Mi Cool - https://www.instagram.com/mmi_cool/&amp;#10;Bluberry - @BluBerry &amp;#10;Falcaothay - https://www.instagram.com/falcaothay_art/?hl=en&amp;#10;Louixie - @Louixie &amp;#10;Oal_Arts - https://www.instagram.com/oal_arts/?hl=en&amp;#10;Frankiebcatt - https://twitter.com/frankiebcatt?ref_src=twsrc%5Egoogle%7Ctwcamp%5Eserp%7Ctwgr%5Eauthor&amp;#10;Feather_of_Fire - https://www.instagram.com/feather_of_fire/?hl=en&amp;#10;&amp;#10;View the rest of the thumbnail contest entries here: https://www.instagram.com/explore/tags/laylomthumbnailcontest/?hl=en&amp;#10;&amp;#10;SONGS:&amp;#10;ABBA - Lay All Your Love On Me https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=YT-wSm18JXM&amp;#38;ab_channel=DominicCooper-Topic&amp;#10;Philharmonia Orchestra - Lay All Your Love On Me Instrumental https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Pe63EXhhVSg&amp;#38;ab_channel=PhilharmoniaOrchestra-Topic&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Email for business inquiries: chloeperrinart@gmail.com&amp;#10;Website: https://www.chloeperrin.com/&amp;#10;Redbubble/merch: https://www.redbubble.com/people/roseshards/&amp;#10;DeviantArt: https://www.deviantart.com/roseshards/&amp;#10;Instagram: https://www.instagram.com/roseshards/&amp;#10;Tumblr: https://warriorcatsdatabase.tumblr.com/&amp;#10;Twitter: https://twitter.com/roseshards&amp;#10;Discord: https://discord.gg/DghQYp5"
