    id 117
    label "bXILzt-t58c"
    step 0
    date "2022-04-23T18:00:11Z"
    title "Tigerclaw Sinners - Complete MAP"
    description "Rehosted from @Galaxy Mew . Bazinga.&amp;#10;Summary: Tigerclaw was once a young promising cat with many friends, but in order to impress his violent mentor Thistleclaw, he trains hard to be a fighter and puts all his emotions down. As an adult, Tigerclaw feels stunted and unable to communicate with his old friends, especially after his mentor dies. The young cat Redtail is very impressed by Tigerclaw, and wants to befriend him, but Tigerclaw is deeply jealous of the ease with which Redtail makes friends and feels like Redtail has stolen all his friends and credit. Tigerclaw will solve this the only way he knows how: with violence.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;SONG: Sinners by Barns Courtney&amp;#10;CREDITS SONG: Sinners (Live Acoustic) by Barns Courtney&amp;#10;Thumbnail by @Treeetooop&amp;#10;&amp;#10;PARTS LIST: &amp;#10;Intro: @LettuceBettuce &amp;#10;1. @Treeetooop &amp;#10;2. FennecPika &amp;#10;3.  Catfrost + Senswii +  TWArtz&amp;#10;4. @Aspeyns &amp;#10;5. @Inspector Spinda &amp;#10;6. Roseshards&amp;#10;7. Lunemoths&amp;#10;8. Sally Chel &amp;#10;9a. BeastyBby + Swift Willow Studios + @Raven + Akemi Vierra&amp;#10;9b. muckrooms + sage-leaves + BeastyBby &amp;#10;10. Ru End Fns_Hope&amp;#10;11. Ru End Fns_Hope&amp;#10;12. Pfini Productions&amp;#10;13. Pfini Productions &amp;#10;14. Riley &amp;#10;15.  Riley&amp;#10;16. Sparroet &amp;#10;17. Vilatus &amp;#10;18. Sparroet + Nettlefang&amp;#10;19. KaraLaa &amp;#10;20. Kimi Cook &amp;#10;21. Tiger Light, LettuceBettuce, Akemi Viera, Gobboprotector&amp;#10;Outro: stariitea&amp;#10;&amp;#10;CREDITS ANIMATIONS:&amp;#10;Mayartmations&amp;#10;GobboProtector&amp;#10;@Galaxy Mew &amp;#10;Lunemoths&amp;#10;NightWolf&amp;#10;Sprinting Snail Studios&amp;#10;WoolHug&amp;#10;Aces of Stars&amp;#10;Broken&amp;#10;Akemi Vierra"
