  [
    id 118
    label "rMXW3GAnwFM"
    step 0
    date "2021-10-31T20:00:12Z"
    title "[ TW ] Hide N Seek A Evil Tawnypaw AU MAP COMPLETE"
    description "TRIGGER WARNING! &amp;#10;This MAP contains graphic content, gore, animal death, corpses and skeletons, blood, spiders, bugs, psychological horror, traumas, violence. It isn't recommended for people with less than 18 years or for the public who isn't confortable with this type of content.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;What Tawnypaw does here is bad. She is portrayed as a villain in this AU and her actions shouldn't serve as inspiration nor viewed as good.&amp;#10;------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------&amp;#10;&amp;#10;After watching her father being exiled, her dear older brother getting killed and no one coming to help him, Tawnypaw can't have it anymore. She wants revenge from everyone who turned their backs on her and her family, specially the ones who she thinks are blamed for Swiftpaw's death and Tigerclaw's exile.&amp;#10;__________________________________________________________________________&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;WE DID IT!!! I CAN'T BELIEVE ON IT!&amp;#10;My very first MAP is complete and is on Halloween! Thank you all for all the support! You guys are AMAZING! Everyone did an amazing job and everyone got their parts on time! That's amazing!&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Thank you all for the hard work! You guys are amazing! Specially thanks for my friends @SplashDreamms and @MANCHKIN! for helping me out with the editing! I owe you guys a lot!&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Be sure to give a lot of love and appreciation to the animators! They did an amazing job!&amp;#10;List of participants: &amp;#10;&amp;#10;Intro. Marinin&amp;#10;1. @Arillp Cela &amp;#10;2. @Boofolin &amp;#10;3. @Otta Lits &amp;#10;4. @crispyyflake  + @Petalyxz + Marinin&amp;#10;5. @mossysprout + @Pinktune0z &amp;#10;6. @Martletwing  + WubbCrash (https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCZdC1qYUkAJn_tT5PBfYg-g/videos) &amp;#10;7.  @MARSHII  + noytc (https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCilIuVl9kEixpExEbBoZcIQ/videos) + @Poppyseed &amp;#10;8. @Demi m0n  + @&amp;#33469;&amp;#31958;Maltose &amp;#10;9. @Chocobir &amp;#10;10. @AvorenGryphon  + @Rice Rain  &amp;#10;11. @ICEBUNN  +  &amp;#9695;Hiiragi&amp;#9693; (https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCxaz4Px_dIjlcOzNEBv_lVQ)&amp;#10;12. @Clowder Origins  + @LunaTuna + @RivstarS &amp;#10;13. @Pfini Productions &amp;#10;14. @Smelly Trash Rat  + Flawiusz-Sama (https://www.youtube.com/c/MotakaboethKunREAL/videos)&amp;#10;15. @melowon_Z &amp;#10;16. @LP4ndora &amp;#10;17. @Dark-yard &amp;#10;18. @SplashDreamms + @Annywu + Marinin&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Thumbnail Winner: @Annywu &amp;#10;Songs by Lizz Robinett : &amp;#10;&amp;#34;Hide and Seek&amp;#34; (Vocaloid) English version : https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=G-YNNJIe2Vk&amp;#10;BR&amp;#10;&amp;#34;Hide and Seek&amp;#34; (Vocaloid) English ver by Lizz Robinett (@SARE Remix) https://youtu.be/2lS8vGybIR4&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Intro songs: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=UuofG8a7EEk&amp;#10;https://youtu.be/1n39pc8kHsc&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Characters by Erin Hunter&amp;#10;Designs by me (Tawnypaw) and Nifty-senpai."
