    date "2022-04-01T19:00:09Z"
    title "The Warrior Cats Fan Dub April Fools Day"
    description "THIS WAS SUCH A FUN PROJECT TO DO FOR APRIL FOOLS DAY.&amp;#10;For those who are a bit confused: The Warrior Cats Fan Dub Voice actors are tasked with 1 challenge for this video.&amp;#10;Each vowel in a characters name is replaced with &amp;#34;oob&amp;#34;&amp;#10;Ex. Bluestar changes to Blooboobstoobr&amp;#10;Graypaw changes to Groobypoobw&amp;#10;And our voice actors are only allowed 1 TAKE to get this done. Wish them luck.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Artist for this video: GearUp &amp;#10;&amp;#10;Voices for this video:&amp;#10;Voice Director: GearUp &amp;#10;Narrator (Tempest): Tobias Fink (https://twitter.com/TheCopyKater)&amp;#10;Narrator (Fox): Kirsty Depledge (https://twitter.com/kettlings?s=21)&amp;#10;Firepaw/Rusty: Matt (https://twitter.com/EpicrockerTT)&amp;#10;Fireheart: OccultCoyote (https://twitter.com/OccultCoyote)&amp;#10;Tigerclaw: Grant (https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC__T4ql8NIlSdmf9tCrPu6A/featured)&amp;#10;Bluestar: Sarah Prowell (https://twitter.com/SarahP_VO)&amp;#10;Graystripe: Adrian (https://twitter.com/batenkaitosfan)&amp;#10;Sandstorm: Jax (https://twitter.com/LittleJaxel)&amp;#10;Ravenpaw: Islacreeper https://twitter.com/islavoiceacts?s=09&amp;#10;Yellowfang: Monica Grace&amp;#10;Cinderpelt: Tea (https://twitter.com/wisdom_t3a)&amp;#10;Darkstripe: NKSerg (https://youtube.com/channel/UC7aAypXwy8pp0GIjmTT8Uaw)&amp;#10;Longtail: TheKarsonist&amp;#10;Mousefur: Blizzard https://twitter.com/BlizzardBrick&amp;#10;Lionheart: Noah (https://twitter.com/TwitchSqueak)&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Script Writer:&amp;#10;GearUp https://www.twitch.tv/gearup&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Voice Director: &amp;#10;GearUp https://www.twitch.tv/gearup&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Editor: &amp;#10;GearUp https://www.twitch.tv/gearup&amp;#10;&amp;#10;For updates on new episodes and artwork, follow our twitter and join our discord! You can also talk to us there too! &amp;#10;https://twitter.com/WarriorsFanDub&amp;#10;https://discord.com/invite/warriorcatsfandub&amp;#10;https://www.patreon.com/WCDub&amp;#10;&amp;#10;In correspondence of the Digital Millennium Copyright Act (DMCA) this is a transformative work of the original copyrighted work from Erin Hunter and HarperCollins Publisher. Further, WarriorsFanDubProject claims no ownership of the Warriors series and does not seek to gain from the distribution of this work. these are not meant to be used as a substitute for the professional recordings."
