  [
    id 124
    label "I52hHSgN65U"
    step 0
    date "2021-12-26T00:30:14Z"
    title ""
    description "If u have the chance can you help share this map? :'DD Youtube as been playing with my face recently, and not sharing my videos, so even a like helps a lot! Means a lot to me!&amp;#10;&amp;#10;HAPPY HOLLIDAYS EVERYONE! AND ITS HERE! I'M SO HAPPY WITH THE RESULT, REMEMBER TO WATCH UNTIL THE END BECAUSE THERE'S A LITTLE SURPRISE! &amp;#10084;&amp;#65039;&amp;#10;-----&amp;#10;Note: Premiere have chance to be delayed&amp;#10;CHECK THE CHRISTMAS PLAYLIST MARATHON HERE: https://youtube.com/playlist?list=PLD-9CjYt_7tW2Zz8-DEHULmWC2xWbtGoS&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#10052;&amp;#65039; || ABOUT&amp;#10;I was going to use this song for Firestar about Graystripe, but then i realized it already had a map with that version so i picked Mothwing and our new and first Riverclan protagonist Frostpaw! I've no ideia how is her personality and how their relationship will be, so in this &amp;#34;AU&amp;#34; Frostpaw is pretty clumsy what make Mothwing remember a bit about herself when she started to be a Med Cat, then Mothwing give tips and advice to Frostpaw using her soulmate (aka Leafpool) as example about how Leafpool helped/believed in her.&amp;#10;In the second half, Mothwing go let some flowers in Leafpool's tomb, what she don't expect Frostpaw was following her.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#10052;&amp;#65039; || ANIMATORS LIST / TIMESTAMP || &amp;#10052;&amp;#65039;&amp;#10;00:00 @Marinin &amp;#10;00:04 @LunaRainbow 152 &amp;#10;00:08 @LP4ndora &amp;#10;00:13 maggotfluid&amp;#10;00:18 @archerforest Laertive&amp;#10;00:27 Owltrix&amp;#10;00:33 @Swapless Dubs  &amp;#10;00:40 @tootall buggy &amp;#10;00:46 @Ru End Fns_Hope &amp;#10;00:49 Moonhailco&amp;#10;00:53 CaptainCuttlefish&amp;#10;01:01 LemonswithLife @River Fox &amp;#10;01:06 @outsock Nightfree&amp;#10;01:10 @Jayadwal &amp;#10;01:16 @WolfHarmony @Art With MB @RachelAlexanDraws &amp;#10;01:17 @WolfHarmony @Tiny Winy @RachelAlexanDraws &amp;#10;01:20 @WolfHarmony Ratsy @Art With MB @Demi m0n @SplashDreamms c0nuree&amp;#10;01:23 @Tiny Winy @GreatSylveon 2007 &amp;#10;01:28 @Pinktune0z&amp;#10;&amp;#10;SECOND PART || &amp;#10052;&amp;#65039;&amp;#10;01:34 doll draws&amp;#10;01:39 @Otterey Ikana Hairitto&amp;#10;01:43 @Jaytail Nightfree @CL0UD 324 &amp;#10;01:47 @Oviraptorss &amp;#10;01:51 Bright Moon&amp;#10;01:56 @SplashDreamms skyzthelimit Will&amp;#248;w @Art With MB &amp;#10;02:01 @Dr. za 41 &amp;#10;02:06 @Nebula Animates &amp;#10;02:10 Luar&amp;#10;02:15 @Gildedware (aka GildedPhD) &amp;#10;02:19 @RosePocky &amp;#10;02:23 Pogostickz @yaartzzuwu &amp;#10;02:27 @Annywu &amp;#10;02:32 anonx&amp;#10;02:36 @Toxic Catron &amp;#10;02:40 @lindor cat&amp;#10;02:45 Ninnoibat @Otterey  &amp;#10;02:50 @&amp;#8226; Astronomia &amp;#8226; &amp;#8226; LouiesBox &amp;#8226;&amp;#10;02:53 In-Town&amp;#10;02:57 @yaartzzuwu &amp;#10;03:01 xlianyx @Otterey &amp;#10;03:04 @Otterey &amp;#10;03:06 @Arwie Nivryz&amp;#10;03:12 Tater Tot&amp;#10;03:16 storkprince Llriftenn @Gildedware (aka GildedPhD) &amp;#10;03:22 @Oviraptorss berrybovine&amp;#10;&amp;#10;03:38 CREDITS&amp;#10;04:45 VINES&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#10052;&amp;#65039; || DETAILS&amp;#10;MAP CALL: https://youtu.be/63xAQ_c_0ac&amp;#10;Playlist with Complete Parts+Extra Arts: https://youtube.com/playlist?list=PLD-9CjYt_7tXV5YtEZlV7auGhA0ClVnDQ (PLEASE SUPPORT THE ARTISTS)&amp;#10;Thumbnail Winner: @Kaiira  (thank you everyone for all entries and fanarts!!)&amp;#10;Character is from Erin Hunter's series Warriors Cats, and Designs by @Nifty-Senpai @stariitea &amp;#10;Credits art by @Demi m0n &amp;#10;Song: Dawson's Creek - What's a soulmate?"
