    date "2020-11-16T20:00:02Z"
    title "Jayfeather Plays Among Us | Warrior Cats Voice Actors Play  In Character"
    description "Our Warriors voice acted audio book series: https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLnQ9NnikeS61Z3hNjZ58kCSo4vMYZkGiG&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Thumbnail art: https://www.instagram.com/thelastunicorninoz/&amp;#10;&amp;#10;This was a fun 'character' experiment we conducted with a lot of our voice actors to be more in tune with who we play as in the series! We hope you enjoy our version of absolute chaos in Among Us. BIG THANKS TO ALL OUR VA'S FOR PARTICIPATING! WE LOVED DOING THIS. &amp;#10;&amp;#10;Be sure to check out our audio book! We produce chapters for the Warriors Series that are FULLY voice acted!&amp;#10;&amp;#10;For updates on new episodes and artwork, follow our twitter and join our discord! You can also talk to us there too! &amp;#10;https://twitter.com/WarriorsFanDub&amp;#10;https://discord.gg/XCHEFyv&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Our art team is killing it with these images too:&amp;#10;(All @'s are for twitter)&amp;#10;&amp;#10;@Elustraded_&amp;#10;@lastunicorninoz&amp;#10;@softkittiesss&amp;#10;@SmolWolfee&amp;#10;@Kettlings&amp;#10;@BlizzardBrick&amp;#10;@amanyamz&amp;#10;@Kaseypaws&amp;#10;@danfan332&amp;#10;&amp;#10;In correspondence of the Digital Millennium Copyright Act (DMCA) this is a transformative work of the original copyrighted work from Erin Hunter and HarperCollins Publisher. Further, WarriorsFanDubProject claims no ownership of the Warriors series and does not seek to gain from the distribution of this work. these are not meant to be used as a substitute for the professional recordings."
