  [
    id 130
    label "YNPJHYjvFok"
    step 0
    date "2020-07-22T16:00:16Z"
    title "Here I Am [COMPLETE Brambleclaw MAP]"
    description "This MAP follows Brambleclaw on his journey of discovering what 'family' means to him. &amp;#10;&amp;#10;It's here and I love the finished MAP so much! I'm so very very proud of everyone who participated, this turned out better than I even imagined thanks to their passion for the project. It was a real delight to host this with one of my best friends and get to work with so many people - some are artists I've looked up to greatly and others are new to the community and already pack such a punch. Please be sure to check all of them out and subscribe!&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Co-host: @Selket &amp;#10;1:  @Skrapple  &amp;#10;2: Neytherm https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC6WK03P2bRIKlaOYfuudONg&amp;#10;3: @Stem Ginger &amp;#10;4: Kestrl https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCdTbPg8NO8B6_B98TR8lV-Q&amp;#10;5. pokefan1241 https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCKbSJnHa0OSe01JKyG8mDMw&amp;#10;6. Keby &amp;#38; Selket &amp;#10;7. @Cold Rising &amp;#10;8. @Tastyeggos &amp;#10;9. @ursiday &amp;#10;10.  @Finchwing   &amp;#10;11. @bleachwaffle @MidnightThunder &amp;#10;12. @Lunartic Firefly &amp;#10;13. @Buckeera &amp;#10;14. Easel Ear https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCNVbrwU37bRIJDdZI1SujFg&amp;#10;15. @Sagutoyas &amp;#10;16. @SEGAmastergirl  &amp;#10;17. @EphemeralMoth &amp;#10;18. @sad machine &amp;#10;19. frosted.mango https://www.youtube.com/user/silverstarmistclan&amp;#10;20. @Turrkoise &amp;#10;21.  @Nightrizer Selket&amp;#10;22. Costello Cat https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCXNuZ0gn02Jy_8E63mvFbNw&amp;#10;23. Sidesteph https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCFaVKLLDYUuFHGQ7fsXeseg&amp;#10;24. @HarvestBrook &amp;#10;25. Iblis https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCuwMQ0FDYsclu0UAt865VnQ&amp;#10;26. @Ottie &amp;#10;Thumbnal by @Mudshadow &amp;#10;Main designs by @Keby (Lynxspots) , additional designs by @GEKKOZILLA &amp;#10;&amp;#10;Based on the Warrior Cats books by Erin Hunter.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#9473;&amp;#9473;&amp;#9473;&amp;#8729;&amp;#9675;&amp;#8729;&amp;#9788;&amp;#8729;&amp;#9675;&amp;#8729;&amp;#9473;&amp;#9473;&amp;#9473;&amp;#9473;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Thank you so much to my supporters on Patreon for funding my creative work. &amp;#9829; Consider supporting me there to gain access to tutorials, exclusive content and to see my work before anyone else!&amp;#10; &amp;#10;&amp;#127811; PATREON: https://www.patreon.com/m/Lynxspots&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#9473;&amp;#9473;&amp;#9473;&amp;#8729;&amp;#9675;&amp;#8729;&amp;#9788;&amp;#8729;&amp;#9675;&amp;#8729;&amp;#9473;&amp;#9473;&amp;#9473;&amp;#9473;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;New to my channel? Hello! My name is Keilidh but I'm more commonly known as Keby or Lynxspots around the web. I'm a Scottish animator and published author, best known for directing the viral short film 'Fox Fires' - a British Animation Awards nominee that you can watch right here on YouTube! https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=sN5goxeTfjc&amp;#38;t=1s&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#9473;&amp;#9473;&amp;#9473;&amp;#8729;&amp;#9675;&amp;#8729;&amp;#9788;&amp;#8729;&amp;#9675;&amp;#8729;&amp;#9473;&amp;#9473;&amp;#9473;&amp;#9473;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Let's keep in touch! &amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#127811;DISCORD (13+): https://discord.com/invite/aJWC8fb5kz&amp;#10;&amp;#127811;TWITTER: https://twitter.com/lynxspots&amp;#10;&amp;#127811;INSTAGRAM: https://www.instagram.com/lynxspots/&amp;#10;&amp;#127811;TUMBLR: https://lynxspots.tumblr.com/&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#9473;&amp;#9473;&amp;#9473;&amp;#8729;&amp;#9675;&amp;#8729;&amp;#9788;&amp;#8729;&amp;#9675;&amp;#8729;&amp;#9473;&amp;#9473;&amp;#9473;&amp;#9473;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Thank you for watching!"
    channeltitle "Keby (Lynxspots)"
