    step 0
    date "2021-12-25T20:00:12Z"
    title "BRAMBLEFUR [Complete 2 week Ashfur Warriors MAP]"
    description "!!!This video contains graphic implications of animal death, animal skinning, abuse, and creepy/unsettling themes!!!&amp;#10;&amp;#10;This AU is called Bramblefur because Ashfur is obsessed with becoming Brambleclaw! Ashfur thinks that if he can look like Brambleclaw that Squirrelflight will love him. So he changes his name to Bramblefur and his hairstyle to look like Brambleclaw's but looking like Brambleclaw isn't enough.. he has to BE Brambleclaw.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;SONG: Fire by That Handsome Devil https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=bD9Mc8golVE&amp;#10;END CREDITS SONG: Bare by That Handsome Devil https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Bw5BlJd0tdY&amp;#10;&amp;#10;MAP part playlist: https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLbSyL5k7nLJj9zjmQhE_4vgZYrPl7ErFk&amp;#10;&amp;#10;ORGINAL SCRIPT: https://docs.google.com/document/d/1mkNoVMaqLK_hpWw0L2mnwygib1r0m7Zn-18CoPD6Gik/edit&amp;#10;STORYBOARD: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=m7yjfxTBdLQ&amp;#10;Thumbnail entries: https://docs.google.com/document/d/1kUdPjS_wSL_YsM4MWl56XjUDSd99fm2TXQwwsLTdjf4/edit?usp=sharing&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;--PARTICIPANTS--&amp;#10;Intro: CheetehZ + MintzyLeevez&amp;#10;1: Cameron Collar&amp;#10;2: Sparroet + Galaxymew&amp;#10;3: Northern Red&amp;#10;4: Bregottski + owlipoppen&amp;#10;5: HJ7 &amp;#10;6: Finchwing&amp;#10;7: LunarTempest + Redbear + FISHSOCKS + Cerkowah&amp;#10;8: Shenkkazoo&amp;#10;9: Cameron Collar + Sparroet + KristalKarma&amp;#10;10a: Sqwid + CheetehZ + kittlet&amp;#10;10b: Owlipoppen + Eqqnoq + KristalKarma&amp;#10;11a: Pandaa + CheetehZ&amp;#10;11b: melowon_z&amp;#10;12:  SolarSparky + Nauro + Cante Skuya + Sparroet + Galaxymew&amp;#10;13: Luyeshin + DaveThyQueen&amp;#10;14: Aspen Shadow&amp;#10;15: Sagutoyas&amp;#10;16: Jaytail + lulucky&amp;#10;17: Starcheopteryx&amp;#10;18: peacat + bregottski + relli + CheetehZ&amp;#10;19: CrunchyCrowe + Galaxymew&amp;#10;20: Kalublah Art&amp;#10;21: Dark-yard&amp;#10;22: relli&amp;#10;23: VYRITE + Thunder Streak + Theoncomin