    label "cIsaLuMsY6g"
    step 0
    date "2022-07-01T16:00:01Z"
    title "WCAnimated Casting Call RESULTS (Round 2) - Warriors: Into the Wild"
    description "At last, the results of our second casting call! With over 2,000 auditions, this casting call was a huge success. Thank you for your patience as we reviewed all submissions. We couldn't do it without each and every one of you. Thank you. &amp;#10;&amp;#10;If you didn't get a role this time, don't worry! There will be many more chances!&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Please support our incredibly talented cast:&amp;#10;&amp;#10;WHITESTORM&amp;#10;MacLeod Andrews (https://twitter.com/MacLeodAndrews)&amp;#10;&amp;#10;LONGTAIL&amp;#10;Jordan Harshaw (@grindor32)&amp;#10;&amp;#10;RAVENPAW&amp;#10;Connor Bushoven (https://instagram.com/cbushoven)&amp;#10;&amp;#10;TIGERCLAW&amp;#10;Kevin Urban (https://twitter.com/KUrbzVO)&amp;#10;&amp;#10;SANDPAW&amp;#10;Loganne Digma (https://twitter.com/loganne_digma)&amp;#10;&amp;#10;DUSTPAW&amp;#10;Ryan Hoyle (https://twitter.com/hoyleryan)&amp;#10;&amp;#10;YELLOWFANG&amp;#10;Sarah Ruth Thomas (https://twitter.com/SarahRuthVoice)&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;WCAnimated is a fan-made project seeking to adapt Erin Hunter&amp;#8217;s bestselling WARRIORS books into an animated web series. Our team is made up of over 100 artists working to bring this series to life!&amp;#10;&amp;#10;For more information and content:&amp;#10;Carrd - https://wcanimated.carrd.co&amp;#10;Instagram - https://www.instagram.com/wcanimated&amp;#10;Twitter - https://twitter.com/wcanimated&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Interested in supporting our project further? Consider subscribing to our Patreon, where you can join our exclusive Discord server and earn amazing rewards starting at just $5 a month! &amp;#10;This video was made available early for our Patrons. Subscribe for exclusive content and early access!&amp;#10;&amp;#10;https://www.patreon.com/wcanimated&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Money will go to help our team get proper programs and resources for their work on the project and any extra funds will go to nonprofit/charity organizations!&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;C R E D I T S&amp;#10;Directed by&amp;#10;Jupiter (@flamingjup)&amp;#10;Tune (@Showtune Cockatoo)&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Additional Art Direction by&amp;#10;King (@King Cabbage)&amp;#10;Mariah (@mariah.tekulve)&amp;#10;Pomi (@ppomibe)&amp;#10;Neko (@petuniabubbles)&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Character Art by&amp;#10;Gothfrog (@Gothfrog)&amp;#10;Silverxtreeem ( @SilverXtreeem  ) &amp;#10;Outkorp (@Outkorp)&amp;#10;Mel (@HulluMel B.)&amp;#10;King (@King Cabbage)&amp;#10;FireTheWolf ( @FireTheWolf)&amp;#10;Mariah (@mariah.tekulve)&amp;#10;Ehnala (@Ehnala)&amp;#10;ZuleDraws (@Zuledraws)&amp;#10;Sundyr (@Sundyr)&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Background by&amp;#10;Pomi (@ppomibe)&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Sound Mixing by&amp;#10;Shiro (@Shirokishi) &amp;#10;&amp;#10;Editing &amp;#38; Compositing by&amp;#10;Neko (@petuniabubbles)"
