    step 0
    date "2019-05-23T16:58:46Z"
    title "Sol  Complete Warrior Cats M.A.P."
    description "This map is about Sol and his story arc in the Warriors Books.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;What is a M.A.P. ? It stands for Multi Animator Project, so each part was animated by a different person! They had set designs and a script, which if you'd like you can check out here! https://youtu.be/dYalmEj31VI&amp;#10;&amp;#10;SONG: Everything Moves by Bronze Radio Return&amp;#10;END CREDITS SONG: Cannonball by Bronze Radio Return&amp;#10;STORY: Warriors by Erin Hunter&amp;#10;THUMBNAIL: By my friend Shelby! https://www.youtube.com/user/TheShablyOh&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Map Parts Playlist: https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLoK0wHR2eMSPICffvchkbDi7OTZ8P0_bf&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Head Animators:&amp;#10;Intro: Meow 286 https://www.youtube.com/user/kirbysamful&amp;#10;Part 1: SEGAmastergirl https://www.youtube.com/user/SEGAmastergirl&amp;#10;Part 2: Leona Vultura https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCPt6LTVxQ9VcNyUASnoaioA&amp;#10;Part 3: AlmightyBroom https://www.instagram.com/windsweep/&amp;#10;Part 4: Quecosillas https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCfYg1UJOz0QZm_ji-hQdxPg&amp;#10;Part 5: Aspen Shadow https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCRz_bd-AqPa_7cFAKaYheiQ&amp;#10;Part 6: Amelia Bothe https://www.youtube.com/user/animguy100&amp;#10;Part 7: Shatterwing123 https://www.youtube.com/user/Shatterwing123&amp;#10;Part 8: Nightfeather https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCGekYMnb0nxNqQJh-tiVsXw&amp;#10;Part 9: brigostore https://www.youtube.com/user/SpadeSisters&amp;#10;Part 10: Icefelis Otsukimi https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCxsJVCdegHHHAmU6wogVKyQ&amp;#10;Part 11: TheWisestDino https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCAlCAJGDpcE4Uf7G9Qbktkw&amp;#10;Part 12: Riley Ellis https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCiAwdqEhdCo0Yrs8l1-9muw&amp;#10;Part 13: Bok Bok Choy  https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCpp0KroTWKBoRUdagVmivuw&amp;#10; &amp;#38; Tastyeggos https://www.youtube.com/user/ThePikachu368&amp;#10;Part 14: Siri the Shrimp https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCZ43i4wTQvMnOVclGtpkvrw&amp;#10;Part 15: Keby https://www.youtube.com/user/KeilidhBee&amp;#10;Part 16: LolzNeo https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC5V9CZ02W1vIt1ZXIoS7ZdA&amp;#10;Part 17: XxLunaWarriorxX https://www.youtube.com/user/XxLunawarriorxX&amp;#10;Part 18: raevei https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC1QGZedVZMLJAHfwTy3oryg&amp;#10;Part 19: Sagutoyas https://www.youtube.com/user/Sagutoyas&amp;#10;Part 20: Rookon https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCa78Z0dtSZ6z8Ni6UqFQnMw&amp;#10;Part 21: AlphaDuck https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCvaU5mw7npTnQZx31iRkW6A&amp;#10;Part 22: ArcherDetective https://www.youtube.com/user/wand3ringranger128&amp;#10;Part 23: Shayxy https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC3FR5u6GROmVXcstaE_u2IQ&amp;#10;Part 24: Sarah Sellers- DragonwolfRooke https://www.youtube.com/user/DragonwolfRooke&amp;#10;Part 25: Cranberry the Cat https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC8pj8BCp8vGt_UcgDw0Yr-w&amp;#10;Part 26: Yeshika https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCwVagYvL9KnN0MWQZBKTXYg&amp;#10;&amp;#38; Kishiko https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCEzHxNBMiGnWIhvBuXA4lvw&amp;#10;Part 27: starrywishy (Wishy) https://www.youtube.com/user/Leafpool905&amp;#10;Part 28: Nightfall https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCIYluuG4BD7cUmmp0Qzt7ug&amp;#10;Part 29: Forest https://www.youtube.com/user/forestcatclan&amp;#10;Part 30: hollyleevs https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCE0vezNk5Vayd5d1hirKOug&amp;#10;Part 31: ashtrall https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC6XqCt-8nhZXMV_i0oVLWig&amp;#10; &amp;#38; TheFieryFenec https://www.youtube.com/user/mystichowl101&amp;#10; &amp;#38; ocellifera https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCs-x8Yh09c5p0plVjvUmAeg&amp;#10;Part 32: teejsaurus https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCM2Y-560zThHfKJ1wi7paqQ&amp;#10;Part 33: SeaSalt https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC5edagvhbhBWWc9i7vG9noQ&amp;#10;Part 34: RavenEcho https://www.youtube.com/channel/UChNYHjpOrD4wgWsrAn6EBjA&amp;#10;Part 35: beffalumps https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC2jhE6SQWvhY7io4NpVBckQ&amp;#10;Ending drawn by me.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Thank you so much to everyone in the Discord, who gave support to all the animators and made the place such a wonderful environment of support, love, and fun times.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;And thank you to everyone who watched this project from start to finish, and who created fan-art for it, hype for it, and were wonderfully patient with the people involved.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;And as always...&amp;#10;Thanks for watching!&amp;#10;&amp;#10;This video has not been monetized by my channel. Everyone involved in the creation of this project was working non-profit. This is a fan project."
