    id 169
    label "FX8-i1x-Mlg"
    step 0
    date "2022-02-13T22:00:19Z"
    title "MAGGOT BELLY // Complete Frecklewish Warriors MAP"
    description "!!!!WARNING: this video contains content that may not be suitable to all viewers, including:&amp;#10;bug/spider imagery, eye injury (skip 0:18-0:20), mentions of suicide (skip 3:42-3:45)&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Maggot Belly is a storyboarded MAP (Multi-Animator Project) exploring the themes of the character Frecklewish from the Warriors series. She is a character heavily motivated by her inability to cope with her grief, stemming from her brother&amp;#8217;s death. &amp;#10;This MAP explores the implications of her actions in the series and dives deeper into the character through the use of symbolism. Her devotion to her brother, Birchface, is shown in a world of bugs, and how focused she is on him and how she sees everything that&amp;#8217;s hurt her brother evil, like predators. &amp;#10;&amp;#10;- HORRAY!!!!!!! it's done!!!!!!!! thank you so so so much to everyone who made this possible, this was so much fun to work with brought so many lovely creative minds together to bring you this finished masterpiece!!! i cant thank you all enough, whether youre a participant or just a subscriber, you helped make this possible!!!!!! please enjoy!!!!!!&amp;#10;&amp;#10;MAP CALL: https://youtu.be/7zBXxG6vCT8&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#129419; MAP PARTS:&amp;#10;intro 1. aster_oid &amp;#10;       - https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCGksyehYaL3MSj7pZH7zuAw&amp;#10;intro 2. mossysprout&amp;#10;       - https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCLPxMs-em2DYOpw0JjuFeiA&amp;#10;1. fernskullz&amp;#10;       - https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCnA-2CpO8BIGJoByg2h_6tA&amp;#10;2. Patchypeak&amp;#10;       - https://www.youtube.com/channel/UClomk6ak1duw0aHU73MJGUQ&amp;#10;3. centauri&amp;#10;       - https://www.youtube.com/user/latona11&amp;#10;4. Pigeocore + ThisCatIsOnFire&amp;#10;       - https://www.youtube.com/c/Pigeocore&amp;#10;       - https://www.youtube.com/c/ThisCatIsOnFire69420&amp;#10;5. RosePocky&amp;#10;       - https://www.youtube.com/c/RosePocky&amp;#10;6. araxie&amp;#10;       - https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCPLLME-VhD98Km3laxyEEkQ&amp;#10;7. atelierr&amp;#10;       - https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCmAQexu9uYiQnsVCRSP5tww&amp;#10;8. hollyclouds&amp;#10;       - https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCjQQGuJl8ossoN6woTkOynQ&amp;#10;9. CustradCrev + muckrooms + cryptidrose + Lady Callow&amp;#10;       - https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCVVbnU_zDl4mW2ZtcEkQPnA&amp;#10;       - https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCHHlXhsBdMubUqR2IA1OKeQ&amp;#10;       - https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCjOrM31wUhwzNc5EE2fu46A&amp;#10;       - https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCCpxE8ThtTpyodzW-eZhqiw&amp;#10;10. EphemeralMoth&amp;#10;       - https://www.youtube.com/c/EphemeralMoth&amp;#10;11. storkprince &amp;#10;       - https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCOIk4vMtQrLPEC4QqJuJ5Xw&amp;#10;12. stariitea &amp;#10;       - https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCI1C6CZr-jlSTRwKtuHKKlQ&amp;#10;13. Cante Skuya &amp;#10;       - https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCoBik63iJYweo0O2vlcjEQg&amp;#10;14. Cat Frost + Rotriestre&amp;#10;       - https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCcEGfTVHzlZ4QcBVGvdlyVg&amp;#10;       - https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCthr0nmY-_z3Sl6rYXhpxmQ&amp;#10;15. melowon_Z + flecks&amp;#10;       - https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCauiWZqo0AbBm2A90Nk7OVw&amp;#10;       - https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCNgbM3kOWeuHFPhKqyO5Q7g&amp;#10;16. Shummy &amp;#10;       - https://youtu.be/Eko1nuUiCFU&amp;#10;17. lambhop&amp;#10;       - https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCsZaz5JKDpPMAZObUBPToFQ&amp;#10;18. Gildedware &amp;#10;       - https://www.youtube.com/c/GildedPhD&amp;#10;19. immilknahap&amp;#10;       - https://www.youtube.com/c/immilknahap&amp;#10;20. kirikerise&amp;#10;       - https://www.youtube.com/c/kirikerise&amp;#10;21. Quirkrash '&amp;#10;       - https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCxRObFVpozN6wS7nxRKf7OA&amp;#10;22. OFUKITTY &amp;#10;       - https://www.youtube.com/c/OFUKITTY&amp;#10;23. Vampviz &amp;#10;       - https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC8_nHR3PIGt