  [
    id 190
    label "22o2QWEHGfw"
    step 0
    date "2021-09-08T23:00:14Z"
    title "POOR GEORGE - Complete Yellowfang  Brokenstar MAP (Warriors)"
    description "https://raventrust.com/?utm_source=google_cpc&amp;#38;utm_medium=ad_grant&amp;#38;utm_campaign=branded&amp;#38;gclid=Cj0KCQjw-NaJBhDsARIsAAja6dNrWho0YOdp20xbF-9i2B-5qhoTBVp6C34R8eTgN5FxSCUYmpIqinEaAm0vEALw_wcB&amp;#10;https://twitter.com/savefairycreek?lang=en&amp;#10;https://www.stopline3.org/&amp;#10;https://www.irsss.ca&amp;#10;https://unistoten.camp/media/invasion/&amp;#10;https://www.redfeather.org&amp;#10;https://www.nativewomenswilderness.org&amp;#10;https://www.csvanw.org&amp;#10;https://www.aises.org&amp;#10;&amp;#10;^ Please check out the links above and donate if you can!&amp;#10;&amp;#10;IMPORTANT READS (More to be added) &amp;#8212; &amp;#10;&amp;#10;https://docs.google.com/document/u/0/d/1_2k-ZVwFfhlPoAR2h0LO4U3EwZMrN60iSKCoI2Qn89w/mobilebasic&amp;#10;&amp;#10;https://docs.google.com/document/u/0/d/1nnCCD4TfR-5MZie9hQgpDfEE4mYpCtjNXQpD9VqOkxs/mobilebasic (I implore you to read this entire doc carefully, as it goes over the harmful Native/Indigenous stereotypes in Warriors.)&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Update 9/26/2021: Beautiful colored subtitles have been added by my good friend @owlipoppen !&amp;#10;&amp;#10;MUSIC: Poor George by James Supercave&amp;#10;https://www.jamessupercave.com/&amp;#10;https://jamessupercave.bigcartel.com/&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#10022; What are MAPs? &amp;#10022;&amp;#10;'MAP&amp;#8217; is an abbreviation for Multi Animator Project.  They are nonprofit animated videos set to music or scenes from movies/TV.  The audio is spliced into individual &amp;#34;parts,&amp;#34; sometimes paired with a script.  Each part is animated by a different artist till the host edits them together into a finished video.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#10022; What is Warriors? &amp;#10022;&amp;#10;Warriors is a 2003 fantasy series about wild cats.  It is still ongoing and has amassed a huge art/animation community with young and older artists alike.  This MAP is based on events in the first arc.  Warriors has also drawn rightful criticism from various Indigenous communities for its stereotyping and extremely poor handling of the &amp;#8220;Tribe.&amp;#8221;  If you consume Warriors content I implore you to listen to and boost all Indigenous voices and educate yourself.  Resources will be added the more I discover them/are released.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#10022; What is this MAP about? &amp;#10022;&amp;#10;Poor George follows grizzled Yellowfang as she watches her son, Brokenstar, become a tyrannical leader.  She puts an end to his reign by blinding him and later poisoning him with yew berries.  The MAP opens later on in her life as she stands over a dead Brokenstar.  She vents to her close friend, Fireheart, wishing things could&amp;#8217;ve ended differently.  After a disturbing vision we look back on how everything unfolded.  We see Yellowfang&amp;#8217;s traumatizing birth, the murder of her estranged mate, and Brokenstar&amp;#8217;s rise to power.  A notable part of his leadership was his use of child soldiers &amp;#8212; depicted here as a throne of dead kittens.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Original doc &amp;#38; script: https://docs.google.com/document/d/15cMUT7iNKQpyqWXRK-FismVBAouov721jC47r4_RWM0/edit&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#10022; Artists &amp;#10022;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;THUMBNAIL: @Frankie B Catt &amp;#10;&amp;#10;INTRO:  @Osinka 0:08&amp;#10;1.  @Amelia B 0:28&amp;#10;2.  @Speed heart  0:36&amp;#10;3.  @patchwork 0:45&amp;#10;4A.  @ThisCatIsOnFire 0:54&amp;#10;4B.  @Cold Rising 1:00&amp;#10;5.   @birdkiye 1:04 (I forgot to add this username in the credits, so terribly sorry to the participant)&amp;#10;6.  @Autumn Lynx 1:11&amp;#10;7.  @aelou @sorrelstream 1:21&amp;#10;8.  @SoftServe 1:29&amp;#10;9.  @Glitch Sixxle 1:38&amp;#10;10. @blaire wildflower  1:47&amp;#10;11.  @Artisminerva 1:55&amp;#10;12.  @Gildedware (aka GildedPhD) 2:01&amp;#10;13.  @RedBear 2:09&amp;#10;14.  @CHURIMP 2:17&amp;#10;15.  @Mary_MS_Jay 2:26&amp;#10;16.  @Sagutoyas @Keby (Lynxspots) @Okami Wolven 2:34&amp;#10;17.  @Zelarhie 2:43&amp;#10;18.  @Ottie 2:52&amp;#10;19.  @Goldenwing @HJ7 3:01&amp;#10;20.  @araxie @HJ7 3:10&amp;#10;21.  @-Lighth0use- 3:15&amp;#10;22.  @Twinspired 3:24&amp;#10;23.  @Frankie B Catt @VYRITE 3:31&amp;#10;24.  @dream-inq 3:40&amp;#10;25.  @The Oncoming Snail @VYRITE 3:49&amp;#10;26. @REVOYARD, Anonymous collaborator 3:57&amp;#10;27.  @cinnabarlab 4:06&amp;#10;28.  @ursiday 4:14&amp;#10;29.  @ursiday &amp;#10;30. @Annywu 4:29&amp;#10;31. @daniel wentz 4:37&amp;#10;&amp;#10;CREDITS:  @Mudshadow   4:50&amp;#10;&amp;#10;POST-CREDITS AUDIO: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=BsJ3tugVfl4&amp;#10;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=7IOyOW_B3Cw&amp;#10;&amp;#10;FANART: 6:26 Unfortunately I couldn't fit in as many submissions as I thought, so PLEASE go through this gallery and marvel at all the fantastic work! https://mapfanart.carrd.co/&amp;#10;&amp;#10;POST-CREDITS SCENE: bread cat 7:16&amp;#10;&amp;#10;wow, over a year later and it's here! i'm so thrilled with this project. everyone did a spectacular job! this was my second MAP and my first to be completed and i'm absolutely in love with it. thank you to everyone who's shown interest as well, you guys are gems!!&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Tumblr: https://loafpaw.tumblr.com/&amp;#8203;&amp;#8203;&amp;#10;Twitter: https://twitter.com/loafpaw&amp;#8203;&amp;#8203;&amp;#10;Instagram: https://www.instagram.com/loafpaw/&amp;#8203;&amp;#8203;&amp;#10;Ko-fi: https://ko-fi.com/loafpaw&amp;#8203;&amp;#8203;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;https://blacklivesmatters.carrd.co/&amp;#8203;&amp;#10;https://t.co/OxCiMbvnTS?amp=1&amp;#8203;&amp;#10;https://blacktranslivesmatter.carrd.c...&amp;#10;https://blackartistresources.carrd.co/&amp;#8203;&amp;#8203;&amp;#10;https://saytheirnames.carrd.co/"
