    id 203
    label "QlmIsrCxqYg"
    step 0
    date "2022-02-15T00:16:04Z"
    title "Warrior Cats Completed Friendship MAP- You Get Me"
    description "this MAP is apart of the Valentine's Mapathon! playlist can be found here! please check out all the MAPS!: https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PL7Rv_D24sSPcl_MxC-uocEzNL6I4Cf8FC&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Happy Valentine's Day! Remember to celebrate the loved ones in your life, including friends, teachers, grandparents, and partners! &amp;#9829;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Big special thanks to all the participants and backups who really stepped up to get this finished in time! Much appreciated!&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Be sure to check out each participants parts and show your support and spread some love! : )&amp;#10;&amp;#10;PARTS:&amp;#10;1. KindaDweebish (Shadowsight and Rootspring)  &amp;#10;2. Aspenshadow (Blackstar and Russetfur)  &amp;#10;3. Mephitis_Cerasus + Helianthanas  (Cinderpelt and Brightheart)  &amp;#10;4. Sunset Raven (Ferncloud, Cody, and Birchkit)   &amp;#10;5. LeafingAround + Ignoring Tree (Cinderpelt and Littlecloud)  &amp;#10;6. Patchypeak (Sorreltail, Sootfur, and Rainwhisker)  &amp;#10;7. Dakatofruit + yaartzzuwu (Hollypaw and Willowpaw)  &amp;#10;8. babygourd (Leopardstar, Sasha, and Russetfur) &amp;#10;8a. sadmachine + orionfujiwara (Whitestorm and Fireheart)  &amp;#10;9. Annyuwu  (Ivypool and Blossomfall)   &amp;#10;10. griffinbatkitten (Jayfeather and Briarlight)  &amp;#10;11. SarahsellersandRooke + froste (Longtail and Mousefur)  &amp;#10;12. riin + yaartzzuwu (Hollyleaf and Cinderheart)  &amp;#10;13. Flawiusz-Sama + Marinin + tiger light (Yellowfang and Fireheart)  &amp;#10;14. kuuttituutti (Fleck and Crookedkit)   &amp;#10;15. sliced rat (Squirrelflight and Moonlight)  &amp;#10;16. Aridarchen (Ravenpaw and Barley)  &amp;#10;17. Fleur de Sureau (Badgerfang and Flintfang)  &amp;#10;18. Ilbis (Firestar and Graystripe and Ravenpaw) &amp;#10;&amp;#10;CREDITS:&amp;#10;1. SaltedEgg (Crookedstar and Brambleberry)   &amp;#10;2. Gaia Meroaw (Gray Wing and Windrunner)  &amp;#10;3. Spirited Cloud + JulianOliver (Smudge and Rusty/Firepaw)  &amp;#10;4. giingersnaps (Longtail and Swiftpaw)  &amp;#10;5. nittlebrittle (Leafpaw/pool and Sorreltail)  &amp;#10;6. emberwings (Leopardstar and Sunfish)  &amp;#10;7. Martletwing + JulianOliver (Dawnstripe and Talltail)  &amp;#10;8. Pascall (Jayfeather and Alderheart)&amp;#10;9. grimalkind (Hollyleaf and Ivypool)  &amp;#10;10. Bregottski (Brightheart and Daisy)    &amp;#10;11. ignorningtree (Yellowkit/fang and Silverflame)  &amp;#10;12. artaintfart (Willowpaw and Mothwing)  &amp;#10;&amp;#10;~~~~~~~~~~~~~&amp;#10;Song: Talking Friends (slowed and reverbed) by Talking Tom and Angela&amp;#10;Credits Song: Count On You (acoustic cover) by KenYOfficial&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Series: Warrior Cats&amp;#10;~~~~~~~~~~~~~&amp;#10;Tumblr: @projectshadovv&amp;#10;Twitter: @sadmachlne666 (the i is a lower case L)&amp;#10;~~~~~~~~~~~~~&amp;#10;Copyright Disclaimer Under Section 107 of the Copyright Act 1976, allowance is made for &amp;#34;fair use&amp;#34; for purposes such as criticism, comment, news reporting, teaching, scholarship, and research. Fair use is a use permitted by copyright statute that might otherwise be infringing. Non-profit, educational or personal use tips the balance in favor of fair use."
