    id 204
    label "EEAn4gKz1q4"
    step 0
    date "2021-08-12T01:45:11Z"
    title "Warrior Cats - Forest of Secrets: Episode 2 - "
    description "The first 1,000 people to use this link will get a 1 month free trial of Skillshare: https://skl.sh/pinkbunnygirl4308211&amp;#10;This video is sponsored by Skillshare!&amp;#10;...&amp;#10;&amp;#10;This episode is inspired by chapters 2 and 3 of Warriors: Forest of Secrets (pgs. 24 - 47) and some parts of Redtail's Debt, so you can follow along in the book.&amp;#10;...&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Celebrate the release of Forest of Secrets by picking up a set of pins of your favorite characters, it really helps to support our channel :) &amp;#10;https://etsy.me/3xYROVm&amp;#10;Pins and Coloring Sheets will be 50% off until August 19th!&amp;#10;...&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Join my channel membership to unlock badges by your username, emojis, etsy savings and behind-the-scenes content! https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCrO88UhdXvN4wokfz8AwnHw/join&amp;#10;...&amp;#10;&amp;#10;I'm super proud of Episode 2 of Forest of Secrets! I drew a lot of inspiration from Redtail's Debt for the battle at Sunningrocks, at least the accurate parts of Redtail's Debt, lol. :) It feels so good to finally find this piece of the puzzle Fireheart has been trying to uncover since he was an apprentice! Let me know your thoughts in the comments! &amp;#10;...&amp;#10;&amp;#10;We have come to the decision to close our P.O. Box, so we are no longer accepting physical letters and packages but there are still some options if you want to share something you've made with us!&amp;#10;&amp;#10;You can share it on my Amino! Pinkbunnygirl43 Official Amino!&amp;#10;Link to Download: https://bit.ly/2Ta75Sq&amp;#10;Share artwork for us in posts with the hastag - FanMail or personal message us on Amino! &amp;#10;&amp;#10;And another option! You can also always shoot me an email anytime if you have artwork to share or questions you'd like answered, my email is enterme43@gmail.com&amp;#10;&amp;#10;We will not be filming fan mail opening videos or reaction videos to things sent on Amino or by email, but you'll get a response from us in a more timely manner. :) &amp;#10;&amp;#10;...&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Want some real life warriors cats? Subscribe to my cats' channel! Daily cat videos!&amp;#10;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=6V8G47hFB6Q&amp;#10;&amp;#10;0:00 - 1:17 Sponsored by Skillshare&amp;#10;1:18 - 10:00 Forest of Secrets: Episode 2&amp;#10;10:01 - 12:01 Credits/Voice Actor Bloopers&amp;#10;12:02 - 13:40 Thanks + Outro"
