  [
    id 206
    label "oMfrkdehMDg"
    step 0
    date "2020-03-14T18:30:15Z"
    title " COMPLETE 72 HOUR WARRIOR CATS CANON AND OC AU MAP"
    description "SUMMARY&amp;#10;Time travelling Warriors OCs pop out of portals to change spots in canon, save lives, try to prevent bad things, and have a bit of silliness. The crystals on their foreheads show the viewer who's an OC and who's a canon cat. The crystals let the OCs see possible branches of the timeline. (Yes, there is a little bit of Rick and Morty inspiration in this)&amp;#10;&amp;#10;The MAP was not scripted&amp;#8212;each participant was allowed to change whatever event for whichever cat they liked. &amp;#10;&amp;#10;COMMENTARY&amp;#10;WOOF here's another one finished! @GiingerSnaps  was my awesome cohost yet again, make sure to sub to them if you aren't already because they are irreplaceable. Everyone showed so much enthusiasm and got their parts done SO quickly, I am extremely thankful to all of our wonderful participants. Watch until the end for an extra surprise these crazy fools made of their own free will. You'll see we had a bit of fun with this MAP XD Don't forget to check out the channels if you see any unfamiliar names! &amp;#10;&amp;#10;We've seen a lot of interest from people about creating spin off maps based on this AU&amp;#8212;you're more than welcome to, you don't have to ask! Please refer to this info sheet: https://docs.google.com/document/d/1OtehqUGSej64sVTeRmbcNfGfQtyYj5YcSKH7wQj0dH4/edit?usp=sharing&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Later edit: Some time ago I saw a concern that because some cats had their canon disabilities prevented, this is erasing the representation of disabled characters in the story. This had not occurred to me when I was approving ideas for parts, but now that I've heard it said I think that's a great point and I should've encouraged ideas in another direction. This is on me, NOT any of the participants who I told their idea was fine without realizing. In respect of all of this, I ran the second Time Machine MAP differently, and in the info sheet about spin off MAPs I encourage any other hosts of these MAPs to do the same. &amp;#10;&amp;#10;Parts Playlist: https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLuAFTIlbuIN3YngHisVZmB-MRLAGKXRIL&amp;#10;MAP Call: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=pShHQ5qMwQY&amp;#10;&amp;#10;PARTICIPANTS&amp;#10;Thumbnail:  @GiingerSnaps &amp;#10;Part 1:  @EphemeralMoth Saving Ashfur from Hollyleaf (so she won't have to run away!)&amp;#10;Part 2:  @Deer Drops Saving Whitestorm from Bone&amp;#10;Part 3: @Catart Startling Goosefeather to stop him chasing Stormkit into the river&amp;#10;Part 4:  @Koskot Owl koskot owl (Mistakenly credited as kostkot owl in the MAP, I am so, so sorry!) Saving Spottedleaf from Clawface&amp;#10;Part 5:  @crispyyflake Scaring Cloudpaw away from the twoleg den&amp;#10;Part 6:  @HarvestBrook Encouraging Cinderpaw to pursue being a warrior despite her injury&amp;#10;Part 7:  @CheekyTiger Stopping Darkstripe from feeding deathberries to Sorrelkit&amp;#10;Part 8:   @mobiusghost Providing herbs to Alderpaw so he can save Sandstorm&amp;#10;Part 9:  @InterstellarKip Helping Needletail and Violetpaw escape, leading to Needletail becoming the leader of ShadowClan&amp;#10;Part 10:  @Chilly Weathers Saving Greypool from Tigerstar&amp;#10;Part 11:  @Kestrill Convincing Leafpool to be honest about her kits parentage&amp;#10;Part 12: @GildedPhD Removing Badgerpaw from the battle, sending him home to his mother&amp;#10;Part 13: draghins (https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCFDmmUjHC63-Oj7_0VH77vw) Creating the sign BEFORE Hawkfrost does so Mothwing&amp;#8217;s faith isn&amp;#8217;t shaken by his betrayal&amp;#10;Part 14: @Lunala's Mask Sending Tiny back to his house before he gains a following&amp;#10;Part 15: @cinnabarlab Saving Flametail from drowning&amp;#10;Part 16:  @GiingerSnaps Catching the hawk so it can't take Snowkit&amp;#10;Part 17: @Helianthanas Saving Shadowsight from his mystery assailant&amp;#10;Part 18:  Annywu (https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCP-od5SSyPgV6Ok4keQSU2Q) Showing Yellowfang a path out of the fire&amp;#10;Part 19:  @Sunflower Cougar Saving Mapleshade's kits from drowning&amp;#10;Part 20: @Canarysong Sending Darkkit to WindClan with Onewhisker so he doesn't grow up to create The Kin&amp;#10;Part 21: @E.J Kraft Giving baby Sol and his siblings a home in SkyClan&amp;#10;Part 22: Miimsey (https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC-ixTFwnZ-8jpOKUGR3H0mw) Stealing from Sweetpaw, Rosepaw and Bluefur the mouse that made them sick&amp;#10;Part 23:  @Rad Butt Catching the rabbit that blinded Longtail&amp;#10;Part 24:  @Jixxi Helping Swiftpaw make it away from the dogs&amp;#10;Part 25:  @RachelAlexanDraws Preventing the tree from falling on Briarlight&amp;#10;Part 26: @Osinka Scaring Sharptooth away with shadows on the cave wall&amp;#10;Part 27: Gecko Draws (https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCuUfDugqU4JpI1W3mDfDRXg) Showing Fallen Leaves out of the flooding tunnels&amp;#10;Part 28:  @Crowla Portaling retiree Half Moon to Jayfeather&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Songs: &amp;#10;&amp;#8220;Time Machine&amp;#8221; by Robyn&amp;#10;&amp;#34;Avengers Remix&amp;#34; by Styzmask&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Warriors story and characters created by Erin Hunter.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Copyright Disclaimer Under Section 107 of the Copyright Act 1976, allowance is made for &amp;#34;fair use&amp;#34; for purposes such as criticism, comment, news reporting, teaching, scholarship, and research. Fair use is a use permitted by copyright statute that might otherwise be infringing. Non-profit, educational or personal use tips the balance in favor of fair use."
