  [
    id 212
    label "xlFPwWUCCOA"
    step 0
    date "2021-11-26T15:00:23Z"
    title "Its Alright - Ravenpaw Warrior Cats MAP COMPLETE - (Tw: Flash)"
    description "Trigger Warning:  Flash &amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#34;Oh, Barley. You know me so well. Better than any cat ever has. But there is a secret that I have kept from you without meaning to: I have always been a warrior. I have a loyalty to these cats, and I must fight alongside them, whatever happens.&amp;#34;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Ravenpaw inspired so many of us with his story in the first arc. In this MAP, he is portrayed dealing with all the blame and trauma of Redtail's death. Not only that, he struggles of having his own mentor, the one who he should look at with pride and safety, wanting him dead. Still, Ravenpaw shows to try to have his approvement, to find a place on his clan.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Not only that, but Ravenpaw showed us that it is okay to find a new place if yours isn't safe. Showed us that toxic and abusive relationships like he had with his mentor must end as soon as possible.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Ravenpaw in this MAP also shows how hard is to be free from your own past, scared about the future. That healing is a long path and 'it's alright' to feel everything like this.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;And, in the end, he showed us how to have a healthy relationship after everything. How you can find happiness after all. And how you can still be loyal, even though you are not with the ones you love.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;I love Ravenpaw! His character development is really interesting and a lot of people can relate to his feelings and fears. I hope you guys like this MAP.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;List of participants, please subscribe to them!&amp;#10;Intro.  Flawiusz-Sama (https://www.youtube.com/c/MotakaboethKunREAL/videos)&amp;#10;1.  @Mochi Kohai    +  Flawiusz-Sama&amp;#10;2. @melowon_Z &amp;#10;3. @Otterey &amp;#10;4.  @Pinktune0z &amp;#10;5.   @Otta Lits + @Demi m0n &amp;#10;6.  @Chocobir &amp;#10;7. Moon Light (https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCpp8VvshW3wmod23jz8bLvg)&amp;#10;8. Briste Aisling (https://www.youtube.com/c/MabelTheGamer)&amp;#10;9. @SplashDreamms + @Tiny Winy  + @Gildedware (aka GildedPhD) &amp;#10;10. @HarvestBrook +&amp;#12304;&amp;#183;Artistic Studio&amp;#183;&amp;#12305;(https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCrL7ZmXecgGlJz9twcqAl5w)&amp;#10;11. @Tayplets  &amp;#10;12. @GreatSylveon 2007  +  @Annywu  &amp;#10;13. @Marinin  &amp;#10;14. RubyDoodles (https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCeWcw3Iha4OFgQ-oH_zMASg)&amp;#10;15. Ziviebug (https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCEiLTmFXyFitdDY36B6LqBg) + Harvest Brook&amp;#10;16.  Crazypink Chiwawah (https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCtZvHjd7kVmxoJTDIdcvT7w) + @DeerSnapx &amp;#10;17. @Petalyxz + HarvestBrook&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Thumbnail by Harvest Brook&amp;#10;Designs by me and Nifty-senpai&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Songs:&amp;#10;It's Alright by Mother Mother&amp;#10;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=G5-KJgVsoUM&amp;#10;Fire and the Flood - Vance Joy Piano Cover&amp;#10;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=H-WaL9si7-4"
    channeltitle "Marinin"
    channelid "UCUxxesYVTzdhke0emiTDP_w"
