  [
    id 213
    label "5wtkA3n9gG4"
    step 0
    date "2022-06-24T17:30:12Z"
    title "Somebody That I Used To Know | COMPLETE Warrior Cats MAP"
    description "Hi all, after 7 months of work this MAP is finally finished! You have no idea how happy I am for this!!&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Thanks to everyone who got involved in this project, you are really amazing and you are doing a great job!&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Intro 1: @Ekaris&amp;#1090;an &amp;#10;Intro 2: @AnAverageAnimator &amp;#10;Part 1: @Non Nymph &amp;#10;Part 2: @K&amp;#252;rzZ Sen &amp;#10;Part 3: @Fernflower51 [Judyta K] &amp;#10;Part 4: @Silvaroo &amp;#38; moonbunny warriors&amp;#10;Part 5: @Saintcrimes &amp;#10;Part 6: @Pascall &amp;#10;Part 7: @Saintcrimes &amp;#10;Part 8: @HiusLanka &amp;#10;Part 9: @Jaythe drawinghyena &amp;#10;Part 10: @BluefrostAnimations &amp;#10;Part 11: @MothSocks_ &amp;#38; @Rustflake  &amp;#38; @DrawesomeJulia &amp;#10;Part 12: @VaporSkies &amp;#10;Part 13: @Surrikili &amp;#10;Part 14: @DarkGalaxyHero &amp;#38; @Surrikili &amp;#10;Part 15: @Burning Ash &amp;#38; @Valper Kmasten &amp;#10;Part 16: @SailorBeeZ &amp;#10;Part 17: @Spinach Raccoon &amp;#10;Part 18: @Pastel Cookie &amp;#10;Part 19: @ColorfulMarble789 &amp;#10;Part 20: @Killerr_Queennn &amp;#38; @moonbunny warriors &amp;#38; @ShallowStep&amp;#10;Part 21: @Ulyly &amp;#10;Part 22: @riveestarx &amp;#10;Part 23: @DrawesomeJulia &amp;#10;Part 24: @Beetleflair &amp;#10;Part 25: @Moonleap &amp;#10;Part 26: @lemonpie &amp;#10;Part 27: @Brush 24 &amp;#10;Part 28: @Moony&amp;#10;Part 29: @Topy&amp;#10;Part playlist:&amp;#10;https://youtube.com/playlist?list=PLnWSr0ZR3l1GZH6ZWeBEZuPyiBwq2gEv2&amp;#10;Thumbnail contest winner:  https://instagram.com/raynee.art?igshid=YmMyMTA2M2Y= (raynee.art on Instagram)&amp;#10;Song 1: https://youtu.be/8UVNT4wvIGY&amp;#10;Song 2: https://youtu.be/p9JxAQqtxkg&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Yes I know what's wrong with my Crowfeather design but when I found out it was too late to change it If anyone felt offended by it, I apologize, but believe me, it is not my ill will but that I didn't know about it. Please do not post a discussion on this topic in the comments !!!Such comments will be removed, if someone wants to talk to me about it, write to me on Discord (Dziad Ufolud # 4599)&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Copyright Disclaimer Under Section 107 of the Copyright Act 1976, allowance is made for &amp;#34;fair use&amp;#34; for purposes such as criticism, comment, news reporting, teaching, scholarship, and research. Fair use is a use permitted by copyright statute that might otherwise be infringing. Non-profit, educational or personal use tips the balance in favor of fair use."
