    description "It's finally done, hooray!!!! This honestly took way too long xD&amp;#10; At first I really just wanted to make a short part of the song as practice for the program, but I decided to do the whole thing in the end ^^&amp;#10;Also this is mainly just taking place during the second arc of the series.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;But yeah, I hope you like it! :)&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;I don't own anything, except the drawings. &amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Programs used:&amp;#10;Clip Studio Paint (drawing)&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Adobe Premiere Pro (video-editing)"
