  [
    id 238
    label "S2n7cScHX1I"
    step 0
    date "2021-09-02T04:30:08Z"
    title "Do You Love Me Bramblestar and Ashfur COMPLETE Warriors MAP"
    description "Hello all, after almost exactly a year we are here, got this in on my birthday as promised. I&amp;#8217;m so happy with how this came out and all the hard work that went into this project, I couldnt be more proud of the animators. &amp;#10;&amp;#10;Thank you so much to real gc and everyone who assisted in co hosting, editing, and all the work that went towards this.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;This is a stylistic Imposter Bramblestar and Ashfur MAP focusing on the merging of Bramblestar&amp;#8217;s psyche with Ashfur, and the control this has over him and his relationships, ultimately leaving him alone in his own mindgames. &amp;#10;-You can read more about this in the script: https://docs.google.com/document/d/12Lztndboo6oPLnE4iUr1P5HUklICnhmR6y0ZvOJryiQ/edit?usp=sharing&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Animators:&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Intro: @Chocobir  0:22&amp;#10;0. @FISHSOCKS 0:00&amp;#10;1. @Shady Alpha 0:30&amp;#10;2. @Aspen Shadow  0:39&amp;#10;3. @Puddleface 0:43&amp;#10;4. KIIDSTAR @ColdFoop 0:51&amp;#10;5. @Saberoo  0:55&amp;#10;6. @BUSTERSW0RD  @Floatia 1:04&amp;#10;7. @ColdFoop  1:12&amp;#10;8. @RedBear 1:20&amp;#10;9. @CheekyTiger @Martletwing 1:27&amp;#10;10. @KimSxxiny  @CTAKAN 1:35&amp;#10;11. @SADSUMA 1:43&amp;#10;12. @Louixie @meow 286  1:50&amp;#10;13. @Senswii @rufkasoda 1:55&amp;#10;14. @Adrianimations 2:03&amp;#10;15. @Riley Ellis  @shinyarcs 2:07&amp;#10;16. @Phantomsylveon  2:15&amp;#10;17. @Crystal Silverlight  2:23&amp;#10;18. @MtfoxX3  2:31&amp;#10;19. @MANCHKIN! 2:39&amp;#10;20. @Blanchy @GiingerSnaps  2:48&amp;#10;21. @donnaroe  2:55&amp;#10;22. @Icefelis  3:03&amp;#10;23. @Koerenn 3:10&amp;#10;24. @Sagutoyas  3:19&amp;#10;25. @Sagutoyas &amp;#10;26. @Tusofsky  3:35&amp;#10;27. @ursiday 3:43&amp;#10;28. @Icecolo 3:52&amp;#10;29. @bunnycat  3:59&amp;#10;30. @Glitch Sixxle 4:07&amp;#10;outro: @Cheebzmacka  @Cheeteh Z 4:23&amp;#10;Thumbnail art winner: @Cante Skuya &amp;#10;&amp;#10;Song: Ma&amp;#238;tre Gims - Est-ce que tu m'aimes ?&amp;#10;Characters belong to the Warriors series by Erin Hunter&amp;#10;Complete MAP is a product of several individual artists with their own copyrights. Please do not repost&amp;#10;&amp;#10;--&amp;#10;Copyright Disclaimer Under Section 107 of the Copyright Act 1976, allowance is made for &amp;#34;fair use&amp;#34; for purposes such as criticism, comment, news reporting, teaching, scholarship, and research. Fair use is a use permitted by copyright statute that might otherwise be infringing. Non-profit, educational or personal use tips the balance in favor of fair use."
