  [
    id 240
    label "gJbQR6T3XG8"
    step 0
    date "2021-12-15T18:00:28Z"
    title ""
    description "If u have the chance can you help share this map? :'DD Youtube as been playing with my face recently, and not sharing my videos, so even a like helps a lot! Means a lot to me!&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#10024; SPECIAL NOTE: I've set this long premiere to December 15th, due it's the &amp;#34;Map Birthday&amp;#34; so I thought it would be fun to set the premiere after 1 year of upload :0 I also want to thank a lot Moonshadow and @Moonbeanie Warrior  for omg their incrible job as backup, If it weren't for them I believe that the MAP would still take a little longer to complete; Thank you so so much for get so many parts and for your fantastic work! &amp;#10084;&amp;#65039;&amp;#10;-----&amp;#10;&amp;#9888;&amp;#65039; Trigger Warning: This MAP Contains animal death, flashing lights and spoilers about characters death from Warrior Cats series&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#10024; || ABOUT&amp;#10;The MAP shows up some of warriors's death, however it's symbolized by yellow petals and the character that will die is colored; Contains spoliers to DOTC until VOS, this MAP does not inclues deaths from BC!&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#10024; || ANIMATORS LIST || &amp;#10024;&amp;#10;@Ironyche &amp;#10;Chiaseedwater&amp;#10;@Kayds* &amp;#10;@DaMoomin &amp;#10;Midnight&amp;#10;@Mothbrook &amp;#10;@GreatSylveon 2007 &amp;#10;@&amp;#8226; Astronomia &amp;#8226; &amp;#10;AslanaNight&amp;#10;@OFUKITTY &amp;#10;@KrispyKitty66 &amp;#10;@LunarTempest &amp;#10;@Gildedware (aka GildedPhD) &amp;#10;Hoopdog The King&amp;#10;@Nitchyou &amp;#10;@&amp;#402;reak&amp;#931;asy &amp;#10;Ninnoibat&amp;#10;@Kuuttituutti &amp;#10;@Tiny Winy &amp;#10;Angel Shards&amp;#10;Moonshadow&amp;#10;@Otterey &amp;#10;@SplashDreamms &amp;#10;@Demi m0n &amp;#10;@&amp;#33469;&amp;#31958;Maltose &amp;#10;Snowly Lika&amp;#10;@Sunset Raven &amp;#10;@Moonbeanie Warrior &amp;#10;Rainy Clouds&amp;#10;berrybovine&amp;#10;@Jaytail &amp;#10;@Crystal Nugget &amp;#10;MARSHII&amp;#10;@Marinin&amp;#10;@Pinktune0z &amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#10024; || DETAILS&amp;#10;MAP CALL: https://youtu.be/fBi5GpCz0Gk&amp;#10;Playlist with Complete Parts+Extra Arts: https://youtube.com/playlist?list=PLD-9CjYt_7tVGeENLS4s8o6AvqDOsB0OF (PLEASE SUPPORT THE ARTISTS)&amp;#10;Thumbnail Winner: Moonshadow (thank you everyone for all entries and fanarts!!)&amp;#10;Character is from Erin Hunter's series Warriors Cats, and Designs by @GEKKOZILLA and @Nifty-Senpai &amp;#10;Endcredits art by @SplashDreamms and Aliceluh (background) and characters tweening by @Marinin !&amp;#10;Song: Lindsey Stirling - The Arena"
    channeltitle "SplashDreamms"
