    id 253
    label "93YwFbqwDzI"
    step 0
    date "2021-05-09T17:30:55Z"
    title "Warrior cats- Into the Wild series Trailer (Read description!)"
    description "This is a project that will be potentially ongoing in 2021 and possibly even longer, It is filmed on a Game called Warriors: Ultimate edition, this is found on Roblox, This project is HEAVLY based on The warrior cat books by Erin Hunter, Most of this is filmed and Edited on KineMaster, Help with the series is appreciated and we would love to have people help with this project! Let us know if you would like to join!&amp;#10;&amp;#10;We couldn&amp;#8217;t bring you this without the amazing people helping in this&amp;#10;And more!&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Please Consider Subscribing to Magenta&amp;#8217;s/ Rising channel, on this channel we will post sneak peaks and prologues!&amp;#10;&amp;#10;The channel: https://youtube.com/channel/UCgZGl8rbQXkuU2tHBy0cEfg&amp;#10;Link to the trailer: https://youtu.be/93YwFbqwDzI&amp;#10;Link to the prologue: https://youtu.be/jmEfq0WGRNo&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Please note: Most cats, already have a design but some don&amp;#8217;t, if you dislike the design we give you for the cat, feel free to ask us to change it, and if you don&amp;#8217;t have a design for it, you can design it yourself, sticking cannon-ly of course! Also! This description and the Pinned comment will constantly be updated, so it recommended double checking before you apply! &amp;#10;&amp;#10;So Far these amazing people are the current actors of some of the first- selected characters,&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Magenta Umbreon As Bluestar, Tigerclaw and Rusty,&amp;#10;Legendary Thunder as Redtail, CinderKit, TallStar and SwiftKit,&amp;#10;Ilovecats as Silverstream and SpottedLeaf,&amp;#10;Anton Storm s&amp;#248;renson as LionHeart,&amp;#10;HeckyHeckle as WhiteStorm,&amp;#10;FlowerTailFox as Darkstripe,&amp;#10;S O U P Y as LongTail,&amp;#10;JENNIFER TRAN as RunningWind, GoldenFlower and StoneFur,&amp;#10;Sky Dolphin as WillowPelt and FrostFur,&amp;#10;Hamster aj as MouseFur, GrayPaw, Smudge, BrightKit and BlackFoot,&amp;#10;GoldenHoney as Dustpaw and Runningnose ,&amp;#10;_Choco-muffins_ as SandPaw and BrokenStar,&amp;#10;SeafoamTheSandSea as RavenPaw, BrindleFace and DappleTail,&amp;#10;Dove&amp;#8217; Breeze of ThunderClan as SpeckleTail and Barley,&amp;#10;Bipbi Hop as HalfTail, One- Eye and PatchPelt,&amp;#10;* Lavender_Bat * As Smallear,&amp;#10;Ayane Takahashi as RussetFur, Boulder and CrookedStar,&amp;#10;Tartarus Myths as NightPelt, Clawface and BrackenKit,&amp;#10;Mocha Fur as BrightFlower,&amp;#10;Tall&amp;#8217;Meadow as Ashfur and WhiteClaw,&amp;#10;KiwiWolf Pup as OakHeart, GrayPool and ThornKit,&amp;#10;Malisa Clemonts as LeopardFur,&amp;#10;The Adventures Of Stupid Boi as BlackClaw,&amp;#10;The Weird Person/ Agent as YellowFang,&amp;#10;Marmalade&amp;#8217;Stripe as RoseTail ,&amp;#10;Jason&amp;#8217;s Corner, as a backup,&amp;#10;And Lastly&amp;#10;Midka as a backup.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;DISCLAIMER!&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Warrior cats does NOT belong to me or anyone helping this project, it belongs to Erin Hunter, And is it&amp;#8217;s own separate book set, we are just making this into a series heavily based on the books, for entertainment purposes ONLY! &amp;#10;&amp;#10;Warrior cats: Ultimate Edition, is a roleplay game on roblox, Yet again, we do NOT own this, or have any special role in this, we are using this as we believe the game will be great for the idea, Please check out both the game and the Warrior cat Book series!&amp;#10;&amp;#10;We do not own both of these, if both these or one of these wish for us to have this series up, we will remove it!&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Roblox Game: https://www.roblox.com/home&amp;#10;Warrior cats: Ultimate Edition: https://www.roblox.com/games/3663340706/Warrior-Cats-Ultimate-Edition&amp;#10;Warrior cats official website: https://warriorcats.com/&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Enjoy!"
