    description "Thumbnail artist for this video: https://twitter.com/Kaseypaws&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Voices for this video:&amp;#10;Jayfeather: Matthew Jones (https://twitter.com/GearUpTwitch)&amp;#10;Princess: Kaseypaws (https://twitter.com/kaseypaws)&amp;#10;Tigerclaw: Grant (https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC__T4ql8NIlSdmf9tCrPu6A/featured)&amp;#10;Firepaw: Matt (https://twitter.com/EpicrockerTT)&amp;#10;Silverstream: CEOlson (https://ceolsonart.carrd.co/)&amp;#10;Yellowfang: Monica Grace&amp;#10;Redtail: Rika/Rakea https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCm2T3GLN5MejRn5dzgAnGVg&amp;#10;Brightheart: Amanda&amp;#10;Mousefur: Blizzard&amp;#10;Brackenfur: Terson https://twitch.tv/tersonva&amp;#10;Purdy: Chris (https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCTQCLycV5E-fIglg4Gye3KA)&amp;#10;Hawkfrost: Zeddall&amp;#10;Featherpaw: VidyTheFox&amp;#10;Sorrelkit: Chaotic Fox&amp;#10;&amp;#10;THIS WAS SO MUCH FUN TO DO! WE HAD AN ABSOLUTE BLAST. Let us know if you'd like to see more. We'd LOVE to do more!&amp;#10;&amp;#10;We understand and we would like to acknowledge the instance of the Jayfeather with a feather behind his ear used within this video. We will not be condoning this usage from here on out and we encourage everyone to educate themselves on the issue!&amp;#10;&amp;#10;For updates on new episodes and artwork, follow our twitter and join our discord! You can also talk to us there too! &amp;#10;https://twitter.com/WarriorsFanDub&amp;#10;https://discord.com/invite/warriorcatsfandub&amp;#10;&amp;#10;In correspondence of the Digital Millennium Copyright Act (DMCA) this is a transformative work of the original copyrighted work from Erin Hunter and HarperCollins Publisher. Further, WarriorsFanDubProject claims no ownership of the Warriors series and does not seek to gain from the distribution of this work. these are not meant to be used as a substitute for the professional recordings."
