  [
    id 281
    label "9sPIecsUx1k"
    step 0
    date "2021-09-01T16:00:07Z"
    title "WARRIORS: INTO THE WILD - WCAnimated Teaser Trailer"
    description "Are you ready to venture into the wild?&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Introducing the first look at WCAnimated&amp;#8217;s INTO THE WILD, the story of Rusty, a seemingly ordinary house cat who leaves his life behind to join a clan of wild forest cats. But the forest is full of dangers and secrets, and Rusty himself is driven by a prophesied destiny that will change the Warrior Clans forever.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;WCAnimated is a fan-made project seeking to adapt Erin Hunter&amp;#8217;s bestselling WARRIORS books into an animated web series. Our team is made up of over 100 artists working to bring this series to life!&amp;#10;&amp;#10;For more information and content:&amp;#10;Carrd - https://wcanimated.carrd.co&amp;#10;Instagram - https://www.instagram.com/wcanimated&amp;#10;Twitter - https://twitter.com/wcanimated&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Interested in supporting our project further? Consider subscribing to our Patreon, where you can join our exclusive Discord server and earn amazing rewards starting at just $5 a month! &amp;#10;&amp;#10;https://www.patreon.com/wcanimated&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Money will go to help our team get proper programs and resources for their work on the project and any extra funds will go to nonprofit/charity organizations!&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;C R E D I T S&amp;#10;Directed by&amp;#10;Jupiter (@flamingjup)&amp;#10;Tune (@showtnecockatoo)&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Written by &amp;#10;Tune (@showtnecockatoo)&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Storyboards by&amp;#10;Banvskye (@banvskye)&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Additional Art Direction by&amp;#10;King (@kingofcabbages)&amp;#10;Mariah (@mariah.tekulve)&amp;#10;Pomi (@ppomibe)&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Concept &amp;#38; Design by&amp;#10;Kayla (@Danger__Child)&amp;#10;Kayla (@SEGAmastergirl)&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Animation by&amp;#10;Ashtrall (@ashtrall)&amp;#10;King (@kingofcabbages)&amp;#10;Okami (@okamiwolven)&amp;#10;Mel Mrozek (@radvumtal)&amp;#10;Mel B. (@hullumel)&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Backgrounds by&amp;#10;Bolita (@bolitamurcielago)&amp;#10;Pomi (@ppomibe)&amp;#10;Crow (@crowkadow)&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Color Script by &amp;#10;Ghob (@gh0bsmacka)&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Score by&amp;#10;Merry (@merrymmusican)&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Editing &amp;#38; Compositing by&amp;#10;Neko (@petuniabubbles)"
