    date "2022-01-14T20:01:10Z"
    title "Warrior Cats Voice Actors play: Mafia | In Character #2"
    description "We were so excited you all enjoyed our last video of Warriors Voice Actors play Mafia that we made a second one! This one is much more suspenseful and we included MANY of your suggestions and ideas into it! We've also created our very own Warriors themed game! Same premise but all the cards are Warriors related! We hope you enjoy!&amp;#10;&amp;#10;ALL AVAILABLE &amp;#34;The Hunt&amp;#34; CARDS CAN BE SEEN IN THE PREORDER FORM.&amp;#10;Patreon: https://www.patreon.com/WCDub&amp;#10;Preorders for the cards: https://forms.gle/tvvBist3GpNUC5uA7&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Artists for this video:&amp;#10;Thumbnail: Matthew Jones (https://www.twitch.tv/gearup)&amp;#10;Claw Marks: Matthew Jones (https://www.twitch.tv/gearup)&amp;#10;All Graphics: Matthew Jones (https://www.twitch.tv/gearup)&amp;#10;Ashfur: Kaseypaws (https://twitter.com/Kaseypaws)&amp;#10;Breezepelt: Mika (https://www.instagram.com/mikakucity)&amp;#10;Brightheart: Mika (https://www.instagram.com/mikakucity)&amp;#10;Ivypool: Sun The Cat Dragon (https://instagram.com/sun_the_cat_dragon?utm_medium=copy_link)&amp;#10;Onestar: Niffler (https://www.deviantart.com/nifflerdraws)&amp;#10;Princess: Matthew Jones (https://www.twitch.tv/gearup)&amp;#10;Purdy: Sun The Cat Dragon (https://instagram.com/sun_the_cat_dragon?utm_medium=copy_link)&amp;#10;Stoneteller: Matthew Jones (https://www.twitch.tv/gearup)&amp;#10;Tigerstar: Boofey/Bouncy (https://linktr.ee/Bouncy_Feather)&amp;#10;Alderheart: Mika (https://www.instagram.com/mikakucity)&amp;#10;Jayfeather: Mika (https://www.instagram.com/mikakucity)&amp;#10;Sasha: Boofey/Bouncy (https://linktr.ee/Bouncy_Feather)&amp;#10;Mothwing: Sketti (https://twitter.com/SkettiDragon?s=09)&amp;#10;Yellowfang: ErrorEmma (https://www.deviantart.com/erroremma)&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Voices for this video:&amp;#10;Jayfeather: Matthew Jones (https://www.twitch.tv/gearup)&amp;#10;Mothwing: Smog (https://youtube.com/channel/UCjoLEjfj_THmgkC6I3HB3RA)&amp;#10;Brightheart: ErrorEmma (https://www.deviantart.com/erroremma)&amp;#10;Tigerstar: Grant (https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC__T4ql8NIlSdmf9tCrPu6A/featured)&amp;#10;Yellowfang: Monica Grace&amp;#10;Alderheart: Terson https://twitch.tv/tersonva &amp;#10;Ivypool: Toon&amp;#10;Purdy: Chris (https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCTQCLycV5E-fIglg4Gye3KA)&amp;#10;Onestar: Foxystar&amp;#10;Stoneteller: Tom&amp;#225;s (https://twitter.com/Bilbz1?s=09)&amp;#10;Princess: Kaseypaws (https://twitter.com/kaseypaws)&amp;#10;Breezepelt: Exalted&amp;#10;Ashfur: Rika/Rakea https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCm2T3GLN5MejRn5dzgAnGVg&amp;#10;Sasha: Blueberry&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Editor for this video: Matthew Jones (https://www.twitch.tv/gearup)&amp;#10;&amp;#10;For updates on new episodes and artwork, follow our twitter and join our discord! You can also talk to us there too! &amp;#10;https://twitter.com/WarriorsFanDub&amp;#10;https://discord.com/invite/warriorcatsfandub&amp;#10;&amp;#10;In correspondence of the Digital Millennium Copyright Act (DMCA) this is a transformative work of the original copyrighted work from Erin Hunter and HarperCollins Publisher. Further, WarriorsFanDubProject claims no ownership of the Warriors series and does not seek to gain from the distribution of this work. these are not meant to be used as a substitute for the professional recordings."
