  [
    id 289
    label "wxGj34FZelM"
    step 0
    date "2021-09-18T15:16:06Z"
    title " Warrior Cats / Starclan Inspired ORIGINAL SONG (Feat. Shoyun)"
    description "&amp;#34;Way To You&amp;#34; streaming now on...&amp;#10;&amp;#127925;Spotify&amp;#127925;  https://spoti.fi/2XqRd1C&amp;#10;&amp;#127925; iTunes&amp;#127925; https://apple.co/2XpI7CJ&amp;#10;&amp;#10;I had the incredible opportunity to team up with my good friend Holly, (colacatinthehat), to bring to life another collaboration project. This is our second CHILD after Walk Without The Stars, and she never fails to blow me away with her skill and passion, and talent. Definitely do yourself a favour and check out her Youtube channel if you haven't already. She's incredible!!&amp;#10;&amp;#10;||~Where To Find Me!~||&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Follow my Twitter!  &amp;#8594; https://goo.gl/ZfTYa9&amp;#10;Subscribe for more!  &amp;#8594; https://goo.gl/1eqmUj&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Want to see videos and hear songs EARLY? Be a part of an exclusive &amp;#34;Blixemi Super Fan&amp;#34; discord server? &amp;#38; Much MORE?&amp;#10;Then check out my Patreon! &amp;#8594; https://www.patreon.com/Blixemi&amp;#10;&amp;#10;||---------||&amp;#10;&amp;#10;CREDITS&amp;#10;Vocals - Shoyun&amp;#10;Youtube - https://www.youtube.com/c/shoyukatsudon&amp;#10;Facebook - https://www.facebook.com/shoyukatsudon&amp;#10;Twitter - https://twitter.com/shoyukatsudon&amp;#10;@shoyukatsudon &amp;#10;&amp;#10;Video &amp;#38; Illustrations - colacatinthehat&amp;#10;Youtube - https://bit.ly/2VIH5ki&amp;#10;Twitter - https://twitter.com/HatsAndColacats&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Mixing/Mastering of Audio - FreshMicks&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Additional Artwork - Finchwing&amp;#10;https://www.youtube.com/c/Finchwing&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Music/Lyrics/Produced by - Blixemi&amp;#10;&amp;#10;||---------||&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Please note: &amp;#10;-Do not reupload this audio onto your channel. &amp;#10;-Do not nightcore, or redistribute the audio, lyrics, or art, on youtube or any other website. &amp;#10;-I ask that at this point, there are no MAPs created with this audio. Thanks for understanding!&amp;#10;&amp;#10;||---------||&amp;#10;&amp;#10;LYRICS&amp;#10;&amp;#10;I don&amp;#8217;t know the way to you.&amp;#10;You can&amp;#8217;t be gone I just won&amp;#8217;t say it&amp;#8217;s true.&amp;#10;My world won&amp;#8217;t change, I won&amp;#8217;t be broken down.&amp;#10;For you&amp;#8217;re not lost you&amp;#8217;re just not yet found.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;How could you leave this all behind?&amp;#10;After this, I hope you&amp;#8217;re satisfied.&amp;#10;You&amp;#8217;ve thrown away everything we&amp;#8217;ve been through.&amp;#10;I pray I never find my way to you.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;The path is broken and it&amp;#8217;s incomplete.&amp;#10;I trip and stumble, I can hardly breathe.&amp;#10;So many choices, but no clarity.&amp;#10;So many voices, but no melody.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;This can&amp;#8217;t go on, and now I&amp;#8217;m lost too...&amp;#10;I fear I&amp;#8217;ll never find my way to you&amp;#10;&amp;#10;I don&amp;#8217;t know the way to you,&amp;#10;I&amp;#8217;d change so much if I only knew&amp;#10;I&amp;#8217;d trade the world, please I will beg and plead.&amp;#10;If you could turn around and stay with me.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;All you&amp;#8217;ve left is just a passing breath&amp;#10;And now you&amp;#8217;ve passed, I have got nothing left.&amp;#10;I don&amp;#8217;t think I can make it through.&amp;#10;Because I cannot find my way to you&amp;#10;&amp;#10;I am broken and it&amp;#8217;s hard to breathe.&amp;#10;Without you here I feel so incomplete.&amp;#10;There's no more choices and no melodies.&amp;#10;With you gone, I&amp;#8217;ve lost a piece of me.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;The fog is heavy I can not see through,&amp;#10;And so I think that all I fear is true,&amp;#10;This can&amp;#8217;t go on, and now I&amp;#8217;m lost too.&amp;#10;I know I&amp;#8217;ll never find my way to you.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;In the blink of an eye, everything&amp;#8217;s washed away.&amp;#10;It takes no more than just a breath for everything to change.&amp;#10;And nothing&amp;#8217;s right and it feels like I&amp;#8217;ve lost the way.&amp;#10;But I feel changes, something&amp;#8217;s telling me I&amp;#8217;ll be okay.&amp;#10; &amp;#10;And though it&amp;#8217;s hard to begin again and face the truth.&amp;#10;I&amp;#8217;ll build myself on everything that you and I&amp;#8217;ve been through.&amp;#10;I&amp;#8217;m pushing forwards and found something that I never knew.&amp;#10;You were here all along guiding me back to you.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;The path is broken and it&amp;#8217;s incomplete.&amp;#10;I may trip and stumble but I&amp;#8217;ll find my feet.&amp;#10;So many choices, I see clarity.&amp;#10;So many voices, I hear harmonies.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;The fog is heavy I&amp;#8217;ll continue through,&amp;#10;For in my strength is where I&amp;#8217;ll find the truth&amp;#10;I will go on and see the end in view.&amp;#10;And someday soon I&amp;#8217;ll find my way to you.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;I&amp;#8217;ll find my strength you&amp;#8217;ll keep me pushing through&amp;#10;You&amp;#8217;ll show the way, I&amp;#8217;ve found myself in you."
