  [
    id 294
    label "pJz80Z-zLv8"
    step 0
    date "2021-02-06T20:00:12Z"
    title " Complete Snowkit and One-eye Warriors Dance Dance Revolution MAP (EYE STRAIN)"
    description "Cohosted, and for a few months hosted, by @GiingerSnaps! Ginger also did the editing of the MAP, but I added a few camera movements afterwards so if anything looks weird blame me. An unfathomably huge thank you to them and also to the participants of this MAP for bringing to life this wacky idea!&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Summary(long I'm sorry lol): &amp;#10;Warriors is a rhythm video game where the only real character is Fireheart&amp;#8212;everyone else is an NPC. Battles, hunting, and other warrior duties are completed like dance minigames. StarClan is one single cat, but inside its body is every cat in StarClan, and it rules this world. &amp;#10;&amp;#10;StarClan is obsessed with Fireheart&amp;#8212;its only goal is to make an interesting story for him to play. If NPCs die when Fireheart isn&amp;#8217;t watching, StarClan respawns them to use later. Except for One-eye, who has figured it out through observation, the cats don&amp;#8217;t know that Fireheart is the catalyst for death and instead believe that StarClan only respawns those who are devout. As a result of this conditional immortality, cats worry a lot less about themselves and each other. &amp;#10;&amp;#10;Because Fireheart was not present at Snowkit&amp;#8217;s actual moment of death, Snowkit respawns and continues on with life. Concepts like StarClan cannot be explained to him, so he tries to figure out how things work himself, with the help of his aunt and mentor, One-eye.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;StarClan didn't like one cat knowing about its game, so when Snowpaw starts figuring it out as well, it summons him to its realm to tell him to knock it off. In StarClan, Snowpaw can hear, but he's not interested in listening to StarClan and finds his way back to the game world. Events in Warriors canon proceed- Bluestar dies, Firestar becomes leader, Scourge rises to power and meets Firestar for the battle.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;One-eye and Snowpaw haven't shared their knowledge with Firestar because they don't know what the StarClan cat, who has complete power over this world, would do. But in the face of so many cats dying needlessly, One-eye finally tells him. Furious, StarClan collects Snowpaw, who it's obsessed with after he ignored it- it also collects Firestar and Scourge by accident.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Snowpaw leads Firestar out of StarClan's realm, leaving Scourge behind. StarClan follows them to the game world, worried what Firestar might be thinking. Firestar is livid when he sees StarClan. He wails on it, glitching out the world as it depends on StarClan. The StarClan cat lets out Bluestar, and this calms down Firestar. &amp;#10;&amp;#10;StarClan only wants to make Firestar happy. He puts it to work helping around the camp. StarClan had never considered staying in the game world before, but it likes it because it's close to Firestar. Firestar gives Snowpaw his warrior name, Snowstep.  &amp;#10;&amp;#10;MAP Call: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=0xHDjjyUIEE&amp;#10;Parts Playlist: https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLuAFTIlbuIN19UGuZx3KxZSsn7k3bqMKy&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Thumbnail: Chamops (https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCFS4JhS_0fZ39NG55vQasrA)&amp;#10;Intro: @E.J Kraft &amp;#10;1: @raevei and @GiingerSnaps &amp;#10;2: @Zokhan &amp;#10;3: @GiingerSnaps and @Starcheopteryx &amp;#10;4: @Klarikatt&amp;#10;5:  @crispyyflake&amp;#10;6: @Grook&amp;#10;7A: @Deer Drops&amp;#10;7B: @Osinka&amp;#10;8: @Ryeven&amp;#10;9: @katkitters&amp;#10;Interlude 1: bitbizarrre (https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCmjllY9wKWOrQ7bsrc7TVmQ)&amp;#10;Interlude 2: Toonisms (https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC3chmryKK4fbUmEJApdtTog)&amp;#10;10: @Lonely night&amp;#10;11A: @Scoutnmave&amp;#10;11B: @kovuren&amp;#10;11C: @Crowla&amp;#10;12: @Ghastea &amp;#10;13: @Catart &amp;#10;Interlude 3: @gmowl&amp;#10;Interlude 4: @GildedPhD &amp;#10;14: Annywu (https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCP-od5SSyPgV6Ok4keQSU2Q)&amp;#10;15: Maltose Cat (https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCEZsBL07QuqjqgWmxcTjlgw)&amp;#10;16: @Avazorous&amp;#10;17: @Jakichi&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Songs:&amp;#10;Speed Over Beethoven by ROSE&amp;#10;Fur Elise Remix by Klutch"
    channeltitle "crowla"
    channelid "UC1UM2CGx_HemS1R3ozRooPw"
