    title "Warrior Cats Animated Special (Brokenstars House)"
    description "OH, and for those of you asking, this isnt the new art style, i just like to change the styles for shorts to better differentiate it from the main show&amp;#10;WOWOW its finished, Greene Avenue is coming next, then the Prolouge to Fire and Ice THEN the first episode of Fire and Ice, aint that nice&amp;#10;also first wca related thingy with FULL HD amazing, ive upgraded my computer recently, so now all the new episodes will be in HD&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Patreon: https://www.patreon.com/bokbokchoy&amp;#10;WCA tumblr: https://www.tumblr.com/blog/warriorca...&amp;#10;BokBokChoy twitter: https://twitter.com/?lang=en&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Rory- http://sillystrung.tumblr.com/ (Also animated it)&amp;#10;Fritz- https://tinyurl.com/yclas2s2&amp;#10;Lillian- https://www.instagram.com/odetough/?h...&amp;#10;And also animated by-&amp;#10;Elliot - https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCtui...&amp;#10;New Voices-&amp;#10;Taylor https://www.youtube.com/user/TaylorTe...&amp;#10;Madeline - https://twitter.com/faeryxoxo&amp;#10;&amp;#10;(Voices)&amp;#10;Rory- Smudge, Graystripe, Ravenpaw, Runningwind, Longtail, Smallear, Brindleface, Boulder, Brownpaw. Clawface, Stumpytail&amp;#10;Fritz- Fireheart, Tigerclaw, Whitestorm, Lionheart, Sandpaw, Yellowfang, Brokenstar, Darkstripe, Blackfoot, Susanne, Barley, Nightpelt&amp;#10;Lillian- Bluestar, Mousefur, Spottedleaf, Speckletail, Willowpelt, Littlepaw, Tangleburr&amp;#10;Elliot- Runningnose, Crookedstar, Crowfur, Thornclaw.&amp;#10;Moms- Frostfur&amp;#10;Pops- Mudfur, Patchpelt&amp;#10;Madeline- One-eye&amp;#10;Taylor- Goldenflower&amp;#10;Navgate- Halftail&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Music Used:&amp;#10;Baila Mi Cumbia (sting) - Jimmy Fontanez/Media Right Productions&amp;#10;Pitch - Lish Grooves&amp;#10;Super Blues - Unicorn Heads&amp;#10;Timed Out (Sting) Jingle Punks&amp;#10;Drizzle To Downpour - Silent Partner"
