  [
    id 298
    label "VYRPg1LJ3AU"
    step 0
    date "2022-06-25T20:00:11Z"
    title ""
    description "I AM SO HAPPY TO PRESENT COOL KIDS! &amp;#10;&amp;#10;First off, this MAP was originally hosted by DreamGamer! I, unfortunately, cannot find their channel now, but I took this MAP up for them around the 2015-2016 era of the Warrior Cats community. Much like my other MAP Phoenix, I ended up abandoning this MAP after being locked out of the account I was hosting the MAP on. I finally regained access to that account and have been planning on rehosting these MAPs one by one! &amp;#10;&amp;#10;DISCLAIMER: Over 10 parts were lost in the progress of bringing this MAP back up. This is due to Youtube's new update that privated all unlisted videos from certain periods. Please keep this in mind when watching this MAP as there were several animators who originally participated and unfortunately did not get their work into the MAP! &amp;#10;&amp;#10;ANOTHER DISCLAIMER: Many of these parts were made in the early/mid 2010s. Please do not judge participants based on their art at that time! Along with that, please understand that I do also acknowledge the potential harm in having characters such as Briarlight and Cinderpelt appear in this MAP. These are parts created either before the MAP was in my control or when I was unaware of how negatively these portrayals are (aka I was 12). Please keep this in mind ^^.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Please send your congrats to @Basil Kat for winning the thumbnail contest!! &amp;#10;&amp;#10;Finally, give a big round of applause to the participants! &amp;#10;&amp;#10;Intro- Basil Kat &amp;#38; Samboo&amp;#10;[https://www.youtube.com/c/BasilKats]&amp;#10;[https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCRYW_9I-lL__dMPIxwNdUfg]&amp;#10;1- colorcharms&amp;#10;[https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCrL_3neCrwlSUt9Mju1dPog]&amp;#10;2- Ziggyistired&amp;#10;[https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCNPbDVnliFkaMwg4Okgqjrg]&amp;#10;3- KellyKatMeow&amp;#10;[https://www.youtube.com/user/raquelloop360]&amp;#10;4- Deerleap&amp;#10;[PART RETRIEVED FROM OLD FLASHDRIVE: Current status of username/channel unknown]&amp;#10;5- AnimatorTails&amp;#10;[PART RETRIEVED FROM OLD FLASHDRIVE: Current status of username/channel unknown]&amp;#10;6- Jaylin Adame&amp;#10;[PART RETRIEVED FROM OLD FLASHDRIVE: Current status of username/channel unknown]&amp;#10;7- Jaylin Adame&amp;#10;[PART RETRIEVED FROM OLD FLASHDRIVE: Current status of username/channel unknown]&amp;#10;8- Doodle train&amp;#10;[https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCt3c1JseYvFc1gaeAv3UsMQ]&amp;#10;9- MD LPS&amp;#10;[https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCx3gMrAk6KkN6MkyyXSboKQ]&amp;#10;10- Jawaij&amp;#10;[https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCmNnOy3Z7ATUkhPigLjkVOg]&amp;#10;11- Senni Can't Draw&amp;#10;[https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC2XHAXd5ChPf9tDhVMkPWQQ]&amp;#10;12- Sunbreeze&amp;#10;[https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCxb3NgLmYIWxIRx17YJSGFg]&amp;#10;13- lynxiiam &amp;#38; Olivejump Warriors&amp;#10;[https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCPrMLTE9UEYj46iQrs6hqYw]&amp;#10;[https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCbrs-1VDkg6kripkCf9RtzQ]&amp;#10;14- Retro_Wolf&amp;#10;[https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCKb5c_urJClMXs_OXZO66Xw]&amp;#10;15- LemonCat&amp;#10;[https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC8zxzzuvIsIIK0A6xl_5nsg]&amp;#10;16- Senni Can't Draw&amp;#10;[https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC2XHAXd5ChPf9tDhVMkPWQQ]&amp;#10;17- LaClara &amp;#10;[https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCaJd8PRKbQAPcr_D9zpyKEw]&amp;#10;18- An&amp;#10;[https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC55PUj6H3aGRzY_JsbT82sQ]&amp;#10;19- EeveeIsRed&amp;#10;[https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCTAR9AeUTbiVJJw-afy9IXw]&amp;#10;20-WolfenCaticus&amp;#10;[https://www.youtube.com/user/kaybzjess]&amp;#10;21A- WolfenCaticus&amp;#10;[https://www.youtube.com/user/kaybzjess]&amp;#10;21B-CrazyDrawz&amp;#10;[https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCQN-wVFA9p3SjvRfCbM1nWA]&amp;#10;22-H&amp;#246;ri &amp;#233;s Bar&amp;#225;tai&amp;#10;[https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC1JbSXcSTenO_-JFPKyJV5Q]&amp;#10;23-Lugia&amp;#10;[https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCyBUCVnzyUKg4WsqmLpio9A]&amp;#10;24- Shadowblaze&amp;#10;[https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCsdW9tsQ08vaGtFSTTZUFDg]&amp;#10;25-PaintedMagic (watermark different in video)&amp;#10;[https://www.youtube.com/c/PaintedMagic]&amp;#10;26- StarryRivers&amp;#10;[https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC6FVSlxOVxyKnSnN04Cwy_A]&amp;#10;27- ThatsN0tVeryCashM0ney&amp;#10;[https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCApD5yO7UmYns3qY6w7h0fg]&amp;#10;28- HashisHat&amp;#10;[https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCj4e0QBvfDc5L9wm5V9yuPQ]&amp;#10;29- Windrex&amp;#10;[https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCN8ja_WF_gsSTjornlDh6Gg]&amp;#10;30- IcefireUwU&amp;#10;[https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCgicBNmQL2pcoNmurIM5LTQ]&amp;#10;Outro- Thumbnail Contest entries&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;---------------------------&amp;#10;FUN STUFF&amp;#10;&amp;#10;I also post on...&amp;#10;Deviantart: SaturnSkyez&amp;#10;Instagram: Saturnskyez&amp;#10;Design Instagram: Skyez.of.Saturn&amp;#10;I've made designs for Warrior Cats, DC, Once Upon A Time, Star Wars, Marvel, and more! &amp;#10;Fan/General Discord Server: https://discord.gg/77eWKhKXpy&amp;#10;You may not steal or trace anything in any of my videos. &amp;#10;PLEASE do not ask me about hosting/joining a MAP&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Thank you for understanding and TYSM for watching!"
