    title "Warrior Cats Ultimate Edition! | Elder Roleplaying Tips!"
    description "I have to say, my my have I grown since the last tip video! 200+ subscribers? Damn y&amp;#8217;all, I&amp;#8217;m sorry for neglecting this video for so long!&amp;#10;&amp;#10;!! DISCLAIMER !!&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Please do not rob, or use any of my videos in one of your own without credit! Thank you ^^&amp;#8217;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;FaQ:&amp;#10;What are my pronouns?&amp;#10;A- Any/All&amp;#10;&amp;#10;What Editing Software do you use?&amp;#10;A- KineMaster on IPhone12&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Do you draw?&amp;#10;A- Yes! I do, I may start speedpaints soon enough on this channel as well!&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Are commissions open?&amp;#10;A- As of now, no.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Can I do a collaboration with you for YouTube?&amp;#10;A- Message me VIA discord: Aries#3254&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;!! Questions for my viewers !!&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Q- Did you like this video?&amp;#10;Q- Is there anything I could improve on?&amp;#10;Q- Do you have any tips for myself?&amp;#10;Q- Is there anything else I could have perhaps added?&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#9473;&amp;#9473;&amp;#9473;&amp;#9473;&amp;#9473;&amp;#9473;&amp;#9473; &amp;#9473;&amp;#9473;&amp;#9473;&amp;#9473;&amp;#9473;&amp;#9473;&amp;#9473; &amp;#9473;&amp;#9473;&amp;#9473;&amp;#9473;&amp;#9473;&amp;#9473;&amp;#9473;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Previous Video- https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=PqpLETY_s1w&amp;#10;Newest Video on the Playlist- https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=O7eCfDM4Lqg&amp;#38;t=45s&amp;#10;Roleplaying Tips- https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PL9Z1kOf_j9RNFgDx9CJKOqykieAHKPLMC&amp;#10;Channel- https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCu674Ox0AG1z9371zcY5iWg"
