  [
    id 300
    label "Q5Fpmf_CIf8"
    step 0
    date "2014-09-09T08:09:11Z"
    title "JOAN OF ARC - Complete Warrior Cats MAP"
    description "Here's a link to a (lower quality) version of the upload if the video is blocked on mobile devices: http://fav.me/d7yj8pt&amp;#10;&amp;#10;It&amp;#8217;s here! My 3rd Warriors MAP, and can I just say I am once again blown away by how far everyone who participated pushed themselves. I am so proud to say that I hosted this project; I think it&amp;#8217;s the best MAP I&amp;#8217;ve hosted so far, and I&amp;#8217;m so happy that people were willing to do SO MUCH WORK to accomplish it!&amp;#10;&amp;#10;The song is &amp;#8220;Joan of Arc&amp;#8221; by Arcade Fire!&amp;#10;&amp;#10;This Multi Animator Project&amp;#8217;s (MAP&amp;#8217;s) concept was the female Medicine Cats of Thunderclan and their love/hate relationship with Starclan, along with the theme of &amp;#8220;rough beauty.&amp;#8221; The MAP is structured in 5 major parts:&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Parts 1-3 focus on the life and death of Spottedleaf.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Parts 4-8 show Yellowfang leaving Shadowclan and forming a bond with Cinderpaw. &amp;#10;&amp;#10;Parts 9-11 form an interlude of Starclan sympathizing with the suffering of the Medicine Cats, and the Medicine Cats&amp;#8217; often-uneasy relationship with Starclan.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Parts 12-14 showcase Cinderpelt&amp;#8217;s accident and relationship to Leafpaw&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Parts 14-18 focus on Leafpool&amp;#8217;s fears and shame about loving Crowfeather, and lying to her children.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;I believe that every single part in this MAP is nothing short of amazing; and the story came off very clearly and coherently.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Some people&amp;#8217;s parts were edited or cut short; the reason being that they didn&amp;#8217;t bother to follow one (or more) of the MAP rules.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;To avoid questions about it, the French segment&amp;#8217;s lyrics are: &amp;#10;&amp;#8220;You say you&amp;#8217;re my judge, but I don&amp;#8217;t believe you. You say I&amp;#8217;m a saint, but that&amp;#8217;s not me. I hear voices, but they aren&amp;#8217;t me, I&amp;#8217;m not Joan of Arc!&amp;#8221;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Enjoy the MAP!"
    channeltitle "Alli Kat"
    channelid "UC1M-0GzHNS1sy7my0UBOBFw"
