  [
    id 304
    label "zBPNY9AzsYM"
    step 0
    date "2021-11-20T18:00:11Z"
    title "Willowheart Studio | Warrior Cats Audiobook: Book 1 Chapter 4 [READ DESCRIPTION]"
    description "Message from WillowHeart: Be sure to support Ellie's work as well as the team! They did a fantastic job and any support would be awesome! Please share and even give this video LOT of likes! It'll help so much with getting our channel/videos feature on YT front page! &amp;#10;&amp;#10;Also, to 'those' views out there, don't spam in the comments about &amp;#34;Wings of Fire&amp;#34; from different projects. Its honestly rude, very disrespectful and not nice to the team who worked hard on this with passion! Treat this project with love like you do for our Wings of Fire Graphic Novel Dub.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;For those wanting to aid us in future projects like Audio content ranging from small to large projects? Check out where I do Commissions? TikTok Page? (And future links for channel and myself Patreon) Check out Linktree!&amp;#10;WillowHeart Linktree: https://linktr.ee/WillowHeartStudio&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Now, onto Ellie! Take it away! *bows and walks off stage*&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Hey guys! Its Director Ellie :) Sorry about the wait on this chapter! We've got some news - The chapters should start coming out faster starting next time. However, we are having to cut most of our art out of the project due to our art team not being available :( I am so sad but the voice acting lives on! Another note, our Lead Artist Crab has Retired from our studio. They did so much to help out our art team and we have permission to use their art in the future. Hope you all enjoy! :D&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Director - Elliebear&amp;#10;CCC: https://www.castingcall.club/m/elliebear&amp;#10;Twitter: https://twitter.com/LilBearEllie&amp;#10;&amp;#10;ASSISTANT DIRECTORS&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Lead Art - Crab&amp;#10;Insta: https://www.instagram.com/peachesandpencils/?utm_medium=copy_link &amp;#10;Email: dakotaleenb@gmail.com&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Lead Scripting - LadyAzzura&amp;#10;CCC: http://www.castingcall.club/m/LadyAzzura&amp;#10;YouTube: https://youtube.com/user/MiyuTheFallenAngel&amp;#10;&amp;#10;EDITORS&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Sound - Raya &amp;#10;Website: https://rayascribbles.wixsite.com/website&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Video - FluffyEnderPug / Tyler&amp;#10;Reddit: Tyler (FluffyEnderPug)&amp;#10;YouTube: https://youtube.com/c/ProfessorBird&amp;#10;&amp;#10;VA&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Narrator - WRetcheDNSTuFF - Matthew Anderson&amp;#10;Facebook: https://www.facebook.com/WReTCHeDNSTuFF &amp;#10;CCC: https://www.castingcall.club/?ref=EB9BA97&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Goldenflower - CEOlson&amp;#10;Card: https://ceolson.carrd.co/&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Firepaw - Fuffy&amp;#10;CCC: http://www.castingcall.club/m/Fuffy27&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Graypaw - JMaddera&amp;#10;CCC: https://www.castingcall.club/m/JMaddera&amp;#10;YouTube: https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCwTRrzDnaxVztoQ9MYGwHqg&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Ravenpaw - Jenkib of Florida&amp;#10;CCC: https://www.castingcall.club/m/jenkib726 &amp;#10;YouTube: https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC1TplpfGlWhDlibd-Z9edVA/featured&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Spottedleaf - Azzura&amp;#10;YouTube: https://youtube.com/user/MiyuTheFallenAngel&amp;#10;CCC: http://www.castingcall.club/m/LadyAzzura&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Smallear - Bonniecakes&amp;#10;https://www.castingcall.club/m/Bonniecakes&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Whitestorm - Akin Abisogun&amp;#10;abisogunva@gmail.com&amp;#10;https://www.castingcall.club/m/Akin%20Abisogun&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Bluestar - Taylor Grace&amp;#10;CCC: https://www.castingcall.club/m/wickedlyelphie&amp;#10;YouTube: https://youtube.com/channel/UChzAjTr4fpLWqi93O4ofgNQ&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Tigerclaw - Joe Hoffman&amp;#10;Twitter: https://twitter.com/rascallion71&amp;#10;Youtube: https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC_CArNoybkYg_nJXaC0qq5w&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Dappletail - Oa Artemis HC / Windelower&amp;#10;https://www.castingcall.club/m/Windelower&amp;#10;&amp;#10;One-Eye - Astrid&amp;#10;https://www.castingcall.club/m/Astrid_Amnell&amp;#10;&amp;#10;ARTISTS&amp;#10;&amp;#10;shushkeh&amp;#10;Instagram: https://www.instagram.com/shushkeh/&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Lite&amp;#10;Twitter: https