  [
    id 315
    label "LCRcjCp8R9E"
    step 0
    date "2020-05-15T18:00:11Z"
    title "Song of the Witches [COMPLETE Medieval Warrior Cats MAP]"
    description "I am so unbelievably proud of how this MAP turned out. I feel like a proud parent! This was my first MAP in some years and hosting is pretty different from how it used to be. This was my first MAP with a discord server, and it made things soooo much easier. There was only one dropped/kicked part and that was because I never heard from the person since they didn't join the server, everything else ran pretty smoothly!&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Since this was my first MAP in a while, there were a couple of things I didn't do that are pretty standard now. I didn't do a thumbnail contest and I didn't do a credit sequence, things which I'll probably do next time now that my toes are back in the MAP pool.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Parts playlist - https://bit.ly/2WA4EcA&amp;#10;&amp;#10;PARTS -&amp;#10;1. GiingerSnaps&amp;#10;2. DaVinci131&amp;#10;3. Crazllana&amp;#10;4. Morning Haze&amp;#10;5. Martletwing studio&amp;#10;6. MANCH!&amp;#10;7. Nutmeggie&amp;#10;8. Me&amp;#10;9. dogstoof&amp;#10;10. moldypaw&amp;#10;11. Chilly Weathers&amp;#10;12. LilyaneMB&amp;#10;13. uneasywolf&amp;#10;14. Brightpelt&amp;#10;15. Anji Blizzy&amp;#10;16. Kitsune Kreations&amp;#10;17. LionBunny&amp;#10;18. daydreamer&amp;#10;19. Foxes heart&amp;#10;20. Faded Kat&amp;#10;21. _reiika_&amp;#10;22. Arcatdia&amp;#10;23. And E&amp;#10;24. Pearl Walker&amp;#10;25. Jersokoi&amp;#10;26. Pigeocore&amp;#10;27. scottsdraws&amp;#10;28. birdkiye&amp;#10;29. Scoutnmave + Makaroni Art&amp;#10;30. BuB0&amp;#10;31. GildedPhD&amp;#10;32. Frostlii&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;This was an incredible experience and I'm so happy with how everyone did!!&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Song-&amp;#10;Song of Witches by SJ Tucker"
