    id 317
    label "cbAzyVGuqWM"
    step 0
    date "2021-05-29T01:17:19Z"
    title "Is changed!)"
    description "HALLO! Kitty cat game guys. It's here. &amp;#10;&amp;#10;Since I've last played it, the game has come out, and it looks GORGEOUS. As I say like ten times in the video, there are so many new features, and it really makes this game stand out. Which is why I'm gonna start doing content on it! &amp;#10;WoF Roblox has slowed down development wise, and while I'll always be a &amp;#34;Wings of Fire YouTuber&amp;#34;, I thought it'd be nice to expand my content- people have always suggested expanding my content before, but I can't ever find a game that inspires me to make videos! But now, kitty cat game. (Watch the video to listen to me ramble more)&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#11088; OTHER SOCIAL MEDIAS&amp;#10;Twitch - Twitch -  https://www.twitch.tv/bellasaurus_ (Inactive)&amp;#10;Tumblr - https://belladoesstuff.tumblr.com/ (For art!)&amp;#10;DeviantArt - https://www.deviantart.com/bellasauruss (For art!)&amp;#10;Instagram - https://www.instagram.com/bellasauruss/ (For art!)&amp;#10;Roblox - https://www.roblox.com/users/117213744/profile&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#11088;COMMON QUESTIONS:&amp;#10;Q: What is your outro music?&amp;#10;A: HOME - Resonance&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Q: What do you edit with?&amp;#10;A: Lightworks&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Q: What do you record with?&amp;#10;A: I record with the Xbox screen recorder that comes with my Windows 11 Software. Or OBS Studio.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Q: What game is this?&amp;#10;A: Game can be found below!&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Q: What do you animate with?&amp;#10;A: FireAlpaca&amp;#10;&amp;#10;-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------&amp;#10;If you're a little interested in my videos, maybe subscribe I dunno. If my uploads get annoying you can always unsubscribe. Don't worry, that's a feature. I'd hate to be getting Roblox dragon roleplay game videos in my recommended for all of time as well. Also art. If you don't like art then oop-&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Game:&amp;#10;https://www.roblox.com/games/3663340706/Warrior-Cats-Ultimate-Edition?refPageId=952e2056-c2db-4ada-8e2b-9c9af7601a61&amp;#10;-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Music&amp;#10;Wild Glide Galaxy - Super Mario Galaxy 2&amp;#10;Your Name, Please - Earthbound&amp;#10;Threed At Last - Earthbound&amp;#10;Ki - C418&amp;#10;Maple Treeway - Mario Kart Wii&amp;#10;Mushroom Gorge - Mario Kart Wii&amp;#10;Catastrophe - Super Mario Galaxy&amp;#10;Cosmic Cove Galaxy - Super Mario Galaxy"
