  [
    id 322
    label "Ji9ciMqrjOc"
    step 0
    date "2015-05-04T06:33:44Z"
    title "We All Still Die - Complete Warrior Cats M.A.P [HD]"
    description "**-*-**BLOOD/GORE WARNING AND CAT DEATHS. SPOILERS FOR THE ENTIRE WARRIORS SERIES*-**-** CLICK READ MORE FOR MORE INFO!! :)&amp;#10;&amp;#10;::!!EDIT!!:: I'm sure some people want to know why this was uploaded for a little bit before it was taken down - and that was because there were a few glitches and things I saw that I wanted to fix. I thought better to fix it now and have it the best it, so that's what happened! Also I decided to stay up till like 3am instead of sleeping and uploading it in the morning because I WANT THIS MAP UPLOADED RIGHT NOW BECAUSE I LOVE IT SO DANG MUCH I DONT MESS AROUND OK :::!!END OF EDIT!!::::&amp;#10;&amp;#10;After a bunch of glitches (cires softly thank you Ferrah and Maple for the help figuring that out) ITS FINALLY HERE. After Wolf became so popular wow I was nervous thinking about if this map could live up to it... But now it's finished and I'm just as proud of this as Wolf if not more due to the massive amount of wonderful people who worked on it and took part. This M.A.P doesn't follow a very linear narrative but all the parts brought it together into a wonderful thing and I'm so happy with how it turned out you guys are so talented its insane and I love it~&amp;#10;&amp;#10;This M.A.P (Multi Animator Project) is all about good vrs evil and dead cats and dying cats and the entire theme of death in the series woohoo&amp;#10;Here's a link to the original script and parts if you are interested: https://youtu.be/0g43C6Dm948&amp;#10;______&amp;#10;&amp;#10;AWESOME PEOPLE WHO TOOK PART AND WHAT IS HAPPENING IN THEIR PARTS. (Channels linked on end credits when im awake tomorrow in the video!)&amp;#10;&amp;#10;1. MapleSpyder (The clans and Firestar)&amp;#10;2. MapleSpyder (^)&amp;#10;3. CatzTUM (Darkstripe entering the Dark Forest)&amp;#10;4. mrKarafirefox (Tigerclaw, Bluestar and Fireheart)&amp;#10;5. BuzzyBee (Ashfur before he was rejected by Squirrelflight)&amp;#10;6. Kittson (Ashfur after being rejected by Squirrelflight)&amp;#10;7. Going-in-Cakeless (Darkstripe's death)&amp;#10;8. Jack (Tigerstar's Death)&amp;#10;9. Jack (Scourge after killing Tigerstar)&amp;#10;10. Kittyrocker (Ashfur's death and Hollyleaf's reaction to what she's done)&amp;#10;11. Callipepla Californica (Cats in the Dark Forest)&amp;#10;12. Philstock2000 (Cats in Starclan)&amp;#10;13. ForsakenSpirits FS (Cinderpaw falling from the tree)&amp;#10;14. Fireworkcat25 (Leafpool caring for Cinderpaw while Starclan watches)&amp;#10;15. rat whisker (Hollyleaf's feelings when she discovers her true mother)&amp;#10;16. Rory Butt (Hollyleaf confronting Leafpool)&amp;#10;17. Spooky Hollows (Yellowfang feeding death-berries to Brokenstar)&amp;#10;18. Shilly (Brokenstar killing his father, Raggedstar)&amp;#10;19. Shenkkazoo (Yellowfang looking back on her life)&amp;#10;20. Skyless (Yellowfang's death)&amp;#10;21. XMidnightXRoseX (Yellowfang entering Starclan)&amp;#10;22. RyeTaran (Yellowfang seeing cats she loved from her past and becoming happier)&amp;#10;23. sodapoptops (The Dark Forest)&amp;#10;24. Eucalyptus splash (Brokenstar alone in the Dark Forest)&amp;#10;25. Flowing_Waves (Fireheart looking back at Greystripe grieving over Silverstream's body)&amp;#10;26. Fireworkcat25 (Greystripe grieving)&amp;#10;27. Milk bowl / dark-san / Ravi / Whiskermoon (Fireheart helping Greystripe back to his feet and back to the clan)&amp;#10;28. Steamy Cafe (Greystripe surrounded by friends)&amp;#10;29. Mintleafs (Greystripe's point of view - him and his sadness)&amp;#10;30. Silvaan (Honeyfern's death)&amp;#10;31. Shilly (Stonefur's death)&amp;#10;32. Radvumtal (Briarkit is safe because of Honeyfern, The kits Stonefur saves are now safe)&amp;#10;33. amberbydreamsart (Honeyfern and Stonefur join Starclan)&amp;#10;34. ObnoxiousGiraffe (Crookedstar in Starclan)&amp;#10;35. ObnoxiousGiraffe (Mapleshade in the Dark Forest)&amp;#10;36. watersee kitty (The old forest and the Lake)&amp;#10;37. Me (Firestar dying from Scourge's death-blow then being granted another life by a Starclan cat)&amp;#10;38. Kura Kur (Firestar killing Scourge)&amp;#10;39. MapleSpyder (The clans have won the battle against Scourge)&amp;#10;40. Nifty-senpai (The final battle between Tigerstar and Firestar and Tigerstar being truly killed once and for all)&amp;#10;41. Nifty-senpai&amp;#10;&amp;#10;____&amp;#10;&amp;#10;- Song: Willow Tree March - The Paper Kites&amp;#10;- Stories and characters created by Erin Hunter&amp;#10;- Credit song (edited): Little Red Lung - Fangs&amp;#10;_____&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Copyright Disclaimer Under Section 107 of the Copyright Act 1976, allowance is made for &amp;#34;fair use&amp;#34; for purposes such as criticism, comment, news reporting, teaching, scholarship, and research. Fair use is a use permitted by copyright statute that might otherwise be infringing. Non-profit, educational or personal use tips the balance in favor of fair use."
