  [
    id 333
    label "nOeMg_tLt_k"
    step 0
    date "2022-05-14T17:00:10Z"
    title "Frostpaw OPAL Animatic/Storyboard Warrior Cats [A Starless Clan]"
    description "READ PINNED COMMENT FOR DESCRIPTION OF EVENTS WITHIN VIDEO&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Okay I've been working on this for a bit bc I'm really considering making it a storyboarded map if all goes well. I've never made a map before so if anyone has any advice feel free to share. It's not quite in shape yet but I wanted to post this version first to get feedback and whatnot&amp;#10;This is the longest video I've ever made by far so ummmmm hope it goes well &amp;#128077;&amp;#10;I think the program I used messed up the quality and the timing near the end but it'll be fine&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Spoilers for River, the first book of A Starless Clan, btw.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Things you need to know from the book before watching [if you&amp;#8217;ve read the book already, skip past this part]: At the beginning of the book Frostpaw has just been made a medicine cat apprentice. She&amp;#8217;s nervous about it but her mother, Curlfeather, reassures her and brings up the prophecies she&amp;#8217;s already received, one of which being the death of her father Jayclaw when she was still a kit. Not long after making it official at the moonpool, Mistystar loses her last life mid argument in front of the whole clan, Frostpaw included. Reedwhisker, Riverclan&amp;#8217;s deputy, doesn&amp;#8217;t return from patrol that night and is missing for a while after. After receiving a vision during another trip to the moonpool, Frostpaw leads a patrol to look for Reedwhisker. She ends up finding him dead at the bottom of a ravine. The cats assume he died from the fall but it&amp;#8217;s implied it was something more. Being the only cat in the clan who can communicate with Starclan anymore, she is thrust into somewhat of a leadership position and returns to the moonpool for a sign. She interprets it to mean Curlfeather to be the next leader. On the way to receive Curlfeather&amp;#8217;s nine lives, however, a pack of dogs appears. The dogs catch and maul Curlfeather as Frostpaw barely escapes. Her last words are a warning to Frostpaw, to trust no cat. At the end of the book Frostpaw returns to the medicine den, traumatized, while the other cats discuss what happens next.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Sorry I can't put up captions on this one right away I'll try to do it eventually tho&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Please don't use my art without first asking permission and giving credit&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Characters are mainly Frostpaw, Jayclaw, Curlfeather, Mistkit+Graykit, Mistystar and Reedwhisker &amp;#10;&amp;#10;Original audio is from Jack Stauber's Opal on Adult Swim"
    channeltitle "Rudymentary"
    channelid "UCezt8j6_Mec_dYUjnA4M_RQ"
