    id 334
    label "po2Df047-tA"
    step 0
    date "2018-06-06T21:32:04Z"
    title " Bramblepaw. ORIGINAL WARRIOR CATS SONG"
    description "Download available for this song on&amp;#10;&amp;#127925; iTunes&amp;#127925; https://goo.gl/kHP15w&amp;#10;&amp;#127925;Google Play&amp;#127925;https://goo.gl/N2qvcE&amp;#10;&amp;#10;__________&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Subscribe for more!  &amp;#8594; https://goo.gl/1eqmUj&amp;#10;Twitter  &amp;#8594; https://goo.gl/ZfTYa9&amp;#10;Patreon &amp;#8594; https://www.patreon.com/Blixemi&amp;#10;&amp;#10;__________&amp;#10;&amp;#10;CREDITS&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Tawnypaw's Vocals-&amp;#10; Dawn Balidashi&amp;#10;Youtube- https://bit.ly/2sB0mlF&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Bramblepaw's Vocals-&amp;#10;KindledFlame&amp;#10;Youtube- https://www.youtube.com/c/KindledFlame&amp;#10;Twitter: https://twitter.com/KindledFlame_&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Chorus Singers-&amp;#10;Fluffylovey- https://bit.ly/2JyayVN&amp;#10;Fey Draws- https://bit.ly/2kU3yEI&amp;#10;Cosmic Creations- https://bit.ly/2sM2ZRe&amp;#10;Moonfrost18- https://bit.ly/2LtvcDQ&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Instrumental/Lyrics/Video Editing/Backing Vocals/Art-&amp;#10;Blixemi&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Warrior Cats&amp;#10;Erin Hunter&amp;#10;&amp;#10;__________&amp;#10;&amp;#10;RULES&amp;#10;&amp;#10;PLEASE. &amp;#10;-Do not reupload this audio onto your channel without permission from me. &amp;#10;-Do not nightcore, or redistribute the audio, lyrics, or art, on youtube or any other website. &amp;#10;-I ask that at this point, there are no MAPs created with this audio. Thanks for understanding!&amp;#10;&amp;#10;__________&amp;#10;&amp;#10;LYRICS&amp;#10;&amp;#10;[spoken]&amp;#10;TAWNY:  I-I can't do this anymore!&amp;#10;BRAMBLE:  Tawnypaw, look at me! We can show them that we're better than him!&amp;#10;TAWNY:  We shouldn't have to.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;[Singing]&amp;#10;TAWNY&amp;#10;I don't know how we ended up here.&amp;#10;Any good we've done will all disappear&amp;#10;I cannot take this, I am wearing so thin.&amp;#10;Cause when they look at me, all they see is him. &amp;#10;Why should I have to work twice as hard,&amp;#10;Just to only reach half as far?&amp;#10;When they look at me, he's all they see.&amp;#10;'Cause when they look, they never see me.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;I can see his spirit every day, soon she will suffer his same fate!&amp;#10;You cannot trust a murderer's kin, she's gunna end up exactly like him!&amp;#10;Watch your back, watch your sides, she's got evil hidden inside.&amp;#10;Hide the kits! Hold them near, no one's safe so long as she's here!     &amp;#10;&amp;#10;BRAMBLE&amp;#10;Listen to me, you're not alone.&amp;#10;You don't have to go through this on your own.&amp;#10;Hold your head high, don't let them get through&amp;#10;Please don't let this get to you.&amp;#10;Once they see what's inside your heart,&amp;#10;Then they'll know you'll reach twice as far.&amp;#10;We'll prove ourselves- just wait, they'll see.&amp;#10;Don't look at them, just look at me.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#34;THUNDERCLAN CATS&amp;#34;&amp;#10;I can see his step in all of her strides, soon there will be no safe place to hide!&amp;#10;You cannot trust a murderer's kin, she's gunna end up exactly like him!&amp;#10;Turn your back, let her rot, she has the exact same ambition that he's got.&amp;#10;Guard the camp, chase her out! No one is safe so long as she's about!&amp;#10;   &amp;#10;TAWNY&amp;#10;I don't know how we ended up here&amp;#10;&amp;#10;BRAMBLE&amp;#10;Any good we've done will all disappear&amp;#10;&amp;#10;TAWNY&amp;#10;I cannot take this, I am wearing so thin&amp;#10;&amp;#10;BRAMBLE&amp;#10;Cause when they look at me, all they see is him&amp;#10;&amp;#10;TOGETHER&amp;#10;Why should I have to work twice as hard,&amp;#10;Just to only reach half as far?&amp;#10;When they look at me, he's all they see.&amp;#10;'Cause when they look, they never see me.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;BRAMBLE&amp;#10;Listen to me, you're not alone.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;TAWNY &amp;#10;I don't know how we ended up here.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;BRAMBLE&amp;#10;You don't have to go through this on your own.&amp;#10;Hold your head high, don't let them get through&amp;#10;&amp;#10;TAWNY&amp;#10;I cannot take this, I am wearing so thin.&amp;#10;Cause when they look at me, all they see is him. &amp;#10;Why should I have to work twice as hard,&amp;#10;Just to only reach half as far?&amp;#10;&amp;#10;BRAMBLE&amp;#10;Then they'll know you'll reach twice as far.&amp;#10;We'll prove ourselves-- just wait, they'll see.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;TAWNY&amp;#10;When they look at me, he's all they see.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;BRAMBLE&amp;#10;Don't look at them, just look at me.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;TAWNY&amp;#10;Listen to me, we're on our own.&amp;#10;We don't have to go through this if we go alone.&amp;#10;I promise they will never get through&amp;#10;I am leaving brother, so should you.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Once they see the mistake they've made.&amp;#10;Perhaps then they'll see it my way    &amp;#10;I'll prove myself-- just wait, they'll see.&amp;#10;I hope they all turn and watch me leave. &amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#34;THUNDERCLAN CATS&amp;#34;&amp;#10;I can see his spirit every day, soon she will suffer his same fate!&amp;#10;You cannot trust a murderer's kin, she's gunna end up exactly like him!&amp;#10;Watch your back, watch your sides, she's got evil hidden inside.&amp;#10;Hide the kits! Hold them near, no one's safe so long as she's here!     &amp;#10;I can see his step in all of her strides, soon there will be no safe place to hide!&amp;#10;You cannot trust a murderer's kin, she's gunna end up exactly like him!&amp;#10;Turn your back, let her rot, she has the exact same ambition that he's got.&amp;#10;Guard camp, don't let her in! Cause when we look we only see him.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;TAWNY&amp;#10;I don't know how we ended up here.&amp;#10;Any good we've done will all disappear&amp;#10;I cannot take this, I am wearing so thin.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;When they look at me, he's all they see.&amp;#10;'Cause when they look, they never see me."
