    date "2021-07-21T06:04:15Z"
    title "Blink Encounter In Warrior Cats Ultimate Edition"
    description "3/3/2022: So um, turns out that I was stupid. Blink never existed. I kinda sussed this but now I realise it's true: Heather probably changed their username since mods can do that, it was probably fake from the start aha. But it was fun! I think that other games should add NPC's like this since I'm not sure if WCUE want's to add NPC's for real.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Blink was a glitched AI that Pav, Viz and Tigress forgot to remove in the recent herb update.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;- ITS BEEN CONFIRMED BY FINNZ IN THE WCUE DISCORD THAT IS ONLY BLINK AND THE OTHER COLOURS ARE BUGGED VERSION OF HIM OR FAKE&amp;#10;&amp;#10;What [had known] I know about Blink:&amp;#10;- He spawns near the gorge, barn, wc territory, wc thunderpath, kp place, and carrion&amp;#10;- He&amp;#8217;s usually black but can be other colours like dark blue, white or grey [people call the white version Flick and the brown version Wink]&amp;#10;- He can run around, sit, loaf, crouch, jump, etc&amp;#10;- Runs VERY fast sometimes&amp;#10;- If he spawns sitting, usually stays for 5 - 8 secs&amp;#10;- If he spawns standing, usually stays for 10 - 60 secs&amp;#10;- Very smart ai, as you saw in the video he walked around the gorge instead of falling in, before later jumping in.&amp;#10;- Someone is making a Blink x Reader fanfic and people want to read it???? What????&amp;#10;- May chase you sometimes? [people call the version that chases you Sink] I don't think this is real&amp;#10;- Mostly spawns at night but can spawn at dusk/dawn/sunrise/sunset, rarely day&amp;#10;- Can spawn in public, staff or private servers with 1 - 5 players&amp;#10;- He&amp;#8217;s real&amp;#10;- The white variant of him should&amp;#8217;ve been called Knilb not Flick, because its Blink backwards&amp;#10;&amp;#10;This reminds me of Herobrine from Minecraft mixed with Stan from Identity Fraud mixed with Floppy from the old WolfQuest&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Please lmk in comments if you have any more information!!"
    channeltitle "Flame"
    channelid "UCeoqRcuE9HyY6fG5ZbhYEBw"
