    step 0
    date "2021-07-14T16:01:51Z"
    title " ORIGINAL WARRIOR CATS SONG - Dovewing. Animatic! (Feat. Nola Klop)"
    description "&amp;#34;I'll Fly&amp;#34; streaming now on...&amp;#10;&amp;#127925;Spotify&amp;#127925;  https://spoti.fi/3xGbvBh&amp;#10;&amp;#127925; iTunes&amp;#127925; https://apple.co/3B3NrKE&amp;#10;&amp;#10;||~Where To Find Me!~||&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Follow my Twitter!  &amp;#8594; https://goo.gl/ZfTYa9&amp;#10;Subscribe for more!  &amp;#8594; https://goo.gl/1eqmUj&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Want to see videos and hear songs EARLY? Be a part of an exclusive &amp;#34;Blixemi Super Fan&amp;#34; discord server? &amp;#38; Much MORE?&amp;#10;Then check out my Patreon! &amp;#8594; https://www.patreon.com/Blixemi&amp;#10;&amp;#10;||---------||&amp;#10;&amp;#10;CREDITS&amp;#10;Dovewing's Vocals - Nola Klop&amp;#10;Youtube - https://www.youtube.com/nolaklop&amp;#10;Website - https://nolaklop.com/&amp;#10;Twitter - https://twitter.com/nolaklop&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Animatic by roarasaurus&amp;#10;Youtube - https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCM2Y-560zThHfKJ1wi7paqQ&amp;#10;Twitter - https://twitter.com/roarinsaurus&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Mixing/Mastering of Audio - Nola Klop&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Music/Lyrics/Produced by - Blixemi&amp;#10;&amp;#10;||---------||&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Please note: &amp;#10;-Do not reupload this audio onto your channel. &amp;#10;-Do not nightcore, or redistribute the audio, lyrics, or art, on youtube or any other website. &amp;#10;-I ask that at this point, there are no MAPs created with this audio. Thanks for understanding!&amp;#10;&amp;#10;||---------||&amp;#10;LYRICS&amp;#10;&amp;#10;How would it feel to take that leap?&amp;#10;And never think of the ground at all.&amp;#10;Close your eyes, breathe in so deep,&amp;#10;No one waiting to catch your fall-&amp;#10;&amp;#10;All my life I&amp;#8217;ve been told to wait.&amp;#10;For the storm clouds to clear the sky&amp;#10;But all I want is to feel the rain&amp;#8230;&amp;#10;let those winds take me higher and higher!&amp;#10;&amp;#10;And still I&amp;#8217;ve yet to touch those clouds.&amp;#10;They say I&amp;#8217;m safer on the ground&amp;#8230;.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;One day I&amp;#8217;ll fly-...&amp;#10;Just take the chance to try-&amp;#10;I know if I go, &amp;#10;I&amp;#8217;ll learn to take to the sky!&amp;#10;And as hard as that seems,&amp;#10;To take that first faithful leap.&amp;#10;I&amp;#8217;ll fly-...&amp;#10;&amp;#10;I&amp;#8217;m on the highest peak as someone new,&amp;#10;Though I hear them try to call me home,&amp;#10;But I cannot seem to shake this view,&amp;#10;Where I jump headfirst into the unknown!&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Looking back, I can see it now,&amp;#10;The world&amp;#8217;s so small from on the ground..&amp;#10;&amp;#10;And I&amp;#8217;ll fly-...&amp;#10;Just take the chance to try-&amp;#10;I know if I go-&amp;#10; I&amp;#8217;ll learn to take to the sky.&amp;#10;And as hard as it seems,&amp;#10;I&amp;#8217;ll take that first faithful leap..&amp;#10;I&amp;#8217;ll fly-!&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Just leave the rest all behind!&amp;#10;When I fly!&amp;#10;Let the winds be my guide&amp;#10;And I&amp;#8217;ll fly!&amp;#10;&amp;#10;I&amp;#8217;m done with looking down,&amp;#10;Let them see me now,&amp;#10;As I fly"
