    description "Hey everyone!&amp;#10;I've been wanting to do this for such a long time and the time has finally come. I had so much fun working on this and testing my skills as not only a voice actor, but an audio and video editor too.&amp;#10;I'd like to thank every single person who has helped bring this to life!&amp;#10;Thank you all for watching and I hope you enjoy.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Would you like to audition for a future character? Check out the casting call!&amp;#10;https://www.castingcall.club/projects/warrior-cats-into-the-wild-the-unofficial-audiobook&amp;#10;&amp;#10;-&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Cast&amp;#10;Narrator &amp;#38; Bluestar - Tara Prentice (Moonfrost18)&amp;#10;https://www.youtube.com/user/Moonfrost18&amp;#10;https://twitter.com/TaraPrentice18&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Tigerclaw - Martin Beadle&amp;#10;https://www.instagram.com/martinbeadlevoiceovers/&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Oakheart - 2 Lainz&amp;#10;https://www.youtube.com/c/2lainz&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Redtail - Riptide Smith&amp;#10;https://www.youtube.com/c/RiptideSmith&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Extra - Quietbeam&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Spottedleaf - Selina&amp;#10;https://www.youtube.com/c/Selina95&amp;#10;&amp;#10;-&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Audio and video edited by Tara Prentice (Moonfrost18)&amp;#10;https://www.youtube.com/user/Moonfrost18&amp;#10;https://twitter.com/TaraPrentice18&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Scenery art by Sages&amp;#10;https://www.youtube.com/user/roscoeandmila&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Ambiance and sound effects from https://freesound.org/&amp;#10;&amp;#10;-&amp;#10;&amp;#10;All rights to Warrior Cats belong to Erin Hunter and HarperCollins."
