  [
    id 393
    label "2mMWz9evo-s"
    step 0
    date "2008-09-08T15:27:57Z"
    title "Warrior cats intro - fan animation by SSS"
    description "original story, narrative idea, characters belong to novel Warrior cats into the wild, official website:&amp;#10;http://www.warriorcats.com/warriorshell.html&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Truelight (theme for DNAngel) &amp;#10;&amp;#10;Uncolored work in progress version - http://uk.youtube.com/watch?v=TTl_3bTqMxY&amp;#10;&amp;#10;HQ test - http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=vmzZN-MWiMU&amp;#38;lc=LnO1HvUCykYXFfzeDhEr80&amp;#10;&amp;#10;some friends asked me what programs i used, I might just answer it here:&amp;#10;The animation is created with graphic tablet drawn straight into Flash (8), layout is done in Photoshop, additional effect (lens flare) is added in After Effect, and finally export from Windows movie maker just to make the animation small and easy for submission. the whole process is done in my 5 and half years old pc ^_o i'm somehow proud of its age and loyalty.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;The reason I use Flash is because I don't have light box and enough paper, scanner at home, Flash is time saving way to make animation myself with few other friends.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Ps. Flash is a program for creating web animation, interactive things and websites, motion graphic, usually use with Illustrator and other vector programs. FBF animator like me only used 5% features of Flash.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;as Rosi suggested, I created this new account only for our Warrior cat_into the wild animations.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;The account will be decorated soon.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;I know spotted leaf isn't white, but somehow me and Rosi imaged her a white cat before realizing that she isnt. ^^ll I think I'll keep her white in these animations.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;This is my first time shading my animation, and first attempt to animate cats fighting, there are still a lot need to improve in my future works.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;subtitle will be both English and Chinese, voice will be English.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Directed by me (Yuji/badasi) and Rosi, Animation assistant Zing. I'll make a list of audicians once the 1st episode is finished."
