  [
    id 402
    label "VIkT0a5VQfo"
    step 0
    date "2020-10-12T08:26:24Z"
    title "Read Warrior Cats books with me!"
    description "Together we're going to read all the Warrior Cats books in chronological order!&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Right now we&amp;#8217;re reading! &amp;#10;&amp;#8664;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160; &amp;#8665;&amp;#10;Into the Wild&amp;#10;&amp;#8663;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160; &amp;#8662;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;You can join in the reading challenge too! &amp;#10;&amp;#10;Join the group chat to discuss reactions to the weekly sections of readings.&amp;#10;http://aminoapps.com/p/jqksv3&amp;#10;&amp;#10;I encourage you to create artwork of scenes from the books that we read, and write fan fiction of what you think would be interesting if another path in the story was taken or a more in-depth look at a character.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Use the #IntotheWild on your posts about the book! All that participate will receive 10 ac!&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#9635;&amp;#9635;&amp;#9635;&amp;#9635;&amp;#9635;&amp;#9635;&amp;#9635;&amp;#9635;&amp;#9635;&amp;#9635;&amp;#9635;&amp;#9635;&amp;#9635;&amp;#9635;&amp;#9635;&amp;#9635;&amp;#9635;&amp;#9635;&amp;#10;Here&amp;#8217;s the reading schedule to try and keep up with over the next 2 weeks!&amp;#10;&amp;#10;October 12th - October 17th&amp;#10;Start - Finish&amp;#10;&amp;#9635;&amp;#9635;&amp;#9635;&amp;#9635;&amp;#9635;&amp;#9635;&amp;#9635;&amp;#9635;&amp;#9635;&amp;#9635;&amp;#9635;&amp;#9635;&amp;#9635;&amp;#9635;&amp;#9635;&amp;#9635;&amp;#9635;&amp;#9635;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;And the goal is that in 1 week we&amp;#8217;ll have finished Into the Wild and that we can move on to Fire and Ice!&amp;#10;&amp;#10;I&amp;#8217;m so excited to start reading with you all and hear your insights on Into the Wild!&amp;#10;&amp;#10;You can watch Into the Wild: The Movie while you read this week to compare the differences! https://youtu.be/oCYs9lnq1tE&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Join my Amino! https://bit.ly/2GNq0y4&amp;#10;iOS and Google Play: https://bit.ly/2Ta75Sq&amp;#10;&amp;#10;...&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Want some real life warriors cats? Subscribe to my cats' channel! Daily cat videos!&amp;#10;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=6V8G47hFB6Q&amp;#10;&amp;#10;...&amp;#10;&amp;#10;13+ Content Disclaimer: Showing my cats in this video, not intended to attract young viewers."
