    title "Warrior Cats Animated Into The Wild: Episode 6 (Im Not Scared) SEASON FINALE"
    description "(Warning, Lots of cursing and lots of blood)&amp;#10;Based on the Warriors novels by Erin Hunter&amp;#10;&amp;#10;WOW 1YR OLD they grow up so fast, lets hope we can finish this series before its 50yrs old ;)&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;BUTBUTBUT this took longer cause of holidays and flus and lots of inconveniences , but its out now and i'm happy, i got this big ugly cold sore, i dunno if it was stress or what, BUT i look forward to relaxing a bit, maybe play sum vidya games&amp;#10;&amp;#10;WCA tumblr: https://www.tumblr.com/blog/warriorcatsanimated&amp;#10;BokBokChoy twitter: https://twitter.com/?lang=en&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Rory- http://sillystrung.tumblr.com/ (Also animated it)&amp;#10;Fritz- https://tinyurl.com/yclas2s2&amp;#10;Lillian- https://www.instagram.com/odetough/?h...&amp;#10;And also animated by-&amp;#10;Elliot - https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCtui...&amp;#10;New Voices-&amp;#10;Taylor https://www.youtube.com/user/TaylorTe...&amp;#10;Madeline - https://twitter.com/faeryxoxo&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Rory- Smudge, Graypaw, Ravenpaw, Runningwind, Longtail, Smallear, Brindleface, Boulder, Brownpaw.&amp;#10;Fritz- Firepaw, Tigerclaw, Whitestorm, Lionheart, Sandpaw, Yellowfang, Brokenstar, Darkstripe, Blackfoot, Susanne, Barley, Nightpelt&amp;#10;Lillian- Bluestar, Mousefur, Spottedleaf, Speckletail, Willowpelt, Littlepaw&amp;#10;Elliot- Runningnose, Crookedstar, Crowfur, Thornclaw.&amp;#10;Moms- Frostfur&amp;#10;Pops- Mudfur, Patchpelt&amp;#10;Madeline- One-eye&amp;#10;Taylor- Goldenflower&amp;#10;Navgate- Halftail&amp;#10;&amp;#10;(music used)&amp;#10;1940's slow dance (sting) (doug maxwell/media right productions)&amp;#10;Super Blues (Unicorn Heads)&amp;#10;Fast Talkin &amp;#10;Fast Talkin by Kevin MacLeod is licensed under a Creative Commons Attribution license (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/)&amp;#10;Source: http://incompetech.com/music/royalty-free/index.html?isrc=USUAN1100590&amp;#10;Artist: http://incompetech.com/&amp;#10;Accordion (Andrew Huang)&amp;#10;intimate tango (doug maxwell/media right productions)&amp;#10;fortunate note (silent partner)&amp;#10;minor mush (john deley and the 41 players)&amp;#10;paint ball theme (bird creek)&amp;#10;pitch (lish grooves)&amp;#10;et voila (Chris Haugen)&amp;#10;jazz piano bar (doug maxwell/media right productions)&amp;#10;Friday Morning by Kevin MacLeod is licensed under a Creative Commons Attribution license (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/)&amp;#10;Source: http://incompetech.com/music/royalty-free/index.html?isrc=USUAN1100224&amp;#10;Artist: http://incompetech.com/&amp;#10;Bet on it (silent partner)"
