    description "Download available for this song on&amp;#10;&amp;#127925; iTunes&amp;#127925; https://apple.co/2XrxjT8&amp;#10;&amp;#127925;Google Play&amp;#127925;https://bit.ly/30psSpb&amp;#10;&amp;#10;||---------||&amp;#10;&amp;#10;||~Where To Find Me!~||&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Follow my Twitter!  &amp;#8594; https://goo.gl/ZfTYa9&amp;#10;Subscribe for more!  &amp;#8594; https://goo.gl/1eqmUj&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Want to see videos and hear songs EARLY? Be apart of an exclusive &amp;#34;Blixemi Super Fan&amp;#34; discord server? &amp;#38; Much MORE?&amp;#10;Then check out my Patreon! &amp;#8594; https://www.patreon.com/Blixemi&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;||---------||&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Credits&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Hawkfrost - Chris Sayers&amp;#10;Follow Chris on&amp;#10;Twitter- https://twitter.com/NotSoLittleC&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Brambleclaw- KindledFlame&amp;#10;Follow Kindle on&amp;#10;Twitter- https://twitter.com/kindledflame_&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Video Art- CrystalColors&amp;#10;dA- https://www.deviantart.com/crystalcolors&amp;#10;Youtube- https://bit.ly/2L6JFcS&amp;#10;Twitter- https://twitter.com/_CrystalColors_&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Music, Lyrics, Additional Art/Vocals - Blixemi&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Mixing - Michael Calvillo &amp;#34;freshmicks&amp;#34;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#34;WARRIORS&amp;#34; Characters &amp;#38; Concepts -&amp;#10;Erin Hunter / Harper Collins&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;||---------||&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Would you like a chance to sing in a future WC Original Song?&amp;#10;http://bit.ly/2lCJHgj - Fill out this form to sign up!&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;||---------||&amp;#10;&amp;#10;RULES&amp;#10;&amp;#10;PLEASE. &amp;#10;-Do not reupload this audio onto your channel without permission from me. &amp;#10;-Do not nightcore, or redistribute the audio, lyrics, or art, on youtube or any other website. &amp;#10;-I ask that at this point, there are no MAPs created with this audio. Thanks for understanding!"
