    id 414
    label "ZIfA03VtDa0"
    step 0
    date "2022-02-28T17:00:14Z"
    title "Lost Childhoods - 1 week Children Book Style Warrior Cats PMV MAP CALL CLOSED EDITING"
    description "CW: death and depressing events&amp;#10;We all have some personal and dear children book in mind that really hit us while kids (or we don't, it's ok), those colorful pages with simple and even a bit messy lines telling us a story.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;In the wc books, we see so many stories about kittens learning about the harsh reality that surrounds them. Either fighting against a disease, watching some parent/littermate dying or learning how the clans work. This MAP shows someof these stories of brave kittens like a children book, with a watercolor or chalky/crayon style!&amp;#10;&amp;#10;I hope you like the idea! This MAP also has a differential: 12 random parts will be reserved for animators who have under 1k subs (i know I said in a previous post about 50%, but I see tons of animators with less than 5k subs who are such a great potential so i want to give them the opportunity too)&amp;#10;&amp;#10;This time, I won't host a thumbnail contest. The artist will be chosen by applying for the thumbnail artist option!&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;BIGGEST THANKS FOR MY FRIEND @Demi m0n , who helped me with this MAP call by drawing the hawk and editing the whole MAP call! You are amazing demi s2&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Everything you need: https://docs.google.com/document/d/1YYVcFGG2_DheoKfYQ_QSU9lbfphrax7fkgvH4hliXUE/edit?usp=sharing&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#127853; Discord&amp;#10;&amp;#127850; Wip&amp;#10;&amp;#127846; Finished&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#127846;Thumbnail Artist: LP4ndora&amp;#10;&amp;#127846; Part 1: @GreatSylveon 2007 + Marinin&amp;#10;&amp;#127846; Part 2: TinyWinny&amp;#10;&amp;#127846; Part 3: Martletwing&amp;#10;&amp;#127846;Part 4: Zlobniy Sich&amp;#10;&amp;#127846; Part 5: Selma-Josephine + In-Town&amp;#10;&amp;#127846;Part 6: rainwish -&amp;#10;&amp;#127846;Part 7: Isaika -&amp;#10;&amp;#127846;Part 8: istuez -&amp;#10;&amp;#127846; Part 9: &amp;#54540;&amp;#51596;PLZN&amp;#10;&amp;#127846;Part 10: Ru End Fns_Hope&amp;#10;&amp;#127846;Part 11: Woofzie + JulianOliver &amp;#10;&amp;#127846;Part 12:  fabillusion -&amp;#10;&amp;#127846;Part 13:  Swiflex&amp;#10;&amp;#127846; Part 14: Vibing Lemon&amp;#10;&amp;#127846;Part 15: &amp;#33469;&amp;#31958;Maltose&amp;#10;&amp;#127846;Part 16: kittybee-&amp;#10;&amp;#127846;Part 17: wimfei + Marinin -&amp;#10;&amp;#127846; Part 18: Sauketz -&amp;#10;&amp;#127846; Part 19:  anonx&amp;#10;&amp;#127846;Part 20: shy_chocolate&amp;#10;&amp;#127846;Part 21: melowon_z&amp;#10;&amp;#127846;Part 22: Jayadwal&amp;#10;&amp;#127846;Part 23: Nebula Animates&amp;#10;&amp;#127846;Part 24: Flawiusz-Sama + Marinin&amp;#10;&amp;#127846;Part 25: @Gildedware (aka GildedPhD) &amp;#10;&amp;#127846; Part 26: Corvuskies&amp;#10;&amp;#127846; Part 27: Lemonpie -&amp;#10;&amp;#127846;Part 28: Flamebreeze &amp;#10;&amp;#127846; Part 29: Nex -&amp;#10;&amp;#127846;Part 30: Marinin&amp;#10;&amp;#127846;Part 31: @SplashDreamms &amp;#10;&amp;#127846;Part 32: Llriftenn &amp;#10;&amp;#10;Designs by @Nicksinnombre  and @Nifty-Senpai !!! Amazing inspos of mine, go check on them!&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Song: https://youtu.be/m6XPs_Qs4JQ"
