    title "Warrior Cats: The Clans are a Cult"
    description "Reuploading because I don't know how tags work&amp;#10;My first video in a while and it's not technically made for the warriors fandom. I made this as a class project so there's a lot in here that's just trying to explain quickly what warriors is.&amp;#10;I would love to go into more detail on this theory in the future, like really break down the evidence from the books, but this was definitely fun, and I'd love to hear what people think. Even if you just want to call me an idiot, s'all good!&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Credits:&amp;#10;The Steven Hassan photo is from wikipedia and uses the creative commons license&amp;#10;The art of the book cover 'Into the Wild' is taken from the fan wiki and uses the creative commons license&amp;#10;The Game of Thrones image is from Flikr and uses the creative commons license.&amp;#10;https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/2.0/&amp;#10;&amp;#10;The art from Tennelle Flowers is used with her express permission&amp;#10;https://www.youtube.com/user/SimatraStar&amp;#10;&amp;#10;The channel Telltale was a big inspiration for this video, though he talks about real-world cults&amp;#10;https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCgIi12EA6BQ8HKL8QUccsOQ"
