  [
    id 428
    label "1x9G4MbFspo"
    step 0
    date "2021-07-01T03:45:33Z"
    title "CALL YOU MINE | COMPLETE 96 HOUR WLW WARRIOR CATS MAP"
    description "OH GOSH THIS WAS A RACE AGAINST THE CLOCK TO GET THIS OUT! HAPPY PRIDE MONTH TO EVERYONE WHO&amp;#8217;S STILL IN THE 30TH JUNE TIME ZONE! Even if it&amp;#8217;s not pride month for you guys, it&amp;#8217;s always great to appreciate LGBTQ+ even after the month of June! I would like to thank all the participants for their hard work and dedication to get their parts out so we can complete this masterpiece. This was probably the longest credit sequence I ever made but I decided it fit the MAP as such! It was such a blast to edit this all together, and I do hope everyone will enjoy this project!&amp;#10;EDIT: If you're confused on the art direction of this, please refer to the MAP Call! WLW stands for woman loving woman!&amp;#10;&amp;#10;MAP CALL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=jSmGiM1754w&amp;#10;-----------------------------------------------------&amp;#10;PARTICIPANTS:&amp;#10;INTRO: Kookie Krumblez &amp;#38; Rice Rain &amp;#38; daisyrazors (Hollyleaf x Heathertail) &amp;#10;Part 1: Chrizka (Feathertail x Tawnypelt)&amp;#10;Part 2: pokefan1241  (Frostfur x Yellowfang)&amp;#10;Part 3: Lady Helio (Bluefur x Rosetail)&amp;#10;Part 4: Basil Kat (Squirrelflight x Leafstar)&amp;#10;Part 5: Rivstars (Zelda x Violetshine)&amp;#10;Part 6: BL0SS0M (Bluestar x Goldenflower)&amp;#10;Part 7: mozziiemilk  (Leafpool x Sorreltail)&amp;#10;Part 8: ItsaYsa (Blossomfall x Ivypool)&amp;#10;Part 9: hawky (Cinderheart x Hollyleaf)&amp;#10;Part 10: Fishbreadz (Feathertail x Ferncloud)&amp;#10;Part 11: Caitlyn_Drawz &amp;#38; Tigereyes6302 (Sasha x Feathertail)&amp;#10;Part 12: Caitlyn_Drawz &amp;#38; Tigereyes6302 (Sasha x Feathertail)&amp;#10;Part 13: CryptidBunny (Sasha x Goldenflower x Leopardstar)&amp;#10;Part 14: mozziiemilk (Feathertail x Tawnypelt) &amp;#10;Part 15: TeedA (Brambleberry x Echomist)&amp;#10;Part 16: StarCat (Hollyleaf x Hazeltail)&amp;#10;Part 17: orkestrell (Hollyleaf x Willowshine)&amp;#10;Part 18: StarGeek &amp;#38; ItsaYsa (Leopardstar x Sasha)&amp;#10;Part 19: DaVinci131 ( Bluestar x Yellowfang)&amp;#10;Part 20: Riley (Applefur x Sunstrike)&amp;#10;Part 21: Daisyrazors (Bluefur x Rosetail)&amp;#10;Part 22: Kaiira (Cinderheart x Hollyleaf)&amp;#10;&amp;#10;CREDIT SEQUENCE:&amp;#10;Background Artwork: Lady Callow &amp;#38; Rice Rain&amp;#10;Thumbnail: Autumn Lynx&amp;#10;Fanart: Rice Rain&amp;#10;Designs: Belong to their respective participants&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Dropped participant's storyboards:&amp;#10;Annywu | DaveThyQueen | angrytrollnoises | XxIvystarxX | 23 Xcavat0rrs&amp;#10;&amp;#10;-Song: Call you mine by The chainsmokers ft. Bebe Rexha&amp;#10;-Uncover by Zara Larrson&amp;#10;Pain and sleepless nights? Everyone&amp;#10;Hotel? Trivago&amp;#10;Editing person that died: Me"
