  [
    id 469
    label "p2w4-VRhjxI"
    step 0
    date "2017-02-18T02:59:02Z"
    title " Mothwing. (ORIGINAL WARRIOR CATS SONG)"
    description "&amp;#127925;Download on iTunes &amp;#8594; https://goo.gl/g98eMB&amp;#10;&amp;#127925;Download on Google Play &amp;#8594;  https://goo.gl/rjZgbZ&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Subscribe for more!  &amp;#8594; https://goo.gl/1eqmUj&amp;#10;Twitter  &amp;#8594; https://goo.gl/ZfTYa9&amp;#10;&amp;#10;-----&amp;#10;&amp;#10;A huge thank you to Moonfrost who provided the singing voice of our Mothwing! Make sure you check her channel out!!~&amp;#10;https://www.youtube.com/user/Moonfrost18&amp;#10;&amp;#10;------&amp;#10;&amp;#10;||RULES||&amp;#10;&amp;#10;PLEASE. &amp;#10;-Do not reupload this audio onto your channel without permission from me. &amp;#10;-Do not nightcore, or redistribute the audio, lyrics, or art, on youtube or any other website. &amp;#10;-I ask that at this point, there are no MAPs created with this audio. Thanks for understanding!&amp;#10;&amp;#10;-&amp;#10;&amp;#10;||Credits||&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Visuals/Art/Editing/Instrumental/Lyrics/Mixing&amp;#10;Blixemi&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Mothwing Vocals&amp;#10;Moonfrost18&amp;#10;https://www.youtube.com/user/Moonfrost18&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Warriors/Mothwing/Hawkfrost&amp;#10;Erin Hunter&amp;#10;&amp;#10;-----&amp;#10;&amp;#10;||Social Medias||&amp;#10;&amp;#10;BLIXEMI&amp;#10;Twitter -  https://twitter.com/Blixemi&amp;#10;Deviantart - http://blixemi.deviantart.com/&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Moonfrost18&amp;#10;Twitter - https://twitter.com/TaraPrentice18&amp;#10;&amp;#10;-----&amp;#10;&amp;#10;LYRICS&amp;#10;&amp;#10;All that you hide from me, has now come to the light.&amp;#10;You sit and weave your lies, like a fox trots through the night.&amp;#10;You fight to convince yourself, so your clanmates will believe.&amp;#10;But your words won&amp;#8217;t stick around, they&amp;#8217;re like dead leaves in the breeze.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;I know all the games you play, all the fear you spread around.&amp;#10;You plant your strategies, like seedlings in the ground.&amp;#10;You abused my destiny, my faith has paid the cost.&amp;#10;The chill is creeping in, I can finally see the frost.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;You plan trickery with every breath you breathe.&amp;#10;You weave mystery into your history.&amp;#10;Oh brother can&amp;#8217;t you see, what you&amp;#8217;re doing to me.&amp;#10;&amp;#8216;Cause of you I am lost, because I&amp;#8217;m caught in your frost. &amp;#10;&amp;#10;I put my trust in you, I care more than you know.&amp;#10;My heart is broke in two, as I watch the freezing show.&amp;#10;With every step you take, the ice begins to grow.&amp;#10;You leave a trail of death, misfortune where you go.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Whatever had happened to, the cat you used to be?&amp;#10;Now that he&amp;#8217;s hidden deep, trapped far beneath the freeze.&amp;#10;I know you&amp;#8217;re different now, and my brother is no more.&amp;#10;This is all that&amp;#8217;s left, you&amp;#8217;re frozen straight to the core.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;You plan trickery with every breath you breathe.&amp;#10;You weave mystery into your history.&amp;#10;Oh brother can&amp;#8217;t you see, what you&amp;#8217;re doing to me.&amp;#10;&amp;#8216;cause of you I am lost, because I&amp;#8217;m caught in your frost.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;I never wanted this, this part that I must play.&amp;#10;If Starclan was there at all, they&amp;#8217;d not turn me away.&amp;#10;Now I&amp;#8217;m on my own, and I will pay the cost.&amp;#10;The ice begins to form, now I will  face the frost.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;I&amp;#8217;ll walk without the stars, my path will change tonight.&amp;#10;I&amp;#8217;ll turn my back to you, both stars and blood alike.&amp;#10;I have one chance to take, this is my final shot.&amp;#10;I&amp;#8217;m taking lead tonight, I&amp;#8217;m fighting back the frost.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;You plan trickery with every breath you breathe.&amp;#10;You weave mystery into your history.&amp;#10;Oh brother can&amp;#8217;t you see, what you&amp;#8217;re doing to me.&amp;#10;cause of you I am lost, because I&amp;#8217;m caught in your frost.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;I&amp;#8217;ll plan victory with every breath I breathe.&amp;#10;I&amp;#8217;ll weave mystery into my misery.&amp;#10;Oh brother can&amp;#8217;t you see, how you&amp;#8217;ve empowered me.&amp;#10;Now that you&amp;#8217;re headed to hell, now I can finally melt."
