  [
    id 470
    label "9CJjp-fbBX4"
    step 0
    date "2021-08-23T20:00:11Z"
    title ""
    description "Edit: I am dumb and COMPLETELY left out a thumbnail entry! Please check it out here https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=c4_Z3CN9tyY&amp;#10;&amp;#10;After SEVEN years in the making, I am so proud to finally present: Phoenix! &amp;#10;&amp;#10;Initially hosted by ProbablyAWitch, Phoenix was a MAP with no script nor designs: you just did whatever you felt like doing! &amp;#10;&amp;#10;Rehosted by me on another channel, those rules stayed the same and I managed to get the MAP near halfway to completion. However, a couple of years ago, I got locked out of that old channel. In July of 2021, I reposted this MAP call to get it complete and I'm proud to say it finally is!&amp;#10;&amp;#10;NOTE: Yes, some of these parts are SEVEN years old!! That's a LOT of time to improve! Along with that, some parts contain glitches. These are actually in the parts themselves and/or I could not fix them due to the quality of the part. I refused to kick these people out, however, as their parts were perfectly fine when this MAP was originally hosted! &amp;#10;&amp;#10;Please check out ProbablyAWitch here, despite their channel now being inactive: https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCrPGOUVa39N3ggpJVulbO2g&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Please also check out @Ravenflight who won the thumbnail contest!&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Finally, please check out all of the amazing participants: &amp;#10;&amp;#10;0:00 Intro: SaturnSkyez&amp;#10;[https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCT6s2biqhE9ZzAw4VSE9IEA]&amp;#10;0:15 Part 1: SaturnSkyez&amp;#10;[https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCT6s2biqhE9ZzAw4VSE9IEA]&amp;#10;0:22 Part 2: dead_laurus&amp;#10;[https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCgTZtOwiyhRSB-FDIp6ipmw]&amp;#10;0:30 Part 3: Wolfsbanestar1&amp;#10;[https://www.youtube.com/user/Wolfsbanestar1/featured]&amp;#10;0:36 Part 4 &amp;#38; 5: GoldenSand_YT&amp;#10;[https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCf9VRadXmQoh5cP8oyD_gLA]&amp;#10;0:50 Part 6: fungus &amp;#10;[https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC0gDdbsoUGVRVl36fhrFdJg]&amp;#10;0:58 Part 7: tavifilmsYT&amp;#10;[https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCskxE4a4ggsmmAGwB-EWGcQ]&amp;#10;1:05 Part 8: Tumbleweed&amp;#10;[https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCLpA9Voq0wmkVFCzxTY6x5g&amp;#10;1:13 Part 9: Ravenflight&amp;#10;[https://www.youtube.com/user/katiebryentonrochard]&amp;#10;1:19 Part 10: warrior_cats_animations 1&amp;#10;[https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC_IHZaJS3NUGbZOI3pGtBww]&amp;#10;1:27 Part 11: BL0SS0M&amp;#10;[https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCKCfLebJtBGVNSYdgONeKpw]&amp;#10;1:37 Part 12: Quietheart &amp;#10;[https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCewANqpGRWdGNK-EfqtDF5g]&amp;#10;1:44 Part 13: DRAGONWOLFUK&amp;#10;[https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCwh7RYETE8vYufSkrZNZGqQ]&amp;#10;1:51 Part 14: SATCHI&amp;#10;[https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCEfA1KmwgLXiarkG6BQyKCg]&amp;#10;2:00 Part 15: MlTARAI&amp;#10;[https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCxiQa9v18VrsP1d9E55FQmg]&amp;#10;2:06 Part 16: WidowPawz&amp;#10;[https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCKW8H3A4SzfQ_52SAk_u05A]&amp;#10;2:13 Part 17: Wolfsbanestar1&amp;#10;[https://www.youtube.com/user/Wolfsbanestar1/featured]&amp;#10;2:20 Part 18 &amp;#38; 19: Sparx&amp;#10;[https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCJIjne4GTnDqeOVMAPc21LA/featured]&amp;#10;2:32 Part 20: CRISTHIAN VERA&amp;#10;[https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCBymtFer0-00jRhK4vDWFkA]&amp;#10;2:42 Part 21: Cosmic Ember &amp;#10;[https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCo9M9r8lvaApAHdaNXl7b0A]&amp;#10;2:49 Part 22: Channel Unknown: Could Not Be Found&amp;#10;2:56 Part 23 &amp;#38; 24: Kyo-ufu&amp;#10;[https://www.youtube.com/c/Noyasumin]&amp;#10;3:12 Part 25: Cuteflare&amp;#10;[https://www.youtube.com/user/CuteFlareon]&amp;#10;3:19 Part 26: Safulous&amp;#10;[https://www.youtube.com/user/SilverCatProduction]&amp;#10;3:26 Part 27: SaturnSkyez&amp;#10;[https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCT6s2biqhE9ZzAw4VSE9IEA]&amp;#10;3:33 Part 28: FIRECLAWZ&amp;#10;[https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCQVS4c3XbonMU095Bw4hKyQ]&amp;#10;3:40 Part 29: EeveeIsRed&amp;#10;[https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCTAR9AeUTbiVJJw-afy9IXw]&amp;#10;3:47 Part 30: Raven WildArt&amp;#10;[https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC9IYQ9Bxof3qiNqcYG34T6g]&amp;#10;3:55 Part 31: Dawnasaurz__&amp;#10;[https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCnOT2jv_wvCA5w2Nl7hcEKQ]&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Songs: Phoenix &amp;#38; Immortals (Instrumental): both by Fall Out Boy&amp;#10;&amp;#10;There are many INCREDIBLE designs in this MAP, so let me give credit to those I know are present: CelestialSpice, Sagutoyas, Nifty Senpai, Dawnmist, Feather, Lynxspots, and SaturnSkyez! &amp;#10;&amp;#10;---------------------------&amp;#10;FUN STUFF&amp;#10;&amp;#10;I also post on...&amp;#10;Deviantart: SaturnSkyez&amp;#10;Instagram: Saturnskyez&amp;#10;Twitter: SaturnSkyez&amp;#10;Cat Designs have been made for Labyrinth, DC, Once Upon A Time, Marvel, A Series Of Unfortunate Events, and more coming soon!!&amp;#10;Discord Server: https://discord.gg/jHMQXPg3SZ&amp;#10;YOU DO NOT HAVE MY PERMISSION TO UPLOAD THIS VIDEO ANYWHERE ELSE UNLESS PRIVATELY AGREED UPON.&amp;#10;I AM NOT CURRENTLY ACCEPTING REQUESTS FOR&amp;#10;-COHOSTING&amp;#10;-MAP IDEAS&amp;#10;-MAPS TO JOIN&amp;#10;-THUMBNAILS TO DRAW&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Thank you for understanding and TYSM for watching!"
