    description "&amp;#4326; LIKE, COMMENT, SUBSCRIBE!&amp;#4326; &amp;#10;&amp;#4326; &amp;#4326; Don't Forget To Hit The Notification Bell So You Won't Miss A Video! &amp;#4326; &amp;#4326; &amp;#10;&amp;#10;Its been awhile since I've uploaded, but I do plan to start uploading more again! &amp;#10;&amp;#10;Any cats I choose not to personally keep will be sold on my Toyhouse/DeviantART ! &amp;#10;I had a lot of fun designing these cuties! Very excited to design more of em&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Artist Notes:&amp;#10;&amp;#9733; Swanfoot got into many fights previously, causing him to be scarred and losing his right front leg&amp;#10;&amp;#9733; Gingerear is an angry shortie&amp;#10;&amp;#9733; Beechbriar is a sweet bean, much love&amp;#10;&amp;#9733; Rooknose is a bubbly bean &amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Check out Part 1 !  https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Dakv55wz_vE&amp;#38;t=5s&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Generator Used: https://perchance.org/warrior-cat-clans&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Check out our Twitch! &amp;#10;https://www.twitch.tv/endlesssketch&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#9733; Commissions &amp;#9733;&amp;#10;https://endlesssketch.carrd.co/"
