    date "2022-07-06T17:09:45Z"
    title "Serpent Sol Part 127  Weekend Warrior Cats MAP"
    description "It&amp;#8217;s done! I definitely didn&amp;#8217;t expect it to be so easy to scan in. Did you know that CSP has a &amp;#8220;change value to opacity&amp;#8221; feature? It makes scanning in traditional lineart to color so, so easy. I recommend checking it out if you get the chance.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Anyway, traditionally animating the character was so exciting! I definitely wouldn&amp;#8217;t mind doing more map parts like this at some point. Really allows me to flex my creative muscles. &amp;#10;&amp;#10;If you want to see the WIP, check out the video right before this one on my channel :) it&amp;#8217;s pretty neat.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Finished MAP: TBA&amp;#10;MAP Call (backups open): https://youtu.be/1Yso8mYJnEw&amp;#10;Playlist of Parts: https://youtube.com/playlist?list=PLbSyL5k7nLJjW-c3QpxTI7P-Uo8WY7gsm&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Tools Used: Lightbox + animation paper, CSP EX, After Effects&amp;#10;FPS: 24 (2s, 3s)"
