    description "As you say by the aim of the map is to try and have it looking like the decade of pop. &amp;#10;&amp;#10;Rules&amp;#10;&amp;#10;You can only use warriors cannon characters.&amp;#10;The codeword is Hey!&amp;#10;You can choose ANY song you like as long as its upbeat and SFW. &amp;#10;Request your song choices and characters choices in order for example:&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Name- DizzyJade &amp;#10;Characters- Bluestar, Hollyleaf, Squirrelflight.&amp;#10;Songs- Can't remember to forget you ( Shakira, Rihanna ) Alone pt II ( Ava Max, Alan Walker ) Burn ( Ellie Goulding )&amp;#10;&amp;#10;This would mean that my top character would be Bluestar and my top song would be Cant remember to forget you. &amp;#10;&amp;#10;The parts are unlimited but you have till the 9th August to submit your parts before the MAP closes.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Participants &amp;#10;&amp;#10;DizzyJade? Bluestar Can't remember to forget you.&amp;#10;Dustinnz Tigerstar it's tough to be a god."
